Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大家～
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露～
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,听得到吗～？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露——
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,「空露露」「听得到」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「这样一看，大家都做得很可爱呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「听得到」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.48,0:02:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,「听得到」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,「听到露露」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.47,0:02:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「听得到哦～」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——我的声音和
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,和游戏声音一起，平衡应该没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,「露露收集开始了」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.15,0:02:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「听到了」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,「怎么好像已经有什么开始了w」对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么呢，莉泽大人她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,露出了一副吃惊的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,「总觉得标题听出了别的意思」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:03:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,听出什么别的意思呢？我是不太清楚啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.03,0:03:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,「平衡也没问题——」「看起来没问题」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,「完美！」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,「看起来没问题」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「完美极了」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,「大家好像都在诉说着什么w」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大家，今天是「朋友收集」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.65,0:03:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,心情雀跃的生活 Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,居民们呢，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,像愉快的伙伴们，诶…收集品们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,再重申一次看起来好像是Liver们似的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去好像是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,各位呢，现在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,让她们住在岛上了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,1、2、3、4、5，5个人吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在岛上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,莉、莉泽大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天，不对，不是昨天，是上次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，因为是晚上玩的，所以基本都在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在醒了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.05,0:03:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要发生什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:03:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,诶！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,「在莉泽·赫露艾斯塔的身上发生了什么」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…什、什么啊这是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,刚、刚才那是什么啊w等一下w
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,开场有点，有点没搞懂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,刚、刚才发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.39,0:04:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么刚才？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的是……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,「有什么事吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么事吗？w
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的鸟是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,「我有想问主人的」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好的好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,「最重要的一个挚友」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,「和100个普通朋友」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,「你想要哪种？」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～？那个的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,挚友一个、不需要朋友w
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:04:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,光收藏就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也许也有这样的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一个挚友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,「相伴一生的挚友，很令人憧憬呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不太...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,比起和……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是那种深入
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.27,0:05:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,范围很窄的类型
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「像电车难题一样w」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,因人而异吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不过100人的话，反过来说要怎么联系啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,100人有点太多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,委员长桑，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，身体定住了，稍、稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,来帮来帮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来帮呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来，莉泽大人她……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.11,0:05:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,和委员长桑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:06:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还没吧，大概还没见过面吧，因为……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,被吊着……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「发生什么了？」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.63,0:06:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,「救……」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,请、请救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,「请救…救我」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此，这可是大工程
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这里这样～再那样～
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,「……请手下留情……」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，电池为何
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.27,0:06:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,开始的瞬间就没电了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,委员……长？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人的名字是……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哦……诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好像
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,「这样啊……」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「莉泽·赫露艾斯塔桑……」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好像开始什么了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.23,0:06:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,「哦哦，莉泽·赫露艾斯塔桑……」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.11,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,扑通
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,「一提到莉泽·赫露艾斯塔的名字」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「就会心跳不已」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「这就是所谓的爱情吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不是还刚，那个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不是连自我介绍都还没的阶段吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是你想多了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？也有那种恋爱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.10,0:07:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只是见到别人的脸就，这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的叫什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.60,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那种情况在人间界叫什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,从第一次见面开始
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什、什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什、什么？那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,叫什么来着，恋……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,恋的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不是见过人之后再开始喜欢上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.35,0:07:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,而是第一印象就喜欢上了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,诶一见钟情！对！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是想说那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的一见钟情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然一见钟情了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.95,0:07:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.87,0:07:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「一说出名字就心跳加速，这就是爱情吗？」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,大家，这是爱情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是爱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,错觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「这个让{\alpha&H80&}铃原{\alpha&H00&}我决定吗？」就是啊w
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,说是错觉也有点……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,说是错觉也有点……那就爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,「被莉泽·赫露艾斯塔温柔的眼瞳迷住了」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「本人」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.99,0:08:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,「想和莉泽·赫露艾斯塔交往」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,「每一天都想凝视那双眼睛」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真是彻底迷上了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是一见钟情啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.05,0:08:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次见到，一见钟情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.93,0:08:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是…这就是所谓的一见钟情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,扑通…感觉来了那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，那个手柄……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可以在这个间隙换一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然说间隙，但其实本来也就没什么间隙一说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「想要收藏莉泽大人的眼瞳的意思？！」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:09:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是「眼瞳收集」啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,让大家久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，手柄，不用担心了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,各种各样的事发生的太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,稍、稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然变成了单恋……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.97,0:09:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,「哎呀，稀客啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,「可以的话分给您一些这个」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,「正好，我也想送给您这个」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,「这么贵重的东西，我不能收下啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,到底在哪里买的，有那种东西吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「请分一些我这边的」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,「不不，有很多，请不用客气尽管收下吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,「请别这么说」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多……是生的，没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,收下吧……w
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,开始互相推挽了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？结果怎么样了，折腾那么久……w
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～恋爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:09:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,略微
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,大概就是连距离感都搞不懂的感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，我该怎么办？我当恋爱丘比特就行了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「怎么了吗？」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,「起立！」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.95,0:10:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,「立正！」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,暖乎乎的～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,诶那然后……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一直是这种状态吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,挠挠……挠挠w
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然心上人就在面前，但痒的地方就是痒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,露露没事吗，会变的不想守望、守……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,呃呃会忍不住想守望这两人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在唱歌呢，心情真好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,正在Virtual to LIVE啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.81,0:10:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,相对的莉泽大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,正在看地平线w
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…稍、稍微关注一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等、等一下，拿过去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…该怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看呀，在唱歌呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不顺利呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不过呢，各自都
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,想做的事也
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是有的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说是恋爱，但…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.11,0:11:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,算了算了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,先看看情况
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱捏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.17,0:11:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好像在看着上方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.65,0:11:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是在看我吗？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.80,0:11:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是……怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,「想要能坐着休息的地方……」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,事件？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「能在这附近设置『长椅』吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:11:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,长椅！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,能造还是能买？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哦哦～建起店了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,「虽然很突然」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「现在插播一条新闻速报」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,莉泽新闻的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「有一条令人高兴的消息」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,「终于，在空露露岛上」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,「建岛店开业了」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,「在建岛店里能买到『建筑』、『艺术装置』等」\N是那种能买各种道具的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,「各种各样建岛所需要的东西」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,卡坦岛之类的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「早早的居民们就说」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,艺术装置……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,「『感觉会变成一座很棒的岛』」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「这种呼声很高」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,因为岛上的居民变多了嘛，一开始……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「新闻速报由莉泽·赫露艾斯塔为您播报」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，新闻、店员全都是莉泽大人一个人包办的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在分工了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好，买个长椅试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「欢迎光临」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.35,0:12:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，意外地便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,2500日元的长椅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我买了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「非常感谢」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.48,0:13:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，那个，在莉泽大人所在的那一带
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那个就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.59,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，是这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,放个长椅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,建设
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,「把长椅放在闪烁的框里的你喜欢的位置吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.24,0:13:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,只要在这个里面的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.41,0:13:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那，这边吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「位置朝向之后也可以更改」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「谢谢」\N完成
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,「这样就能休息一下了」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:14:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她会愿意坐下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说，要是坐到长椅上的话，那里就…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,会怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,「MIi马上就坐下了，真开心呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,「像这样放东西，Mii的状态似乎也会逐渐发生变化」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「Mii们住着舒服的岛，注重外观的岛」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,「要建成什么样的岛也由你决定」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,「直到刚才还是个只卖长椅的建岛店」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「但好像又有新商品入库了」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「待会儿去看看吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.65,0:14:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,会卖什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.17,0:14:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，葵酱新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,「现在插播一条新闻速报」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,「有一条令人高兴的消息」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要增加更多的居民
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,「空露露岛又能多住一名居民了」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,又一位，新的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,介绍一位愉快的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,「另外据有关人士所说」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,诶要选谁好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.21,0:14:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,「『居民达到6人的话』」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「『能建岛的事也会变多』」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然已经变得热闹起来了，但还是，还很冷清呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:14:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,「好的」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:15:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「新闻速报，本葵为您播报」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，眼睛闭上的时候果然还是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有点那啥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.79,0:15:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来的话也是没办法就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在扭扭捏捏的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.09,0:15:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,正在眺望……树？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.23,0:15:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好气派的树啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,——月之美兔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，莉泽大人要跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，我本来想请你坐到长椅旁边的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.89,0:15:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「啊……只是想起来就害羞」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,草
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.25,0:15:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？为什么？怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,只是想起来就害羞？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,有点，怎么说呢，稍微...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.38,0:15:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界观里的……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.53,0:15:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,有点言行独特啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.01,0:15:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不仅做了不可思议的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.64,0:15:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，还有奇怪的鸟在上面飞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？是什么呢，想起来就害…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「这个月的目标」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:15:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,目标…什么，运动？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在草里……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,「不插队～」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不插队……ww
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，大概，以我的认知来说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,队伍的话，不会插进来……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,「不说坏话～」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不wwwww坏话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,本月目标里可以写的东西是不说坏话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,莉、莉泽大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.17,0:16:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「不去掰关节～」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,关节www
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,身体嘛，会响的地方就是会响
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.41,0:16:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是，感觉右肩变好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.27,0:16:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,像转肩这样的动作，果然……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.26,0:16:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,「不突然停住～」\N做了会变好的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,突然停下来不太好呢，很危险呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.31,0:16:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,目标是……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会，本月的……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,目标…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「不抱怨吃的～」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不抱怨食物，嘛嘛嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是但是，我觉得长大了吃自己喜欢的就好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有点挑食的印象
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,确实有一点呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,关节就是那个，自己掰手指响的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「不忘记手帕～」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,手帕ww
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还累了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好忙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很忙呢，不过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但是不过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不错呢，像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.66,0:17:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,每月每月的感觉，今年目标什么的也有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，跑起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,忙忙碌碌的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.27,0:17:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉一边说话一边在跑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对，今年的目标什么的，在年末年初的时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.89,0:17:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然会去写的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.39,0:17:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.75,0:17:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这个月的目标呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,立目标什么的，我倒是很少做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也许可以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.09,0:18:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，感觉长椅变多了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还有自动贩卖机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,原～来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,城镇的氛围会变很多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,栅栏有吗栅栏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,为了不让任何人离开这座岛嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,因为很危险嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,护栏……不，还是栅栏更好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,用栅栏围住？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.83,0:18:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,为了不让
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,从空露露岛出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,石…岩石
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,用岩石围起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,南国风情的岛屿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,啊但是有绿意也不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.71,0:19:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,栅栏是什么感觉的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，买xi…买不了，还不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还先算了吧，等钱有余裕一些
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.57,0:19:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,再买各种各样的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,「不用担心，反正也出不去啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.64,0:19:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊，没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.83,0:19:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好……啊，你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「和我一起玩『超UP问答』吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,啊出现了，超UP问答
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.91,0:19:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？是之前玩过的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,「超UP问答」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,超UP问答
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.61,0:19:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,「第一问」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,「这是什么」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,麻将牌…梅干，我觉得不会是梅干呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,惠方卷，好像海苔感
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还真是有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是麻将牌呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是的话这又是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是麻将牌的话，什么，这又是什么牌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很白啊……白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,诶是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,难度是不是有点提升了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.31,0:20:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道，不过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,作为惠方卷来说，总觉得白色部分太白了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种感觉，所以稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就试着选麻将牌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「正确答案是」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「麻将牌！」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「超UP问答」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「第二问」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.95,0:20:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「这又是什么」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.39,0:20:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,「看着像汉字{\alpha&H80&}字牌{\alpha&H00&}」我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,意式奶冻、烤蛑螺……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.83,0:20:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,呃，烤蛑螺是什么样的？到底是什么样的东西啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,意式奶冻
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,意式奶冻我也不太懂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.23,0:20:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,怎会如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.51,0:21:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,意式奶冻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.61,0:21:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,烤蛑螺、意式奶冻有点……正体不明
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,饼干的话，隐隐约约的能看出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这两个搞不清楚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,饼干感……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「竟说像海螺小姐？」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.34,0:21:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,脑袋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.67,0:21:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说是意式奶冻风的话倒是能懂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那就选饼干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.43,0:21:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,颜色总觉得有点……像
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,「正确答案是」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,「意式奶冻」\N饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.68,0:21:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,诶原来意式奶冻是那种布丁一样的感觉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.19,0:21:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.41,0:21:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,「是意式奶冻吗……？」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.24,0:21:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很难啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「真遗憾，这个给你吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.49,0:21:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.47,0:21:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就算弄错了也会给点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,卫生纸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为生活里需要嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,非常的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.08,0:22:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么带着New了，是今天的新东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.21,0:22:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「欢迎光临」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.89,0:22:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「欢迎光临——」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.93,0:22:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,日式土豆炖肉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.98,0:22:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那总之就进点货吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.69,0:22:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对没给到的人还就完全没给到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.50,0:22:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好，买吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.68,0:22:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「非常感谢」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.87,0:22:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一个左右…每个买两个左右比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,「欢迎光临」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.93,0:22:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,也没那么…反正没坏处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,「非常感谢」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,买吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.23,0:22:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有点郁闷了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.96,0:22:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,葵酱，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,「晚上好」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.94,0:22:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露晚上好～
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,「我有想请教的事」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.65,0:22:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,当然，什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.51,0:22:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.27,0:23:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,「主人对什么样的人感兴趣呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,「主人主推的名人，能告诉我一个吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.57,0:23:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,主推的名人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.81,0:23:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,「告诉你」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.89,0:23:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.78,0:23:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,必、必须是名人才行？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.15,0:23:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,主推的名人……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.82,0:23:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,推？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.02,0:23:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,名人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.71,0:23:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？谁…谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,推……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.00,0:23:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，漫画之类的也可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.78,0:23:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,西索之类的……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.52,0:23:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,花京院之类的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.96,0:23:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,倒也可以填
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.43,0:23:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,「原来对人类有兴趣吗……？」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.09,0:23:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那么……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.53,0:23:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,弦一郎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.09,0:23:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,之类的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.87,0:23:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,苇名一心大人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.64,0:23:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,奇犽、尼特罗会长、花京院
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:24:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，红恶魔之类的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.22,0:24:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.22,0:24:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,「有名的推有的吧？」有很多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.13,0:24:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多有的有的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「角色也行」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.49,0:24:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那全职猎人之类的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.26,0:24:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,西索
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.49,0:24:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,话题里全职猎人什么的也聊上了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.22,0:24:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,小弦……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.17,0:24:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是弦一郎…红恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,推……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.28,0:24:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就弦一郎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.91,0:24:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一心大人也可以有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.39,0:24:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不对，打住
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.73,0:24:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.37,0:24:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,范马勇次郎……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.07,0:24:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,范马勇次郎之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.27,0:25:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,范马勇次郎……的话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.03,0:25:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.81,0:25:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就，从话题性来说也
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.64,0:25:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不是会让大家活跃起来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.74,0:25:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.66,0:25:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,勇
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,次郎……会联想吗，范马勇次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.54,0:25:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,勇次
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.63,0:25:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,朗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.12,0:25:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,平假名可以吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.22,0:25:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,范马勇次郎，就这样就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.16,0:25:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,平假名
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.48,0:25:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,用平假名写出来的话，范马勇次郎也有点可爱了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.14,0:25:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,「范马勇次郎」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.50,0:25:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好，就这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.32,0:25:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,「主人也在推范马勇次郎呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.65,0:25:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「食人魔」写成食人魔也不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.95,0:25:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「葵我也有偷偷应援的」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.14,0:25:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,「不是花山薰可以吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.78,0:25:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我纠结了一下是花山薰还是勇次郎，不过还是选了勇次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.36,0:26:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,地上，我暂时把他作为地上最强了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.35,0:26:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.01,0:26:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可以摸
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.40,0:26:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点想处理一下脸部涂装
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.11,0:26:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有它的话，葵酱的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.50,0:26:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就有点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.09,0:26:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要是眼睛睁着就好了呢～
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.53,0:26:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,脸部涂装很难搞
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.64,0:26:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可以送礼物，口头禅
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.64,0:26:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,道具、小个性
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.64,0:26:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,早好～早好～早好～
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.26,0:26:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,头上的向日葵是魅力点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.63,0:26:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,搞问候词吧？嗯，什么好呢？不过……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.42,0:26:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,道具什么的也不错呢，慢跑？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.32,0:26:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,砂槌之类……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,砂槌什么的也有点在意啊……但是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.31,0:26:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,该、该怎么玩呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.09,0:27:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,「请别闭上眼睛」是啊一直睁着眼睛的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.23,0:27:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就感觉很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.44,0:27:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,早好…还是问候词吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.21,0:27:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.88,0:27:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,打招呼很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.30,0:27:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,用「早好」吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.77,0:27:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,早好～
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.25,0:27:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,波…是这个呢～
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.75,0:27:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,早好～
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.32,0:27:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.94,0:27:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.03,0:27:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,「早好～」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.63,0:27:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,设置的再长一些就有点那个了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,太长了，对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.93,0:28:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就用「早好～」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.56,0:28:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.94,0:28:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好，口头禅～
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.53,0:28:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.78,0:28:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,「早好～」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.05,0:28:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不错
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.42,0:28:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,「真是很棒的口头禅呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.97,0:28:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.31,0:28:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.25,0:28:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有困扰来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.87,0:28:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,「在团队中，为了不让有人被孤立」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.01,0:28:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,「我特别注意这方面」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.11,0:28:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,特别会考量别人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.16,0:28:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是那种会为周围人着想的性格，对吧，那个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.61,0:28:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,总是保持笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.53,0:28:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因为就是这样的感觉嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.03,0:28:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，西西酱呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.87,0:28:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,正在郁闷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.40,0:28:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「早安椎名～」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.83,0:28:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,早安椎名～
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.96,0:28:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,「我在思考大人的魅力……」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.77,0:28:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,大人的魅力……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.41,0:28:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,「想要看起来更成熟的衣服」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.67,0:29:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此，衣服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.75,0:29:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，那我去买吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.12,0:29:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,成熟，成熟魅力的穿搭到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.93,0:29:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,家居服……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.09,0:29:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉多了好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.53,0:29:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始没有这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.78,0:29:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有像制服的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.35,0:29:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有贝雷帽之类的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.97,0:29:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,荷叶边头饰……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.03,0:29:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，如果有头饰的话
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.86,0:29:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,床酱之类的，感觉也可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.78,0:29:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……成熟一点的…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.05,0:29:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.44,0:29:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.74,0:29:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,成熟风
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.17,0:29:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,成熟的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.29,0:29:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,女性的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.45,0:29:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,该买整套还是分开买呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.45,0:30:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这边有点不一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.47,0:30:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.42,0:30:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱系……和
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.75,0:30:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.76,0:30:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑之类的也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.11,0:30:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,寿司里的金枪鱼？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.75,0:30:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,今日特选
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.22,0:30:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不过今日特选啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.25,0:30:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个好呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.48,0:30:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,成熟又可爱的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.58,0:30:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这个怎么样？感觉，季节有点...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.59,0:30:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有点冬…这个也很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.93,0:30:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉……很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.71,0:30:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,像这边之类的…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.45,0:30:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这个感觉也很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.53,0:30:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就选这个吧～
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.02,0:31:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,颜色嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.65,0:31:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，感觉这个颜色莫名不错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.26,0:31:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我想试着把这个当礼物送出去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.97,0:31:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,呃，把这个
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.85,0:31:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,交出去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.93,0:31:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,应该会合适，大概
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.13,0:31:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好可爱～
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.50,0:31:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,果然很合适～超可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.15,0:31:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很合适很合适
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.27,0:31:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？这也太合适了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.82,0:31:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,「虽然有点冬天的感觉」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.92,0:31:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「已经5月了啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.17,0:31:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,算了算了，只要可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.78,0:31:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不是有句话叫时尚就是要忍耐嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.44,0:31:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得准没错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.32,0:31:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好，说起来，先
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.14,0:31:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都有打招呼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.62,0:31:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,像莉泽大人，大概马上就会睡着了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.46,0:31:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.59,0:31:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,新的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.77,0:31:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,「我们是初次见面吧？」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.09,0:31:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是初次见面啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.06,0:31:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「葵我叫本葵」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.55,0:31:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,「你好，本葵桑」\N能好好相处吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.44,0:32:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,「我叫莉泽·赫露艾斯塔」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.22,0:32:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那个……和空露露，没能搞好关系呢，一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.17,0:32:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有点想挽回啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.02,0:32:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs20}「本葵好像想讲『昨天知道的恐怖传闻』」\N{\fs25}恐怖传闻……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.43,0:32:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,诶有点在意
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.29,0:32:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,会是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.86,0:32:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,和莉泽大人讲这种东西，能行的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.77,0:32:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…能行
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.09,0:32:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好像合得来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.10,0:32:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,啊不错呢不错呢，感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.05,0:32:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,与之相对，空露露
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.29,0:32:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,请空露露反省一下w
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.35,0:32:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,呃——
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.22,0:32:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？西西酱和委员长……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.19,0:32:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，我在睡觉，真意外
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.26,0:32:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好，那就来做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.74,0:32:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,继续添加吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.84,0:32:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.89,0:32:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,新的居民
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.60,0:32:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,继续添加
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.15,0:32:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢……总之基底先
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.95,0:32:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.69,0:33:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——好难抉择
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.46,0:33:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,「决定好做谁了吗？」
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.93,0:33:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不，如果按上次说过的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.02,0:33:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那就，最近联动过的……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.76,0:33:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,从她们开始虽然也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.61,0:33:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.18,0:33:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还有克莱尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.70,0:33:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,德比大人的话听说有宠物系统
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.77,0:33:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就用那个做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.35,0:33:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔，稍微捏一个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.55,0:33:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.23,0:33:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,做、做做看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.10,0:33:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.89,0:33:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,首先基底，让头、脸更显眼一点
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.77,0:33:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,眉毛呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.30,0:33:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这个感觉最
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.26,0:33:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,容易做
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:34:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,「是宠物呢」「德比大人{\alpha&H80&}被当{\alpha&H00&}宠物{\alpha&H80&}对待了{\alpha&H00&}」
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.47,0:34:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,其实像这样说也有些语病
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.37,0:34:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,再往上一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.59,0:34:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.80,0:34:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有点太低了？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.02,0:34:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,再一点点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.32,0:34:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等呢，先把鼻子去掉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.82,0:34:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.42,0:34:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.84,0:34:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,地方开始
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.60,0:34:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……那
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.45,0:34:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,闭着的嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.92,0:34:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得大家……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.45,0:34:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不知不觉老是把嘴闭紧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.79,0:34:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉还要更有存在感一点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.74,0:34:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,硬要说的话，是这边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.37,0:34:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是这边
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.40,0:34:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,然后鼻子等下再说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.26,0:35:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不过感觉还挺好做的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.27,0:35:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,基础……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.02,0:35:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.56,0:35:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,脸再稍微…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.51,0:35:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,整体更好认的比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.84,0:35:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,结果还是这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.49,0:35:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.45,0:35:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,脸有点模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.21,0:35:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是从这里开始做最
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.23,0:35:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,做的最像吧，最近总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.07,0:35:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.69,0:35:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,褐色的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.66,0:35:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「暂时波鲁纳雷夫」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.33,0:35:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对，暂时先波鲁纳雷夫
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.31,0:36:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是这附近的色调
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.61,0:36:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.54,0:36:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,说是榛色可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.30,0:36:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔的…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.49,0:36:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,眼瞳的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.26,0:36:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,色调
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.72,0:36:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是这一块呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.64,0:36:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那么用这个……继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.35,0:36:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.14,0:36:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这边吗，就先这样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.36,0:36:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.94,0:36:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微分开一点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.70,0:36:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还有没有其它像的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.51,0:36:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,用这个做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.22,0:36:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,最终的来说
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.13,0:36:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,会更像
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.79,0:36:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是到最终来说
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.39,0:37:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,调细一点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.36,0:37:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么w
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.43,0:37:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,还没呢，现在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.87,0:37:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,完全
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.02,0:37:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,可能还不像吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.61,0:37:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,之后才，从画脸
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.96,0:37:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,才开始
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.52,0:37:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.14,0:37:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有点微妙
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.01,0:37:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.33,0:37:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能调的话，真想调一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.07,0:37:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,基础部分
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.50,0:37:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.74,0:37:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,画脸很重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.39,0:37:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「等一下，你在做谁？」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.95,0:37:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍微猜猜看…啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.05,0:37:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,早知道这样做就好了，先不说在做谁
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.88,0:37:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那种「猜猜看」的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.59,0:37:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这样做也许更好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.87,0:37:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微有点看的出来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.97,0:37:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.45,0:37:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,再往下一点吗，眼睛的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.84,0:38:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这一角度
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.06,0:38:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,来说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.33,0:38:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就这种程度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.90,0:38:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,也许再大一点也好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.47,0:38:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，眉毛再往下一点比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.45,0:38:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,基底可能做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.73,0:38:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,基底做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.43,0:38:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.30,0:38:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.24,0:38:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,最小的是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.74,0:38:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，可能有点像
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.96,0:38:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就已经
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.98,0:38:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有点像了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.69,0:39:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不，是要垂眉的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.14,0:39:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,连这个色调都改掉的话就完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.80,0:39:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,诶这不是已经能看出来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.72,0:39:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,像吧「这谁啊」w
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.88,0:39:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,诶果然脸能稍微通融一下的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.97,0:39:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，发型
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.64,0:39:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还不对
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.82,0:39:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然说现在在做谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.39,0:39:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,发色改掉的话，感觉就会一口气变像了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.54,0:39:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.93,0:39:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还在想这个颜色应该挺像的，挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.63,0:39:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，已经一模一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,相当
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.97,0:39:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,相当像了。接下来是…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.88,0:39:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,鬓角的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.50,0:39:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,用涂装补上的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.53,0:39:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是完美了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.36,0:40:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等，再一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.77,0:40:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是这边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.40,0:40:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「知道了！是波鲁纳雷夫！」
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.88,0:40:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,把头发弄成这边的话，就完全不可能是波鲁纳雷夫了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.65,0:40:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,「已经很像了」
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.90,0:40:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.94,0:40:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错，感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.08,0:40:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,首先，头发旁边的部分，这里……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.58,0:40:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.37,0:40:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,话说我……是怎么弄得来着
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.21,0:40:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,之前是用单色涂的吧，我记得
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.58,0:40:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没有耳朵～没有耳朵呢～
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.75,0:40:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,得把耳朵做出来才行
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.70,0:41:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,刘海的话，要说细节的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.92,0:41:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,中间其实稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.73,0:41:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,张开一道大口子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.75,0:41:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是裂开的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.71,0:41:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,中间
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.17,0:41:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,话说有点…耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.90,0:41:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,想要装上去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.17,0:41:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有这么长呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.88,0:41:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这么长吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.55,0:41:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉长度大概这么长
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.11,0:42:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,涂上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.71,0:42:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那些微妙溢出来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.86,0:42:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,之后再处理也没关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.87,0:42:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,「克莱尔的弟弟？」w
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.07,0:42:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，这边…啊，真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.39,0:42:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.70,0:42:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没连上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.37,0:42:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,线条虽然乱七八糟，但之后…擦掉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.64,0:42:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会变得不错呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.99,0:42:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.23,0:42:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这种感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.72,0:42:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没这么向内吧，完全没有
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.60,0:42:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没那么……不到这么里面
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.27,0:43:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这种程度吧，硬要说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.05,0:43:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像是这种感觉的感觉的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.07,0:43:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不过也许……可能很容易做……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.88,0:43:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,因为已经很像了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.43,0:43:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,基底
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.73,0:43:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,意外的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.54,0:43:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,发色吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.61,0:43:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.88,0:44:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,像是这种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.06,0:44:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像是那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.03,0:44:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,要扣细节的说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.37,0:44:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这里……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.51,0:44:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,中间
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.15,0:44:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然实际上是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.49,0:44:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这，应该是这种感觉的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.08,0:44:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那边也只能妥协了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.56,0:44:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,算是妥协点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.47,0:44:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,细节部分就很难搞了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.84,0:44:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,弄成黑色的…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.40,0:44:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，鼻子的部分和
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.88,0:45:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,调小一点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.23,0:45:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.76,0:45:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就点一下的那种感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.15,0:45:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来腮红也没弄上去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.21,0:45:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然感觉还是有点欠缺…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.91,0:45:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,「如果太在意细节的话，就得从头开始做了哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.61,0:46:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.60,0:46:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,其实双眼皮也
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.00,0:46:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.33,0:46:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.28,0:46:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.24,0:46:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「图层前置」这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.90,0:46:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这个到笑的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.18,0:46:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,大概会变得很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.23,0:46:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,睫毛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.13,0:46:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,睫毛叠上去比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.21,0:46:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等，基底先这样
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.11,0:47:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.21,0:47:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,腮红和
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.77,0:47:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.06,0:47:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微调一下比较好的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.23,0:47:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微把粉色调浅点
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.73,0:47:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始我觉得还挺像的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.60,0:47:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,意外的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.65,0:47:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.57,0:47:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.98,0:47:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，眼睛不一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.57,0:47:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「要装上耳朵吗」装吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.30,0:47:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没那么大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.88,0:47:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不对
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.97,0:48:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.58,0:48:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,无法否认
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.60,0:48:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是嘴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.58,0:48:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,可能再下一点
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.26,0:48:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是位置再往下一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.95,0:48:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,睫毛再稍微小一点
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.43,0:48:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,下睫毛……
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.67,0:48:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,太大了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.42,0:48:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是这里加上睫毛比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.79,0:48:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,先把涂装……擦掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.88,0:48:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这样一来的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.90,0:49:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,腮红的位置也是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.28,0:49:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不把它挪开不行不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.08,0:49:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,诶但是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.26,0:49:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就像刘海一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.30,0:49:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是没有这种感觉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.02,0:49:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔桑好像不是垂眼
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.71,0:49:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是再稍微吊眼梢一点比较好呢？那样的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.72,0:49:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.39,0:49:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，整体…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.91,0:49:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,会动到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.47,0:49:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～但、但感觉不是这个…的感觉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.90,0:49:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,锐利感稍微有点强……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.87,0:49:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.66,0:49:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要说哪个的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.69,0:49:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是这边
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.96,0:49:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还要再像猫一点呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.60,0:50:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,吊眼梢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.74,0:50:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现在那个，应该叫宣材照片还是什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.80,0:50:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,官方……
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.08,0:50:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,商店的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.03,0:50:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔大人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.53,0:50:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在看着
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.43,0:50:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还有鬓角这里，还要再短一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.01,0:50:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦，我正在看的图片是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.70,0:50:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有点
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.11,0:50:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那个从表情上来说
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.78,0:50:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.47,0:50:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.11,0:50:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,眉毛的位置再稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.73,0:51:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话眉毛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.13,0:51:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,看的照片不同，感觉会差很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.90,0:51:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有那种温柔的印象
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.00,0:51:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有着温暖柔和的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.09,0:51:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就调了那个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.64,0:51:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.73,0:51:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.06,0:51:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这……边？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.96,0:51:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.65,0:51:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,线调细一些
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.46,0:52:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是这边更像一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.22,0:52:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.40,0:52:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「有点辣妹」
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.21,0:52:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,「可爱倒是可爱的……」
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.06,0:52:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，刚才那个是不是更像一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.23,0:52:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有点迷茫了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.63,0:52:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是头发吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.19,0:52:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不对眉毛也完全不对
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.34,0:52:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.29,0:52:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地有点难呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.18,0:52:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下，暂时先
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.89,0:52:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,弄成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.00,0:52:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,涂装先
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.85,0:53:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,去擦掉
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.42,0:53:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,失误了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.15,0:53:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.17,0:53:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那个也会被擦掉
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.00,0:53:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那就先全擦掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.80,0:53:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.41,0:53:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.65,0:53:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像又有点像啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.21,0:53:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,眉毛没下垂那么多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.10,0:53:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,「辣妹克莱尔也善」
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.43,0:53:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这种感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.47,0:53:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有辣妹感吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.63,0:53:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有点像辣妹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.84,0:53:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等，腮红……是不是太浓了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.49,0:54:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是该再淡一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.31,0:54:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,眉毛意外的粗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.13,0:54:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是这种感觉吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.44,0:54:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,基底是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.71,0:54:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的感觉也是要画上去的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.04,0:54:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,话说睫毛的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.43,0:54:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那个有点向下的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.44,0:54:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.35,0:55:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.43,0:55:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.03,0:55:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这种感觉……吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.42,0:55:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可能就看涂装如何了？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.82,0:55:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,刘海稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.98,0:55:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.24,0:55:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.53,0:55:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,做出来更好的话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.90,0:56:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个又很难呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.28,0:56:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这种感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.91,0:56:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉又有点太吊眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.62,0:56:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,线画不直呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.31,0:56:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不过差不多就行，就是想稍微抓住那种印象
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.65,0:57:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这边不对呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.70,0:57:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,从这…开始
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.46,0:57:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…单论印象应该就是这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.08,0:57:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,睫毛的量怎么都…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.55,0:57:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样都少了一些
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.18,0:57:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真难啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.51,0:57:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,大概、大概就是这种感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.33,0:58:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,要涂满吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.54,0:58:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微，总觉得……眼睛好像也不太对
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.52,0:58:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,绕晕了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.81,0:58:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,「氛围感出来了」
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.73,0:58:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,像？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.10,0:58:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.88,0:58:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.28,0:59:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有点像了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.65,0:59:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,「刘海真的很重要啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.97,0:59:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，刘海确实非常重要
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.02,0:59:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一个分叉不同
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.00,0:59:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就会变化很大
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.02,0:59:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,啊但是，是不是稍微有点像了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.10,0:59:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真的稍微有点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.05,0:59:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,像
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.03,0:59:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.95,0:59:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.74,0:59:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微叠一点的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.66,0:59:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要再长一点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.15,1:00:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,再……稍微长一点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.57,1:00:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.25,1:00:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得没有……
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.15,1:00:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那么的毛糙
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.39,1:01:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没那么靠内…可能
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.45,1:01:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好难搞～呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.20,1:01:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,难搞～呢～
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.21,1:01:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为意外地挺好做的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.92,1:01:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有那种事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.15,1:01:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也没那么……吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.02,1:01:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,角膜再黑一点的话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.41,1:01:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉会变得更像克莱尔小姐了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.77,1:01:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,角膜……
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.93,1:02:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.60,1:02:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不过感觉还是有点像的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.83,1:02:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,「用『ノ』的话会简单一些」
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.31,1:02:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思啊，用「ノ」是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.82,1:02:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,「ノ」字……
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.03,1:02:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没那么宽吧……
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.29,1:02:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微长了点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.32,1:03:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,剪了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.29,1:03:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,文字印章吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.55,1:03:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,「这从侧面看的话不会变秃子吗」
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.98,1:03:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会看见哦……稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.26,1:03:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,触角还要稍微……
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.71,1:03:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不太一样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.94,1:03:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,也许还需要再直一点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.47,1:04:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这种程度
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.73,1:04:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,用橡皮擦擦出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.31,1:04:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.47,1:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,呀……头发的触角真难把握
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.19,1:04:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不过大体就是这种感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.89,1:04:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「戴上帽子就是克莱尔桑了」
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.84,1:04:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……说的是呢，有点露出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.16,1:05:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,露出来了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.23,1:05:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有点变形了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.45,1:05:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有点可惜呢——
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.34,1:05:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微的感觉……
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.46,1:05:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还差一点点…有这种感觉啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.22,1:05:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.30,1:05:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,变得像冠冕一样了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.70,1:05:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里不一样？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.19,1:05:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.24,1:05:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.20,1:05:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.18,1:05:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什么不一样？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.11,1:05:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,修女的...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.05,1:06:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,帽子？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.26,1:06:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有帽子的话，会不会好点呢……
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.89,1:06:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,鬓角再稍微短一点？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.69,1:06:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得，好像不太对...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.30,1:06:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有这样的感觉……
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.68,1:06:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,具体哪里不一样我也说不上来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.04,1:06:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里不一样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.47,1:06:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这种程度？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.66,1:06:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛的颜色之类…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.03,1:06:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,睫毛也画的不是很多
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.34,1:06:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.13,1:07:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,把睫毛
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.07,1:07:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,变多
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.12,1:07:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不过这样好像也有点像
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.75,1:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个有点像
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.23,1:07:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话显的相似了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.72,1:07:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我觉得还是不要这个比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.99,1:08:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没有这个比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.35,1:08:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——……
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.46,1:08:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,大致的有点像了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.33,1:08:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,下面好像不要比较好，下睫毛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.59,1:08:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.39,1:08:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,三个……三根……
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.43,1:08:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有的话……哦…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.73,1:08:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,会比较好吗？还是说？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.41,1:08:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得还是有睫毛比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.18,1:08:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,下睫毛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.03,1:08:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.05,1:09:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像差不多是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.99,1:09:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛再暗一点可能也可以
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.06,1:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,颜色的话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.18,1:09:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.65,1:09:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这样差不多？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.92,1:09:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还是这边？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.43,1:09:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这种程度吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.18,1:09:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像是这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.25,1:10:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,把笔再调细一点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.04,1:10:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没开这么大吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.99,1:10:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这边再稍微...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.90,1:11:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,会怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.89,1:11:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是这种感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.03,1:11:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不如说还要再长一点吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.46,1:11:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.55,1:11:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，可能很像
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.19,1:11:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也许很像？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.80,1:12:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.57,1:12:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.21,1:12:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.77,1:12:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,其实呢，像这样…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.32,1:13:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,画上会更像吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.45,1:13:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但画的多会很麻烦吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.56,1:13:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.75,1:13:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就一般的……这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.44,1:13:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,因为颜色只用了一种，所以大概
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.96,1:13:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不太像吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.45,1:13:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.80,1:14:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还算…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.83,1:14:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,应该挺像的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.65,1:14:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,「该在哪里开始妥协呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.84,1:14:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是……呢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.83,1:14:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,之后就要看发型了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.24,1:14:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.86,1:14:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然稍微有点悬空
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.84,1:14:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但感觉也不错
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.90,1:14:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不，但是
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.18,1:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,鬓角变得有点太长了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.36,1:14:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,从侧面看的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.53,1:14:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很离谱…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.52,1:14:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不过有点像发箍
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.66,1:14:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.19,1:14:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真的有发箍吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.16,1:15:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,「啊啊，不能从侧面看」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.65,1:15:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，侧面的话…不行呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.61,1:15:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,「秃头ww」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.66,1:15:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢，这个现象
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.28,1:15:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.11,1:15:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么感觉已经
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.07,1:15:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没有办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.38,1:15:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只要正面好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.63,1:15:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.27,1:15:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,还算是
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.03,1:15:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,脸的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.80,1:15:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉已经抓住特征了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.73,1:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.96,1:15:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一眼看过去……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.82,1:15:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.61,1:15:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.38,1:16:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.96,1:16:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,反过来眼睛再…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.85,1:16:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,试着调大一些
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.51,1:16:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,为了平衡...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.50,1:16:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我把眼睛放大了一点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.08,1:16:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.31,1:16:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这样会不会好一点？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.47,1:16:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「可能大些比较好」是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.03,1:16:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这种感觉？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.24,1:16:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「眉毛的粗细之类的」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.84,1:17:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,眉毛再粗的话，大概真的要变浓粗眉了……吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.65,1:17:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,都溢出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.53,1:17:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,眉毛的……
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.33,1:17:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,啊但是
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.89,1:17:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.16,1:17:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,程度吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.53,1:17:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉还是有点像的……
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.08,1:17:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.58,1:17:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时先
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.94,1:17:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.70,1:17:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「稍微抽象变形一点也可以？」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.99,1:17:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,「睡衣空露露草」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.48,1:17:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露睡着了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.51,1:17:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好，然后
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.19,1:17:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢…因为是150高
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.08,1:17:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,委员长……
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.28,1:17:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,和她差不多
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.16,1:18:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.48,1:18:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,比委员长稍微低一点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.47,1:18:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多这样吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.90,1:18:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.89,1:18:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔桑……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.60,1:18:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,修女克莱尔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.08,1:18:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,修女…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.62,1:18:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,修女
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.77,1:18:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,KA、KI、KU……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.14,1:18:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,RE、RE……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.41,1:18:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,因为莉泽·赫露艾斯塔就用了莉泽·赫露艾斯塔…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.36,1:18:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔桑也可以用全名吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.09,1:18:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,RA、RI、RU、RE……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.56,1:18:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.26,1:18:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,修女克莱尔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.13,1:18:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「我的名字是」
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.58,1:19:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「修女克莱尔」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.53,1:19:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.95,1:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，设置成取向全能
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.25,1:19:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.54,1:19:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,10月4日，OK
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.63,1:19:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,「我」……应该用「我」吧……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.35,1:19:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,「我」、应该用「我」吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.50,1:19:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,用「我」……对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.36,1:19:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,「我的名字是」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.85,1:19:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,「修女克莱尔」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.39,1:19:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字…是该用「我」呢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.83,1:19:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉很合适
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.63,1:19:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.29,1:19:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在自定义里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.40,1:19:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,说话速度的话，感觉偏悠闲
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.69,1:19:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉，声音真的非常……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.54,1:20:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好听、清澈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.35,1:20:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来有点慢悠悠的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.02,1:20:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上应该是怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.29,1:20:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.53,1:20:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,「我觉得是不快的」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.15,1:20:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢……
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.29,1:20:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一般水平吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.64,1:20:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.61,1:20:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,从音高上来说的话……
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.43,1:20:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再悠闲一点
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.56,1:21:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,再低一点，完全……
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.12,1:21:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,诶应该什么程度呢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.10,1:21:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.86,1:21:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「再低一点」？不是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.78,1:21:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.44,1:21:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,会有点机器人的感觉呢，声音调细的话
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.16,1:21:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,会迷茫呢，就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.90,1:21:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没有{\alpha&H80&}现实世界的修女克莱尔的家人亲戚在岛上{\alpha&H00&}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.96,1:21:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,行动模式上
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.19,1:22:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,比起利落干脆，更偏向于慢条斯理吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.65,1:22:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的印象
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.05,1:22:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,说话方式非常
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.13,1:22:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,温柔
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.13,1:22:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.26,1:22:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,干脆，硬要说的话也有这种印象
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.53,1:22:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但果然还是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.96,1:22:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是给人很柔软的印象的人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.33,1:22:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,说话…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.66,1:22:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,说话方式也觉得很温柔
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.36,1:22:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,表情也很丰富…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.27,1:22:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这种程度吧，认真
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.07,1:22:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为是个认真的…人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.95,1:22:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,随性，虽说感觉也有随性的一面……
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.10,1:22:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,还是挺认真的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.08,1:22:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,说到底，常识人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.82,1:22:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说有常识人的印象
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.62,1:22:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.00,1:22:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.14,1:22:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是个有个性的人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.29,1:23:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但硬要说的话应该定位在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.65,1:23:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这种程度
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.54,1:23:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉设置的还挺靠常识人的……
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.91,1:23:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,相当的……那个
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.51,1:23:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,非常常识人的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.02,1:23:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去是这样的，但个性又
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.32,1:23:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,若隐若现的一样
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.23,1:23:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有这样的印象呢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.57,1:23:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是这种感觉吧？不过嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.58,1:23:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还是设置成偏常识人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.20,1:23:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,个性常识常识个性个性这样的……
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.21,1:23:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这种感觉的……
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.84,1:23:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我对她的印象呢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.17,1:23:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我记忆里的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.87,1:23:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,从我的，主观来看
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.80,1:23:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好，那么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.85,1:23:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样先来做个性格诊断吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.78,1:23:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.84,1:23:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不过好像有点像呢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.51,1:23:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这样看的话
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.09,1:24:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,「温和系」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.63,1:24:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？怎么好像
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.44,1:24:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,「温暖型」和我一样
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.40,1:24:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,「我行我素、天真细腻、坦率」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.14,1:24:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,「体贴周到、对大家都很温柔」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.58,1:24:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,「温暖型 会察言观色」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.16,1:24:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「和大家和睦相处为第一，因为不会怀疑别人所以别被骗」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.52,1:24:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别被骗啊——克莱尔桑——
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.57,1:24:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一样呢，和我
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.45,1:24:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,类型一样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.78,1:24:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么好像是个孤岛
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.94,1:24:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那边好像……想要靠近的话要怎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.38,1:24:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,「主人」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.14,1:24:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,「对吗」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.47,1:24:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「初次见面，我是」\N稍微有点罪恶感呢……叫主人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.84,1:24:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「修女克莱尔」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.89,1:24:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,「我是温和系温暖型」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.91,1:24:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,「经常被人说会察言观色」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.93,1:24:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎相像……
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.30,1:24:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,眼瞳还要更黑一点吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.39,1:24:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,「请多指教」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.27,1:24:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始这么觉得了，眼瞳
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.15,1:24:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,可能有点太浅了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.09,1:25:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.76,1:25:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么调呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.81,1:25:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，编辑
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.40,1:25:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,果然眼瞳的颜色什么的…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.90,1:25:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不太对
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.22,1:25:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不，虽然从这里看感觉挺好的……
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.03,1:25:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,再暗一点…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.42,1:25:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这种
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.23,1:25:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个颜色吗？稍等一下，暂时先
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.96,1:25:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在这个房间里看起来很亮呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.53,1:25:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,还得再黑吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.31,1:25:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,眼瞳的颜色也是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.25,1:25:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,人类眼睛的颜色
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.02,1:25:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在明亮的地方看，会显得浅
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.72,1:25:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在暗的地方看的话
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.27,1:26:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来比较黑嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.95,1:26:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,多少有点…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.07,1:26:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.35,1:26:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啊但是
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.80,1:26:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.17,1:26:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,还是刚才更好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.50,1:26:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,「房间色调太黄就是这样的」
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.78,1:26:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可能只是因为这个才看上去这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.41,1:26:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的可能更好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.95,1:26:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛也是偏柔和的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.87,1:26:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,要是能做出渐变就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.22,1:26:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,然后请稍等一下，可以稍等片刻吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.62,1:26:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我要去拿饮料，请稍等片刻
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.71,1:28:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了～
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.24,1:28:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让您久等了～嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.55,1:28:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.28,1:28:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.23,1:28:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「欢迎回来～」我回力
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.29,1:28:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,瞳孔的颜色是…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.50,1:28:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,相当
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.96,1:28:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有难度呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.10,1:28:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得，这边看到的眼瞳
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.11,1:28:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,和那个房间里看到的眼瞳…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.92,1:28:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有点不一样…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.64,1:29:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.89,1:29:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.32,1:29:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，好像
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.86,1:29:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可能这边更像一点
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.27,1:29:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……↓……↑…………
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.94,1:29:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不太清楚了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.72,1:29:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是个人喜好了吧，这个是…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.82,1:29:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,「经常被说是容易懂的家伙」
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.28,1:29:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,容易懂的家伙w
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.42,1:29:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不过确实有不擅长撒谎的印象……w
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.12,1:29:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,比起说容易懂…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.69,1:29:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么办啊，那个
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.37,1:29:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,有点孤岛吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.05,1:29:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「诶？」
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.61,1:29:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「这个房子，被大海包围着呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.23,1:29:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,「这样下去的话，就去不了大家那里了」
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.67,1:29:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.77,1:29:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「做『地面』把旁边的岛连接起来吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.59,1:29:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么做啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.31,1:29:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,按X建岛
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.87,1:30:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,「请选择草坪」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.77,1:30:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,「因为是第一次，所以先决定好位置」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.68,1:30:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,「在闪烁的框里放置草坪，把地面连接起来吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.33,1:30:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哦——
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.61,1:30:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,连上了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.92,1:30:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,「太棒了！！」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.63,1:30:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？那再弄一点……
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.95,1:30:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,弄广一些……啊不行啊，是教程
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.76,1:30:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,「开始Pokopia了」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.76,1:30:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,确实，开始建造陆地
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.78,1:30:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「像这样想连接岛屿，或者土地不够的时候，可以填海造地」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.63,1:30:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,「也就是说填海造路让岛屿变大的话」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.91,1:30:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,「就能让更多的Mii入住！」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.58,1:30:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此，只要做出巨大的岛就行了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.68,1:30:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,「插播一条新闻」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.39,1:30:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，空露露新闻
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.03,1:31:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,涂装…好粗糙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.93,1:31:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,「有一条令人高兴的消息」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.38,1:31:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我那个真的好粗糙呢
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.71,1:31:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,「终于，空露露岛」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.09,1:31:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,「能够不断引入居民」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.30,1:31:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，不过感觉，好像有点像有点像
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.55,1:31:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,「居民们表示『想要找结婚对象』」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.01,1:31:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,「『想要和朋友同居』」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.44,1:31:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「期待着人口的增加」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.53,1:31:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只要在脸上画涂装就会这样呢……
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.93,1:31:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「新闻速报，空露露为您播报」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.25,1:31:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.46,1:31:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「刚才，提到『结婚』和『同居』了呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.01,1:31:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,「Mii们结婚，或者和朋友关系变好，就可能会一起住」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.44,1:31:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,「现在各自独居的Mii们」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.73,1:31:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,「如果住在同一个家里会怎么样呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.52,1:31:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,「让在意的两个人和睦相处，引导他们住在同一个屋檐下」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.56,1:31:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,「这种玩法也很推荐哦」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.66,1:31:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,「主人，能稍微打扰一下吗？」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.90,1:31:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「Mii们似乎是孩子之间、大人之间都会恋爱的样子」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.33,1:31:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,「今后如果Mii来找你商量，也请给她一些建议哦」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.08,1:32:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.41,1:32:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就让我来当恋爱的丘比特吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.09,1:32:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好想整地啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.30,1:32:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.21,1:32:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，果然不买不行啊——
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.65,1:32:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,草坪的话
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.28,1:32:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,会卖吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.81,1:32:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，吓我一跳，不对不对
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.23,1:32:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,结束
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.77,1:32:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「放在岛上的东西，Mii们虽然会自己去用」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.47,1:32:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,「把Mii放到东西上，Mii也可能会有反应」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.63,1:32:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「树、长椅、自动贩卖机等」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.85,1:32:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「在建岛店有卖各种各样的东西」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.44,1:32:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,「Mii们会有什么反应呢？」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.11,1:32:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「让我们把Mii放在各种物品上，观察会发生什么吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.03,1:32:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「欢迎光临」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.73,1:32:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,机会难得
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.94,1:32:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,漆黑的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.32,1:32:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,用漆黑的自动售货机试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.77,1:33:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,放栅栏的话果然……
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.35,1:33:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,会有什么反应呢，真让人好奇
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.21,1:33:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，草坪买不了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.65,1:33:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,像路灯什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.54,1:33:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,「非常感谢」
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.25,1:33:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.25,1:33:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,粉色的郁闷是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.45,1:33:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,建岛
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.50,1:33:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,先放一下看看
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.71,1:33:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.85,1:33:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，自动售货机的…啊，不是自动售货机
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.42,1:33:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在长椅旁边
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.22,1:33:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.80,1:33:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,放在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.80,1:33:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.16,1:33:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,新的栖息地
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.03,1:33:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好，然后稍微听听Mii们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.79,1:33:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,连家的位置也能改变啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.40,1:33:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.75,1:34:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「晚上好」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.88,1:34:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.92,1:34:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,「虽然可能是错觉」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.74,1:34:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,「露露酱她」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.80,1:34:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「是不是喜欢我啊」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.10,1:34:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.43,1:34:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么暴露了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.24,1:34:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,「很般配呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.81,1:34:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「不般配吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.87,1:34:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「想太多了吧？」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.28,1:34:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,「去交往啊」w
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.61,1:34:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么，轻飘飘的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.94,1:34:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,暴露了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.24,1:34:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，不，嗯，那个，话是这么说没错
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.20,1:34:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,话是这么说没错，但、怎么突然…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.85,1:34:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.89,1:34:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人是不是想多了呢～
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.45,1:34:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,掩饰害羞
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.47,1:34:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,很、很合适呢……去交往吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.14,1:34:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,交往吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.92,1:34:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不是很好吗？不，还是很般配这种程度吧……
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.66,1:34:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟再怎么说……这种程度呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.70,1:34:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,很般配呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.45,1:34:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,「是这样吗」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.01,1:34:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,「你不觉得有点在意吗」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.54,1:34:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.37,1:34:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「超级快乐」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.05,1:35:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,芜湖～
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.91,1:35:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，不过啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.12,1:35:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.75,1:35:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,委员长
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.84,1:35:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.61,1:35:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起哦
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.98,1:35:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.23,1:35:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.82,1:35:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我拿了第一位
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.57,1:35:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不过毕竟是最开始的——
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.49,1:35:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,居民嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.77,1:35:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,「主人给我的慢跑入门DVD，我有一直在用」
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.22,1:35:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，兴趣也挺合的，慢跑嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.30,1:35:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这也没办法嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.49,1:35:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.72,1:35:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这、这已经
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.81,1:35:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是莉泽大人
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.42,1:35:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊……如果你能说过的最开心的话
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.44,1:35:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真的没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.12,1:35:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在烦恼吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.29,1:35:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办，我该怎么办才好？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.22,1:35:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,选谁比较好……
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.86,1:35:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,「可能要往午间连续剧的方向发展了w」
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.56,1:35:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是诶
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.85,1:36:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟变成单相思了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.71,1:36:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,「我想吃主人做的饭」
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.69,1:36:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊这样啊，还没给吃饭呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.32,1:36:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,？我做的？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.95,1:36:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,道具工房
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.39,1:36:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,「在道具工房可以制作原创的食品、衣服等」
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.53,1:36:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「建筑的位置也由你来决定吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.38,1:36:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,总、总感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.06,1:36:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这一带怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.13,1:36:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.86,1:36:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,New～
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.71,1:36:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,「插播一条新闻」
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.73,1:36:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「有一条令人高兴的消息」
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.25,1:36:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,道具工房
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.44,1:36:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,能做什么呢，不只是饭吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.31,1:36:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,「空露露岛终于有道具工房落地」
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.34,1:36:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好像也能自己做呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.08,1:36:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「在道具工房，主人为了居民们」
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.70,1:36:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大、大家一起像是
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.85,1:36:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,「可以自由的制作『食物』、『衣服』等各种各样的东西」
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.40,1:36:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样的会喜欢，那样的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.23,1:36:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，衣服和食物都可以啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.48,1:36:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「居民们表示『这样或许能做最喜欢的那个』」
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.47,1:36:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「像这样期待的声音」
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.00,1:37:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,最喜欢的那个，是什么呀
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.13,1:37:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,希望能告诉我呢，大家的喜好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.81,1:37:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,「新闻速报，由本葵为您播报」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.51,1:37:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,葵酱闭著眼睛的话就有点那个啊……怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.29,1:37:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是张着眼睛就又很像呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.27,1:37:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,「在这个道具工房，可以像画画一样制作各种各样的东西」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.45,1:37:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「这次是要制作食物呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.61,1:37:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,「请制作一些Mii们可能会喜欢的食物」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.64,1:37:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,「因为是第一次制作，先从蛋糕之类的开始怎么样？」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.36,1:37:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.10,1:37:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,美大品味……
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.51,1:37:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,「我画到一半了，请把它画得看起来很好吃」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.09,1:37:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？好厉害…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.32,1:37:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「使用上面的印章很有意思哦」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.33,1:37:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要说是手作蛋糕的话
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.80,1:37:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是草莓吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.02,1:37:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,既然都
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.35,1:37:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我做到这了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.46,1:37:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的就交给我吧…等等有点太红了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.28,1:37:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，稍微有点
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.06,1:37:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来有点伤心的事
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.44,1:38:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,与其说伤心，不如说确实挺伤心的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.25,1:38:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.68,1:38:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,最近，我挺喜欢吃水果的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.33,1:38:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，草莓呢
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.34,1:38:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,现在……春
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.84,1:38:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,现在已经都不是春天了嘛，对
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.00,1:38:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不是春天了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.95,1:38:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的，但是
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.27,1:38:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.80,1:38:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.09,1:38:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看到有看起来很好吃的草莓在卖
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.30,1:38:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就买了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.49,1:38:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,果然可能有伤
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.15,1:38:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道是不是有苍蝇
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.08,1:38:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,买了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.93,1:38:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,过了一会儿
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.02,1:38:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好像
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.76,1:38:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,长了好多霉
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.73,1:38:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是我保存方法不对
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.23,1:38:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就发霉了，有点…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.85,1:38:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,把发霉的部分去掉
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.78,1:38:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了剩下的部分
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.46,1:38:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，那个，发霉了是不是就不能吃了？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.35,1:38:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,草莓
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.96,1:39:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不过不马上吃掉不行呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.05,1:39:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,「没放进冰箱吗」冰箱虽然是放了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.07,1:39:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对一边想着这样行不行啊，还是吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.42,1:39:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那个已经，长满霉的那部分
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.30,1:39:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就没吃了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.81,1:39:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,稍稍有一点霉的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.16,1:39:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，旁边连着的地方什么的，完全吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.17,1:39:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了那个之后，还在想这真的没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.74,1:39:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,又想着扔掉也太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.86,1:39:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这么想着
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.80,1:39:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.73,1:39:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是勉强的吃掉了，之后
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.19,1:39:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不这真的好吗……没事吗……
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.86,1:39:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这样想着
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.99,1:39:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.73,1:39:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？常有的事？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.56,1:39:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「下次还是别这样比较好…」
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.43,1:39:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,「草莓包装背后藏着发霉的部分，有这种事的」
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.95,1:39:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，那说不定就是那个原因呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.28,1:39:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,诶颜色不一样哦
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.80,1:40:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，尽量…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.62,1:40:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,想着还是想吃掉
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.75,1:40:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么画了一个这么大的草莓w
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.26,1:40:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.20,1:40:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么不像呢，草莓是……
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.55,1:40:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,让它发霉……？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.37,1:40:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,霉了？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.75,1:40:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉与其说看着不好吃，不如说怎么像西瓜了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.55,1:40:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，只要有一点点发霉就不行？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.74,1:40:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,「真的不行的话，能吃出来的」
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.36,1:40:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我，尝不出来味道
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.11,1:40:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.44,1:40:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是完全吃不出来啦，不过那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.19,1:40:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，草莓的一颗颗的东西是…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.61,1:40:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,盐芝麻？w
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.74,1:41:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么，西瓜吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.79,1:41:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这里会放这种生奶油对吧w
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.84,1:41:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这…料理讲究融入爱的手工制作呢
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.90,1:41:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.23,1:41:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得奶油多一点会更好，大概
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.98,1:41:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉尺寸感有点不太一样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.02,1:41:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,用更粗的笔来画好了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.14,1:41:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看得出来吗……这个
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.03,1:41:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,大概三个在这里……像这样
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.98,1:41:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,也太差劲了……
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.34,1:41:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧，说到草莓奶油蛋糕，总觉得会在这一带…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.16,1:41:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这样……叫什么来着啊
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.06,1:42:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,堆起来？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.91,1:42:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是有的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.73,1:42:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，大概这一带也会有，这种草莓…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.21,1:42:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,放进去的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.45,1:42:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.92,1:42:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.58,1:42:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不、不用放那么多也可以
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.62,1:42:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.48,1:42:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「懂你意思」
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.40,1:42:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,纯白的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.45,1:42:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.42,1:42:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道这部分该怎么形容
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.89,1:42:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,草莓奶油的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.79,1:42:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,小山
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.48,1:42:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「像生奶油山一样」
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.51,1:42:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对对
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.68,1:42:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.14,1:42:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,「这绝对是芝士蛋糕啊」
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.26,1:42:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这芝士？！诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.67,1:42:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是鲜奶油蛋糕吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.85,1:42:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此就把它画成鲜奶油蛋糕吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.29,1:42:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,也许做好了基础
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.90,1:42:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不对吧，这绝对是鲜奶油蛋糕啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.15,1:43:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把它盖过去
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.00,1:43:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,啊等，有点脏啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.28,1:43:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,填充工具不好用啊，因为有原图的关系吗
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.91,1:43:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,总之就是鲜奶油蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.55,1:43:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是我做的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.36,1:43:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,盖上草莓的话
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.01,1:43:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来就很像吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.39,1:43:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,鲜奶油蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.48,1:43:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.15,1:43:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这个你看，那个
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.70,1:43:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,光洁度不同，所以稍微有点
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.03,1:43:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,料理就是爱嘛，爱才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.02,1:43:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,鲜奶油蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.27,1:43:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.46,1:43:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,送给委员长，把这个我融入爱的……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.10,1:43:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋mi是啥
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.51,1:43:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.14,1:44:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,鲜奶油蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.57,1:44:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.72,1:44:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,确实，作为鲜奶油蛋糕来说
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.00,1:44:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不，但是，这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.31,1:44:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像是放了一段时间的鲜奶油蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.80,1:44:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.86,1:44:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有点像芝士那样发酵了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.18,1:44:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,味道普通？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.58,1:44:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,甜的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.04,1:44:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,分类
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.55,1:44:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,点心……
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.01,1:44:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋糕是点心吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.02,1:44:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是点心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.10,1:44:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,温度
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.66,1:44:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,冷的，热的蛋糕是什……
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.41,1:44:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,大小
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.33,1:44:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大的才对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.14,1:44:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,发光的话感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.94,1:44:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不错呢
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.69,1:44:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微让它亮一点，稍微
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.94,1:44:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,只在晚上发光的蛋糕是什么鬼w
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.20,1:44:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,发光看上去更好吃呢
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.62,1:44:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.96,1:44:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来好好吃，看起来好好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.93,1:44:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,发光的看起来更好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.72,1:45:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,各种意义上的发光？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.14,1:45:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「现在做的这个在食品店有卖」
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.22,1:45:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,「买来当礼物送给Mii吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.24,1:45:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.27,1:45:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,话说这自己做的，还要自己花钱买啊
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.12,1:45:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,买个3个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.20,1:45:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是买太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.51,1:45:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,明明买了饭，却没怎么给出去呢
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.55,1:45:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好，那我的特制鲜奶油蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.75,1:45:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不嫌弃的话，请享用
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.29,1:45:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,发光之后看起来确实更好吃了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.30,1:45:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,「我开动了」
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.00,1:45:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来很美味
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.86,1:45:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,「原来如此」
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.99,1:45:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,「希望下次」
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.97,1:45:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,「也能做点别的食物」
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.81,1:45:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没能Get到啊——
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.52,1:45:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此，感想就是「原来如此」有点微妙呢
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.74,1:45:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.77,1:45:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是喜欢的、讨厌的、还是无所谓的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.23,1:45:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,「这次」
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.23,1:46:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,「是做的食物，用许愿喷泉许愿的话」
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.81,1:46:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,「『服装』『艺术装置』等各种各样的东西都能做」
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.93,1:46:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，好想做啊
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.19,1:46:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，那意思是说连制服也能做吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.82,1:46:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,委员长的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.77,1:46:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那个默认的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.92,1:46:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,偶像服装之类的我也喜欢，但感觉好难啊
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.08,1:46:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「对对对，如果身边有玩朋友收集的人的话」
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.95,1:46:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,「『道具工房做的东西』和『Mii』都可以」
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.32,1:46:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,「通过本地通信交换」
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.47,1:46:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,什
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.01,1:46:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,么！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.08,1:46:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这种事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.19,1:46:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,「本地通信在按X显示的菜单里，请好好利用」
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.71,1:46:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.48,1:46:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱，很像呢
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.76,1:46:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,用帽子藏着脑袋就
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.44,1:46:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我竟然还在睡觉呢
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.85,1:46:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,会做什么梦呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.33,1:46:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.24,1:47:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底在
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.51,1:47:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,做什么梦？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.30,1:47:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是现实里，应该在做非常恐怖的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.85,1:47:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是这样的梦，如果是现实的话
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.16,1:47:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,僵尸之类的…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.41,1:47:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.34,1:47:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,「诶？」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.12,1:47:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,「鲜奶油蛋糕」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.90,1:47:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,「不收拾掉不行呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.17,1:47:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,无限大药水吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.76,1:47:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,每次收拾掉就会一个个跳出来那样的……w
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.82,1:47:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是哆啦A梦的梗，无限大药水
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.62,1:47:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好恐怖啊——
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.23,1:47:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哇不过也可以说是恐怖
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.54,1:47:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是恐怖的呢，这样的梦
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.21,1:47:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是说完全不会做这种梦吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.19,1:47:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那种「无限循环不是很可怕吗？」的梦
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.54,1:47:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,无限鲜奶…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.25,1:47:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微产生点疑问啊空露露
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.54,1:47:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别再「诶」了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.25,1:47:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,ww等等
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.24,1:48:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,大家，无限循环就是这种，我的梦……
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.22,1:48:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露桑……嗯，看来正在做这样的梦呢
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.15,1:48:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是无限
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.06,1:48:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这会持续10个小时哦
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.93,1:48:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「在变魔术吗w」
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.13,1:48:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,捡起来就会变多
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.55,1:48:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是变多，有变多吗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.24,1:48:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,无限的这个
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.36,1:48:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怀疑着……
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.07,1:48:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？难道不回去的话真的会无限循环？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.38,1:48:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不按B键不行吗这个
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.06,1:48:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕好可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.38,1:48:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.72,1:48:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖呢
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.12,1:48:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没有终点就是这个的终点
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.33,1:48:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个真的没终点？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.59,1:48:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,回、回去w
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.40,1:48:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀呀，好奇怪呀
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.85,1:48:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,明明捡到了蛋糕，怎么又掉下去了～
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.03,1:48:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「掉下去{\alpha&H80&}捡起来掉下去捡起来{\alpha&H00&}」是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.74,1:48:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.78,1:48:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看10个小时试试
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.23,1:49:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说也该有点变化
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.54,1:49:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这个梦
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.77,1:49:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？这是只说「诶？」的直播
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.55,1:49:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,「好像没有呢」ww
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.86,1:49:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,按了B键
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.33,1:49:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,「做了怪梦呐」
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.41,1:49:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是梦但又不只是梦呢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.26,1:49:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「虽然不知道什么道理，总之拿到鲜奶油蛋糕了」
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.94,1:49:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我的这个手作鲜奶油蛋糕谁都Get不到说有存在的可能吗没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.84,1:49:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,…因为委员长只说了句「原来如此」嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.72,1:49:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟是我做的东西嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.98,1:49:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露大概会喜欢吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.13,1:49:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,给，空露露
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.01,1:49:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,「我开动了」
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.86,1:49:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「脑子要坏掉了w」
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.02,1:49:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.94,1:49:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.79,1:49:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.15,1:49:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好像好吃好像好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.81,1:49:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,「还挺好吃的」
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.33,1:49:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.93,1:49:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是很努力做的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.44,1:49:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.90,1:50:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,第三位鲜奶油蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.39,1:50:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要送什么礼物呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.64,1:50:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢……
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.71,1:50:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.62,1:50:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,问候词
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.76,1:50:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,已经有「空露露——！！！！」了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.29,1:50:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,口头禅……
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.26,1:50:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.63,1:50:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露～
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.66,1:50:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦露露
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.71,1:50:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,拜拜因……
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.51,1:50:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,倍、倍倍因
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.17,1:50:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.11,1:50:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,像是会说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.95,1:50:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？我什么时候会用「算了」
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.12,1:50:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.99,1:50:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不，每次话题结束都说「算了」w
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.27,1:50:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不，今天天气真好呢。是呢，天气真好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.58,1:50:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉要下雨了呢，要下雨了呢，算了——这样收尾
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.71,1:50:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.74,1:50:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻、糟糕了昆布
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.04,1:50:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,大家——
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.44,1:50:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,「难过的时候」？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.14,1:51:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,「糟了——」对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.14,1:51:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊遭
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.46,1:51:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时呢，暂时
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.16,1:51:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时也说的很多呢
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.98,1:51:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,「眼珠痒」
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.22,1:51:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那个是花粉症使用限定的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.60,1:51:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来最近一直花粉症
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.70,1:51:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,搞砸的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.19,1:51:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,「对着大海喊的话」？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.84,1:51:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.88,1:51:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊遭——
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.93,1:51:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,「生气的时候」
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.92,1:51:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,「会说的话」
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.82,1:51:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.02,1:51:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,铃原露露和空露露
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.50,1:51:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,会说的话是
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.77,1:51:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？有什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.17,1:51:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,悲伤的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.35,1:51:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕了昆布
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.11,1:51:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,「我去换个眼珠——」w
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.08,1:51:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠……
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.31,1:51:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠这个可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.23,1:52:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,「生气的时候」
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.77,1:52:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那个倒也不是特定的时候啦
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.02,1:52:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是自然现象
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.33,1:52:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,会完美地赢下来的，对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.99,1:52:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,「哟」哟，但是……
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.71,1:52:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,「哟」在我最初快要说出来的时……
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.31,1:52:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.41,1:52:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,算了，算是说了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.33,1:52:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.45,1:52:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.85,1:52:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那，就梦话
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.52,1:52:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,「赌上花京院的灵魂」
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.72,1:52:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,弄成会说的话好了？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.67,1:52:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.66,1:52:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,会说的话弄成「算了」试试？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.61,1:52:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,会说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.95,1:52:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.33,1:52:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然感觉像是话题收尾
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.42,1:52:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,「是空露露哦～」「好像会有好事～」
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.51,1:52:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,「总觉得挺开心的～」
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.78,1:52:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那这里就，设置成「算了」吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.36,1:53:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.37,1:53:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,算了？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.64,1:53:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.30,1:53:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,算了…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.82,1:53:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,「怎么样？疼吗？」
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.40,1:53:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，生气的时候那样也行吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.24,1:53:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,疼痛的等级从1到10大概是几级呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.75,1:53:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,「露露桑真喜欢JOJO呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.82,1:53:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，我的义务教育是全职猎人和
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.58,1:53:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,JOJO，大体是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.64,1:53:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.13,1:53:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.32,1:53:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那么就算了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.68,1:53:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,算了的精神很重要哦
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.78,1:53:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别想太多
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.63,1:53:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,多想一些会更好的事虽然也有
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.96,1:53:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,想太多的话，有时候也不好
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.94,1:54:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样空露露
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.23,1:54:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到「空露露——！！！！」和「算了」
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.41,1:54:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,「算了」
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.89,1:54:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「真像俺的口头禅」
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.02,1:54:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样……
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.00,1:54:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,语尾一次不落的用俺呢
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.16,1:54:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不是语尾
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.33,1:54:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,第一人称
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.26,1:54:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,超级快乐、快乐、稍微了解
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.33,1:54:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,低头时的阴影很可怕呢，我的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.13,1:54:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,睡得真好，真棒
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.95,1:54:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界的空露露，会好好睡觉呢
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.72,1:54:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好像大家，都有点郁闷呢
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.65,1:54:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔桑在海边哦
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.88,1:54:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么了呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.69,1:54:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「我有点在意莉泽·赫露艾斯塔桑的事情」
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.55,1:54:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「我和莉泽·赫露艾斯塔桑的相性」
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.10,1:54:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,「怎么样呢？」
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.06,1:54:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这…看关系图的感觉是…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.49,1:54:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人稍微了解一点，但还不太了解的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.50,1:55:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可能不太合得来
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.47,1:55:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这、这有点…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.58,1:55:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，现在
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.35,1:55:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,比较来说
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.41,1:55:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露和
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.89,1:55:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.50,1:55:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,现在相性达到最棒了，所以有点……
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.39,1:55:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会不太合适吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.99,1:55:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,诶委员长
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.53,1:55:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,和空露露
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.85,1:55:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得会合适……w
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.53,1:55:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得会和空露露桑谈得来
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.49,1:55:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,还是…说不合适好吗……
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.15,1:55:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,先挫一挫势头吗，一开始……
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.88,1:55:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.05,1:55:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.18,1:55:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,「完美无缺对吧？」
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.20,1:55:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但还不确定呢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.54,1:55:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还是再……多聊一聊
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.13,1:55:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就回复普通吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.10,1:55:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,普、普通……
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.06,1:56:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,普通……
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.38,1:56:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.24,1:56:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但是还不确定呢，暂时还
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.50,1:56:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那就普通吧
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.82,1:56:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,「果然是这样呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.16,1:56:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是这样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.58,1:56:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,果然吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.82,1:56:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那个完美无缺之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.33,1:56:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果说了不太合适的话
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.62,1:56:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,会怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.25,1:56:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微试着选普通了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.55,1:56:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,果然如此呢
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.67,1:56:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「本人，喜欢上了莉泽·赫露艾斯塔桑」
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.52,1:56:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.66,1:56:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不，但是喜欢的心情是无法阻止的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.45,1:56:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不会阻止
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.67,1:56:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我想见证这次培养会如何发展
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.75,1:56:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好，葵酱
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.58,1:56:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.95,1:56:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「早好～」
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.05,1:56:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,早好～早好～早好～
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.87,1:56:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,「我想和西西桑成为朋友」
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.18,1:56:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？！不错不错
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.78,1:56:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得很好
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.72,1:56:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「应该聊什么话题好呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.00,1:56:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,聊什么，超级大金刚之类的如何
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.14,1:57:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得超级大金刚什么的挺不错的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.04,1:57:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,超级大金刚
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.24,1:57:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就用金刚
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.08,1:57:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,堂吉柯德w
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.46,1:57:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,超级大金刚，就用金刚来
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.53,1:57:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是个很吃时效性的梗
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.36,1:57:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我稍微看过你们一起玩
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.49,1:57:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.57,1:57:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.59,1:57:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,写上二吧，第二部
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.81,1:57:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.40,1:57:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就超级大金刚
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.22,1:57:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这个肯定没错
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.22,1:57:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,「超级大金刚对吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.98,1:57:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,「这又是什么样的事物呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.34,1:57:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.93,1:57:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不是把香蕉抢回来吗……w
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.89,1:57:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但、但是，那个，1和2，那个有点不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.48,1:57:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有关物的话题，有关于做什么的话题
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.32,1:57:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,物？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.73,1:57:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.07,1:58:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,该、该选什么好呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.85,1:58:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,大金刚是...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.38,1:58:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.88,1:58:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不是人
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.94,1:58:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不是物
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.17,1:58:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不，还是物吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.95,1:58:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,物吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.76,1:58:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏是其他吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.49,1:58:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,物
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.59,1:58:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,冒险…是游戏所以物吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.60,1:58:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那就当物？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.54,1:58:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,做、关于做什么的话题
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.57,1:58:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不过不会去说「要做超级大金刚呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.49,1:58:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,啊不过会说的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.73,1:58:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,去做大金刚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.18,1:58:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.02,1:58:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,关于做什么的，也可以
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.57,1:58:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.28,1:58:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来玩大金刚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.39,1:58:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道大金刚吗……
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.87,1:58:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——当物吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.00,1:58:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「我明白了」
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.17,1:58:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我去聊「超级大金刚」的话题
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.54,1:58:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.55,1:59:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得很好
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.46,1:59:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,「晚上好」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.56,1:59:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「西西桑」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.06,1:59:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.34,1:59:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,「和葵一起」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.65,1:59:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,关于超级大金刚w
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.65,1:59:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,「聊聊超级大金刚吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.74,1:59:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这肯定能聊的很热闹毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.41,1:59:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这套卡组的话\N「可以哦」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.08,1:59:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这套卡组，大概谁都能用呢
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.32,1:59:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,「说到超级大金刚，就是牛油果呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.30,1:59:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,超级大金刚卡组
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.34,1:59:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,「没错没错」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.32,1:59:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,牛油果？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.58,1:59:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,「说到超级大金刚」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.72,1:59:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,「必须是那个呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.64,1:59:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,「本葵桑」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.89,1:59:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,「你很懂嘛」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.70,1:59:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.12,1:59:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「想要聊更多超级大金刚的话题」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.24,1:59:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「能成为葵的朋友吗」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.26,1:59:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,超级大金刚的话题
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.53,1:59:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「彼此彼此」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.78,1:59:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「请多指教」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.13,1:59:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那个———
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.47,1:59:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解的大金刚可能不太一样
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.73,1:59:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什么牛油果啊
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.66,1:59:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不是香蕉吗
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.40,1:59:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界的大金刚大概是
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.80,1:59:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在收集——
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.29,2:00:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,牛油果吧，肯定是
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.52,2:00:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.39,2:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.88,2:00:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么称呼呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.71,2:00:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,西西……
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.09,2:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就西西吧……
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.50,2:00:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,本葵
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.61,2:00:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,西西
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.97,2:00:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,西西，西西吗
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.47,2:00:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,西西就是西西吧
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.13,2:00:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样叫吧
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.03,2:00:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,牛油果w
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.16,2:00:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,香蕉的……
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.96,2:00:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,总之，那个，虚构的嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.78,2:00:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,与现实存在的个人、团体什么什么什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.60,2:00:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,和什么什么完全无关
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.67,2:00:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就叫西西吧，就原样
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.35,2:00:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,改一下倒也可以呢
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.67,2:00:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,故意的w
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.84,2:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,故意取个对方不太会叫的名字…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.08,2:00:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，果然还是这个更合适
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.95,2:00:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,「西西感觉就是西西」
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.09,2:00:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.88,2:00:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,「特意叫唯华酱」
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.39,2:01:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,唯酱
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.23,2:01:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,西酱
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.79,2:01:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.73,2:01:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,新的称呼方式
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.11,2:01:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不过感觉会变得不像呢
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.01,2:01:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不过要说像，倒也不是
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.09,2:01:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,叫葵酱吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.26,2:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,葵酱
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.85,2:01:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就葵酱吧
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.90,2:01:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,葵酱西西……
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.32,2:01:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？chihima？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.49,2:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,葵……
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.61,2:01:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,酱
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.89,2:01:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,酱゙
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.82,2:01:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,葵酱゙
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.21,2:01:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,葵酱
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.51,2:01:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,葵酱
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.07,2:01:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好……确定
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.01,2:01:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,「葵酱」
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.11,2:01:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,「好久不见」
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.38,2:01:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.26,2:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「酱葵？」ww酱葵
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.34,2:01:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,酱葵也不错
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.52,2:01:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,西西
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.64,2:01:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,酱葵
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.22,2:01:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,葵{\b1}酱゙{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.70,2:02:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「因为超级大金刚的话题」
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.91,2:02:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,「名字重排什么的等成为情侣再说吧w」
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.61,2:02:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「和西西成为朋友了」
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.20,2:02:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，原来如此
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.75,2:02:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也有这种的呢
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.36,2:02:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「和葵酱聊天，非常的有趣！」
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.58,2:02:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.71,2:02:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哦——
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.98,2:02:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有点悲伤呢，人际关系排行榜
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.38,2:02:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,明明空露露是第一个见面的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.49,2:02:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,都已经掉出圈外了w
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.95,2:02:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,太悲伤了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.34,2:02:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我很悲伤啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.85,2:02:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里开始呢，从这里开始有上升到上位的可能性
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.53,2:02:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.73,2:02:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不过总觉得有种安心感，稳定感呢
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.74,2:02:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,「秘密的恋爱话题」那是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.69,2:02:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,让我也掺一脚
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.42,2:02:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也让我掺一脚啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.38,2:02:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「看来聊不来呢w」
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.72,2:02:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉那只能见面聊了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.97,2:02:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧好吧，没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.47,2:02:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.61,2:02:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,聊着
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.74,2:03:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,花开了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.08,2:03:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,优先顺位……
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.47,2:03:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,擦干眼泪空露露
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.27,2:03:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,还不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.91,2:03:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定之后会跟上
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.10,2:03:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,委员长好像也是单相思哦
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.89,2:03:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.74,2:03:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.83,2:03:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,动不了了？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.69,2:03:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,打嗝停不下来
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.15,2:03:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办？我觉得这是很重要的命运啊
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.33,2:03:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,要么和我
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.29,2:03:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,进一步
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.46,2:03:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,加深爱意
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.06,2:03:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,或者美兔桑
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.09,2:03:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,单相思
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.51,2:03:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，但是…什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.04,2:03:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我睡着了吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.71,2:03:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的睡着了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.64,2:03:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「要让事情更复杂吗」「选委员长吧！」
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.61,2:03:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还是去吧，空露露
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.18,2:04:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,算了那就让我上了哦真的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.63,2:04:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来，醒醒
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.60,2:04:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.10,2:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,「把Mii捏起来找谁的时候」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.16,2:04:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,「有没有觉得找想要见的Mii很麻烦？」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.93,2:04:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,「那种时候」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.03,2:04:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「可以按Y键选择想见的Mii直接带过去」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.12,2:04:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～方便
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.47,2:04:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.74,2:04:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么w
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.86,2:04:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我好恐怖啊
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.38,2:04:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,「没事吧？」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.31,2:04:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.75,2:04:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,「打嗝……」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.27,2:04:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「嗝」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.21,2:04:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么止住打嗝
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.54,2:04:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,「止不住……嗝」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.24,2:04:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一口气捏住鼻子，一口气捏住鼻子什么鬼……
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.72,2:04:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,「嘿……咻」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.68,2:04:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一口气猛喝水肯定会止住，试试看
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.70,2:04:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「呃呃……等、等等」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.66,2:04:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「等」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.69,2:04:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,「等」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.05,2:04:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如何？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.03,2:04:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好了？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.59,2:04:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,「谢谢你的好心」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.12,2:04:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,「我做了好事呢！」\N没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.27,2:04:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,穿着睡衣就出去……
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.34,2:05:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,要去哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.01,2:05:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「不去吓一下不行」啊
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.34,2:05:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢，也有吓一跳能止住的说法呢
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.13,2:05:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说来搞点恐怖的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.10,2:05:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖游戏也可以
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.45,2:05:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,「超级开心」
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.85,2:05:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不错不错，看上去很开心
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.95,2:05:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,之后……啊
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.86,2:05:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,诶呀？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.23,2:05:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？不是西西
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.44,2:05:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,「想要传播自己的勇猛传说」
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.19,2:05:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.96,2:05:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.76,2:05:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰你们说话了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.70,2:05:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,话说这不能听在说些什么吗
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.15,2:05:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.09,2:05:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,「在以『主人与自己』为主题聊天」
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.84,2:05:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,诶是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.42,2:05:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好在意啊
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.46,2:05:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在聊些什么呢
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.63,2:05:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,「非常想成为朋友」
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.25,2:05:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么有点ww
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.12,2:05:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,想要成为朋友
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.26,2:06:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,变得超级积极的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.96,2:06:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的感觉？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.22,2:06:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，克莱尔桑睡着了——
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.83,2:06:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微…偷看一下
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.90,2:06:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,「……不过，不算讨厌……」
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.84,2:06:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.38,2:06:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,说梦话？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.55,2:06:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，不算讨厌？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.36,2:06:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.49,2:06:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，大概没法看梦呢
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.05,2:06:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.31,2:06:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在空露露的家里…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.51,2:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在呢
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.92,2:06:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在干什么……
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.87,2:06:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，是在运动——呢
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.80,2:06:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,原来……如此？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.56,2:06:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.03,2:06:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.14,2:06:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,然后写着New的这个，喷泉吗
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.51,2:06:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，愿望
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.69,2:06:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Level UP、Rank UP
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.32,2:07:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,「在做拉伸」
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.54,2:07:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,2434广播体操吗
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.90,2:07:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,2434——
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.04,2:07:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,「能够实现新的愿望了」
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.96,2:07:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.48,2:07:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,「建岛店的愿望，可以增加店里的商品」
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.22,2:07:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯，想要地面
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.18,2:07:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,想增加想增加
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.77,2:07:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,建岛New
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.34,2:07:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,「整备的适合走路的石板地面」
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.47,2:07:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就追加这个吧
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.78,2:07:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得绝对有必要
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.32,2:07:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.71,2:07:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,种类，岛屿的地面…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.35,2:07:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,能造岛上的地面很好呢
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.31,2:08:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好……OK
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.88,2:08:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,沙滩躺椅
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.36,2:08:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,像这种的再多买些比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.73,2:08:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「茶室风格」「天才风格」
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.36,2:08:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也有点想要增加呢
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.08,2:08:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,西西酱是不是更适合自家露营风格呢w
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.20,2:08:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在家也能享受露营
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.52,2:08:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,「喜爱运动风格」
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.25,2:08:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,给空露露感觉不错呢
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.14,2:08:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,亚洲度假村风格
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.16,2:08:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然会忍不住想买各种东西
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.68,2:08:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,而且能实现的愿望只有两次，得慎重
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.95,2:08:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也想要开放衣服的制作呢
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.40,2:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话，给大家…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.93,2:09:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一模一样的衣服
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.50,2:09:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那个，制作起来确实挺花时间的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.52,2:09:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那这部分就私底下
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.66,2:09:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,自己做
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.80,2:09:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在直播里展示之类的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.47,2:09:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,也可以吧
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.83,2:09:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.55,2:09:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,道具……怎么样呢……啊
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.79,2:09:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,也有健身入门嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.97,2:09:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那就买了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.80,2:09:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,「喜爱猫咪风格不买吗」嗯？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.80,2:09:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,「喜爱猫咪风格」
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.63,2:09:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.97,2:09:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个哪个
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.54,2:09:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可能稍微没注意到
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.44,2:09:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不过用完了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.00,2:09:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在、在哪里啊猫咪
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.39,2:09:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好像漏掉了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.06,2:09:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,房子？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.55,2:09:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是装修公司吗
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.38,2:09:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,「狗屋风格」
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.85,2:09:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，真的耶，有有有
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.84,2:09:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，但是不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.47,2:10:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法也没办法吧——
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.04,2:10:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,装修公司
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.10,2:10:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不，好想买啊——
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.63,2:10:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好想买好想买
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.19,2:10:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,算了算了下次再买也行，完全可以
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.64,2:10:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.87,2:10:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,建岛店
Dialogue: 0,2:10:18.54,2:10:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.66,2:10:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，这是什么，道具工房
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.08,2:10:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,「基本上什么都能做出来」
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.61,2:10:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,自由的还挺高的呢
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.27,2:10:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.70,2:10:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.75,2:10:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.71,2:10:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,卡住了吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.25,2:10:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊等等……w
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.07,2:10:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.22,2:10:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍de
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.10,2:14:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,让您久等了——
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.88,2:14:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉呢，好像状态有点不太好…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.66,2:14:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.58,2:14:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉呢，重启了一下…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.56,2:14:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,本来想再连一次的…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.01,2:14:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.44,2:14:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这次呢，启动花了点时间，摄像头它
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.06,2:14:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.51,2:14:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.02,2:14:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有点
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.41,2:14:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有点不确定的感觉…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.37,2:14:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,米事咩
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.20,2:14:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,衣服和地面...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:53.89,2:14:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,「是摄像头不行了吗？」
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.94,2:14:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉……
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.52,2:15:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,现、现在应该没问题了吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:01.38,2:15:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,总之目前看起来没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.41,2:15:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，这一带就先这样，之后再来弄吧
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.33,2:15:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，保存，也保存一下吧
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.35,2:15:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且呢
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.31,2:15:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,「储存空间没问题吗」
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.30,2:15:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.06,2:15:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,储存空间之类的
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.62,2:15:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.85,2:15:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.50,2:15:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.53,2:15:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,追加Mii…诶、等一下
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.76,2:15:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然说还能再加64个人
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.50,2:15:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还有64人
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.23,2:15:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话，之前也提过，瑠璃酱
Dialogue: 0,2:15:41.49,2:15:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啊—
Dialogue: 0,2:15:43.60,2:15:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:46.04,2:15:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,等等w
Dialogue: 0,2:15:47.20,2:15:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么好像又
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.86,2:15:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,摄像头
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.86,2:15:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,时不时地
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.94,2:15:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.97,2:16:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺那个
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.60,2:16:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,会卡一下呢，时不时地
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.76,2:16:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,琉、琉璃酱
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.53,2:16:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我想着要不要开始做了...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.93,2:16:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀——
Dialogue: 0,2:16:12.99,2:16:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好像动了一下，又、又没动起来
Dialogue: 0,2:16:15.80,2:16:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,停住了，感觉摄像头状态不太好啊
Dialogue: 0,2:16:20.79,2:16:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.01,2:16:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「静画也可以哦」
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.11,2:16:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,换成……立绘吗
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.40,2:16:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是换成立绘比较好呢
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.48,2:16:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,要一帧一帧的了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:40.07,2:16:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.33,2:16:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,能再试一次重启吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.42,2:16:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.84,2:16:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉——好像状态不太好呢
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.36,2:20:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,总感觉动起来有点迟缓——
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.45,2:20:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我回力
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.97,2:20:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,让大家久等了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.86,2:20:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有负载呢
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.79,2:20:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我的电脑很强的，没那么……
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.55,2:20:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,2:20:41.64,2:20:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不是刚换过吗，时间没过去多久吧
Dialogue: 0,2:20:44.81,2:20:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,算了，没办法啊——
Dialogue: 0,2:20:50.91,2:20:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微呢，那个
Dialogue: 0,2:20:52.84,2:20:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然会有些卡顿
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.32,2:20:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,摄像头的状态好像变差了
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.78,2:21:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「和刚才比没变化」没变化呢——
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.34,2:21:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.66,2:21:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会在奇怪的表情停住…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.45,2:21:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，怎么弄比较好呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.30,2:21:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要停很久的话
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.35,2:21:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,用立绘也可以
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.65,2:21:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但只要稍微能动一点，还是动起来比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.27,2:21:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我想稍微做一下琉璃酱
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.58,2:21:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,「原因是摄像头吗」我觉得应该是摄像头——
Dialogue: 0,2:21:35.90,2:21:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,相机应用那边呢
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.01,2:21:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,启动的时候感觉有点卡
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.60,2:21:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,「要不要在怪脸的时候截图呢w」
Dialogue: 0,2:21:47.72,2:21:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,会卡多久…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:49.67,2:21:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,呢
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.30,2:21:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,「是积热了吗？」
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.77,2:21:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微呢，算是有点积热
Dialogue: 0,2:21:56.84,2:21:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有在积热呢
Dialogue: 0,2:21:58.58,2:22:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，嘴巴好可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,2:22:16.25,2:22:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,用这种方式做，也可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.89,2:22:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这样也很可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.50,2:22:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这样也很可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,2:22:34.89,2:22:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这个也有点像
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.08,2:22:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这个更像一点吧
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.71,2:22:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.60,2:23:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛的话
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.57,2:23:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,2:23:08.95,2:23:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,2:23:11.15,2:23:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,先把头发…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:14.68,2:23:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,弄成容易看的样子
Dialogue: 0,2:23:17.63,2:23:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,说容易的话
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.91,2:23:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个呀，暂时呢
Dialogue: 0,2:23:26.37,2:23:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,「像小狗」是吧～
Dialogue: 0,2:23:27.76,2:23:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那个弯弯的造型好可爱
Dialogue: 0,2:23:29.51,2:23:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好像状态不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:23:38.47,2:23:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，眉毛先改了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.52,2:23:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,果然，感觉应该是这样的眉毛呢
Dialogue: 0,2:23:51.34,2:23:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,2:23:55.35,2:23:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这样看的话
Dialogue: 0,2:23:58.11,2:24:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,…往下垂的眉毛
Dialogue: 0,2:24:01.87,2:24:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,的成员，很多吗
Dialogue: 0,2:24:04.24,2:24:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微往下一点的，真的就一点点
Dialogue: 0,2:24:08.06,2:24:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然没有下垂那么多
Dialogue: 0,2:24:12.39,2:24:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,直到这里
Dialogue: 0,2:24:13.44,2:24:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不能再上了
Dialogue: 0,2:24:16.24,2:24:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不，应该……是下垂的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:24:20.39,2:24:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不，大概这样吧
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.86,2:24:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱也长了一张很可爱的脸呢
Dialogue: 0,2:24:35.67,2:24:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:24:41.18,2:24:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉最近总是，以这个为基础在做呢
Dialogue: 0,2:24:46.60,2:24:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉，不是这个的话…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:49.35,2:24:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.07,2:24:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉能做出藤木君
Dialogue: 0,2:24:57.71,2:24:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是不是
Dialogue: 0,2:24:58.79,2:25:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,能做得更像睡着的样子呢
Dialogue: 0,2:25:07.14,2:25:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有光的话就另当…等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,2:25:09.84,2:25:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时
Dialogue: 0,2:25:12.94,2:25:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这完全不一样啊，根本
Dialogue: 0,2:25:23.96,2:25:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在这个上
Dialogue: 0,2:25:24.88,2:25:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.18,2:25:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，原来如此
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.14,2:25:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:25:42.85,2:25:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,果然从这边开始做的话才能可爱得
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.46,2:25:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,接近本尊吗
Dialogue: 0,2:25:51.20,2:25:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,按照之前的感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.79,2:25:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那样好像比较好，有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.91,2:26:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,「发型是干扰源」不会吧
Dialogue: 0,2:26:03.24,2:26:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然看起来很清楚
Dialogue: 0,2:26:06.99,2:26:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,再大一点也可以吧
Dialogue: 0,2:26:10.27,2:26:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,等…大过头？
Dialogue: 0,2:26:15.96,2:26:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,2:26:20.22,2:26:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,倒是很可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.99,2:26:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:26:32.88,2:26:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛的线条...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:34.54,2:26:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺
Dialogue: 0,2:26:36.85,2:26:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,可、可能有点难
Dialogue: 0,2:26:55.39,2:26:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——比较难搞呢
Dialogue: 0,2:26:58.61,2:27:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,更加…眼梢的部分……
Dialogue: 0,2:27:02.70,2:27:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,朝着斜下方...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:05.90,2:27:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,画出来比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,2:27:08.48,2:27:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,画上去的话...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:12.74,2:27:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不对没有突…
Dialogue: 0,2:27:14.45,2:27:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,…出来这么多
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.06,2:27:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯—
Dialogue: 0,2:27:23.73,2:27:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要再现的话有点...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:27.47,2:27:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很难
Dialogue: 0,2:27:45.16,2:27:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这个下面的还是有比较好
Dialogue: 0,2:27:47.97,2:27:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这样？
Dialogue: 0,2:27:59.04,2:27:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个
Dialogue: 0,2:28:01.62,2:28:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，我怎么觉得完全捏不像呢
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.17,2:28:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:28:24.50,2:28:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛…
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.49,2:28:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,非常独特才难啊
Dialogue: 0,2:28:40.85,2:28:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好难啊
Dialogue: 0,2:28:47.54,2:28:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴巴再往上一格吧
Dialogue: 0,2:28:54.97,2:28:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,眉毛可能太上了
Dialogue: 0,2:29:04.06,2:29:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不过呢
Dialogue: 0,2:29:05.42,2:29:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,底色是什么呢——
Dialogue: 0,2:29:08.28,2:29:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那个眼睛呢
Dialogue: 0,2:29:09.66,2:29:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,有点金色和绿色的
Dialogue: 0,2:29:14.07,2:29:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,下半部分…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:15.58,2:29:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,…像金色的
Dialogue: 0,2:29:18.61,2:29:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:21.06,2:29:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:29:22.05,2:29:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说呢
Dialogue: 0,2:29:28.36,2:29:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等，让我快翻一下
Dialogue: 0,2:29:33.83,2:29:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，是啊
Dialogue: 0,2:29:35.11,2:29:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,上面果然是绿色
Dialogue: 0,2:29:37.51,2:29:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,下面是金色的
Dialogue: 0,2:29:44.61,2:29:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那种渐变效果做不出来吗，应该不行吧
Dialogue: 0,2:29:52.52,2:29:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法吗
Dialogue: 0,2:29:53.55,2:29:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哪边……更好？
Dialogue: 0,2:29:56.00,2:29:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,全部绿色…不过金色……嗯整体来说
Dialogue: 0,2:29:59.89,2:30:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,实在太显眼了
Dialogue: 0,2:30:10.33,2:30:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吧，这样的话
Dialogue: 0,2:30:16.89,2:30:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,2:30:22.29,2:30:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:30:27.20,2:30:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还是这边呢
Dialogue: 0,2:30:28.99,2:30:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这边吧
Dialogue: 0,2:30:33.47,2:30:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,底色用这边这个吧
Dialogue: 0,2:30:40.96,2:30:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,也想改眉毛的颜色啊
Dialogue: 0,2:30:47.52,2:30:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微
Dialogue: 0,2:30:51.43,2:30:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这样？
Dialogue: 0,2:31:03.09,2:31:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，眉毛
Dialogue: 0,2:31:06.94,2:31:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,基底是...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:10.63,2:31:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,和莉泽大人一样的
Dialogue: 0,2:31:14.31,2:31:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这个基底也
Dialogue: 0,2:31:16.91,2:31:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不过刘海的分开位置
Dialogue: 0,2:31:19.72,2:31:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,左侧
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.73,2:31:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有点空着呢
Dialogue: 0,2:31:24.36,2:31:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是画上去比较好呢——？
Dialogue: 0,2:31:28.73,2:31:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是这么想
Dialogue: 0,2:31:31.38,2:31:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时先不要刘海比较好？
Dialogue: 0,2:31:46.11,2:31:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,后发
Dialogue: 0,2:31:52.86,2:31:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有半扎双马尾那样的呢
Dialogue: 0,2:31:57.06,2:32:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还是得画上去吗，那个
Dialogue: 0,2:32:00.87,2:32:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,半扎双马尾那样的是哪个呢
Dialogue: 0,2:32:18.43,2:32:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个是哪个
Dialogue: 0,2:32:22.95,2:32:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,「是稍微往左偏了一点吗？」是这样的
Dialogue: 0,2:32:26.79,2:32:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，所以现在有点……
Dialogue: 0,2:32:34.73,2:32:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,比如像这样，把头发系成这样...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:40.03,2:32:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,2:32:50.71,2:32:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这种感觉？
Dialogue: 0,2:32:53.78,2:32:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,以颜色来说的话
Dialogue: 0,2:33:00.31,2:33:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,会变得像吗
Dialogue: 0,2:33:06.87,2:33:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里开始，会变得像吗
Dialogue: 0,2:33:13.70,2:33:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:33:17.13,2:33:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,「像」
Dialogue: 0,2:33:18.27,2:33:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,2:33:24.46,2:33:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好，那么...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:28.42,2:33:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我想开始涂装了
Dialogue: 0,2:33:33.22,2:33:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,从鼻子开始画吧
Dialogue: 0,2:33:42.86,2:33:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,歪了
Dialogue: 0,2:34:01.46,2:34:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,长长的直线有点…
Dialogue: 0,2:34:04.94,2:34:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还真是不容易画呢
Dialogue: 0,2:34:10.32,2:34:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓直线是
Dialogue: 0,2:34:12.79,2:34:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这样？
Dialogue: 0,2:34:18.93,2:34:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然感觉可能还要向下一点……
Dialogue: 0,2:34:32.34,2:34:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不、不是那么下面的
Dialogue: 0,2:34:34.56,2:34:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是不是还要再长一点
Dialogue: 0,2:34:52.90,2:34:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有觉得浅了点？
Dialogue: 0,2:34:56.02,2:34:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太浅了？
Dialogue: 0,2:35:01.24,2:35:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不过画上去可能会有点微妙...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:06.19,2:35:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微
Dialogue: 0,2:35:08.15,2:35:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,往这边下垂一些更好吗
Dialogue: 0,2:35:32.49,2:35:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛闭起来的时候绝对会很奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,2:35:35.85,2:35:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然知道但是…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:39.42,2:35:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然知道……
Dialogue: 0,2:36:05.65,2:36:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这边像这样有一条比较好…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:09.71,2:36:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,…吧
Dialogue: 0,2:36:29.81,2:36:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:32.12,2:36:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……这
Dialogue: 0,2:36:39.84,2:36:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:36:42.77,2:36:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,会变成左右对称吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:48.68,2:36:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这种的，是不是应该充分利用起来呢
Dialogue: 0,2:36:53.00,2:36:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这么想
Dialogue: 0,2:37:05.20,2:37:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好难
Dialogue: 0,2:37:14.87,2:37:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「你知道复制粘贴功能吗」
Dialogue: 0,2:37:17.31,2:37:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不、不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:37:19.01,2:37:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那个……其实呢
Dialogue: 0,2:37:20.88,2:37:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微看了下别人的朋友收集
Dialogue: 0,2:37:24.14,2:37:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:24.98,2:37:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在想大家都是怎么把角色做出来的嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:37:28.74,2:37:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊、原来…有这种功能…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:35.44,2:37:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:40.68,2:37:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都很厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,2:37:45.33,2:37:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然谈不上研究
Dialogue: 0,2:37:47.44,2:37:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,然后果然脑袋
Dialogue: 0,2:37:49.85,2:37:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分都是全部自己做的
Dialogue: 0,2:37:53.61,2:37:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何
Dialogue: 0,2:37:55.37,2:37:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,2:37:59.31,2:38:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,都有些没办法的部分
Dialogue: 0,2:38:01.25,2:38:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这里？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:02.88,2:38:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,像面具一样，把头发
Dialogue: 0,2:38:06.11,2:38:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,粘在一起的Liver们
Dialogue: 0,2:38:09.47,2:38:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好像更多
Dialogue: 0,2:38:12.48,2:38:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,2:38:15.61,2:38:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,「果然大家都是画的？」嗯……
Dialogue: 0,2:38:18.47,2:38:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,做得很好，连渐变…
Dialogue: 0,2:38:21.17,2:38:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,很多应该说头发
Dialogue: 0,2:38:22.78,2:38:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,去这么做的很多吧
Dialogue: 0,2:39:08.47,2:39:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这种感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,2:39:13.74,2:39:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,「大家都很努力呢～」
Dialogue: 0,2:39:15.07,2:39:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但是啊，而且还是那么
Dialogue: 0,2:39:17.89,2:39:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那么花时间
Dialogue: 0,2:39:20.14,2:39:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我虽然也用很多时间
Dialogue: 0,2:39:23.16,2:39:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大概真的非常擅长
Dialogue: 0,2:39:27.69,2:39:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,2:39:29.38,2:39:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,2:39:30.58,2:39:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,…多才多艺
Dialogue: 0,2:39:34.77,2:39:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但也很用心
Dialogue: 0,2:39:39.05,2:39:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么那么…
Dialogue: 0,2:39:39.97,2:39:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉什么都会啊
Dialogue: 0,2:39:42.27,2:39:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的人呢，有很多呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:39:55.31,2:39:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,…真是多才多艺呢
Dialogue: 0,2:40:04.11,2:40:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉已经…大概这样…
Dialogue: 0,2:40:06.95,2:40:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,画上去的人
Dialogue: 0,2:40:09.46,2:40:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很多
Dialogue: 0,2:40:12.71,2:40:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,2:40:44.60,2:40:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,2:40:56.17,2:40:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,2:41:01.64,2:41:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,填充工具怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,2:41:04.52,2:41:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因人而异吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:11.09,2:41:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然也不是那么…那个
Dialogue: 0,2:41:14.58,2:41:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:16.24,2:41:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有点蓬起来了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:41:20.44,2:41:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,干脆涂满也一样呢
Dialogue: 0,2:41:30.14,2:41:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,与其说没办法，虽然可能是没办法
Dialogue: 0,2:41:54.25,2:41:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,之后果然还是要看感觉呢——
Dialogue: 0,2:42:06.29,2:42:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉拿不出手啊
Dialogue: 0,2:42:18.70,2:42:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,等等原本基底的头发先
Dialogue: 0,2:42:26.61,2:42:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得哪里不对劲
Dialogue: 0,2:42:29.18,2:42:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得哪里不对劲啊
Dialogue: 0,2:42:34.21,2:42:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来赐予我天赋吧
Dialogue: 0,2:42:48.52,2:42:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,请谁来
Dialogue: 0,2:42:49.33,2:42:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,赐予我天赋
Dialogue: 0,2:42:58.29,2:43:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请给我捏人的天赋
Dialogue: 0,2:43:12.38,2:43:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,2:43:27.70,2:43:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不像诶……
Dialogue: 0,2:43:32.06,2:43:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是色调不对吗
Dialogue: 0,2:43:39.20,2:43:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说呢——
Dialogue: 0,2:43:41.84,2:43:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时先……
Dialogue: 0,2:43:43.70,2:43:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下，把头发
Dialogue: 0,2:43:51.49,2:43:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,把头发暂时先设置成什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,2:44:00.47,2:44:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——……
Dialogue: 0,2:44:04.90,2:44:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,2:44:07.38,2:44:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是眼睛再画大一点会更像呢
Dialogue: 0,2:44:11.76,2:44:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等等双眼皮的部分弯弯曲曲的
Dialogue: 0,2:44:16.27,2:44:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,像吗，那样的话
Dialogue: 0,2:44:19.56,2:44:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛的位置有点太高了
Dialogue: 0,2:44:21.94,2:44:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,整体再往下一点吧
Dialogue: 0,2:44:27.28,2:44:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:44:27.73,2:44:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,2:44:30.75,2:44:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,设置成这个肤色
Dialogue: 0,2:44:36.32,2:44:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,然后眉毛可能还要再分开些
Dialogue: 0,2:44:45.38,2:44:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,2:44:54.13,2:44:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这种程度吗
Dialogue: 0,2:45:01.85,2:45:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴再下一格……不
Dialogue: 0,2:45:06.04,2:45:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,2:45:08.62,2:45:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,头发的...
Dialogue: 0,2:45:10.22,2:45:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,色……色调嘛，还行，就这样……
Dialogue: 0,2:45:13.16,2:45:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错呢
Dialogue: 0,2:45:16.48,2:45:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,「不知道能不能给你作参考」
Dialogue: 0,2:45:17.97,2:45:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,「把眼睛画大一点、做成Q版的话」
Dialogue: 0,2:45:20.54,2:45:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,「比较容易变可爱」
Dialogue: 0,2:45:22.17,2:45:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是说这个还太小吗
Dialogue: 0,2:45:26.34,2:45:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么感觉有点太大了，不好说啊
Dialogue: 0,2:45:32.59,2:45:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,头发……
Dialogue: 0,2:45:34.70,2:45:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,再多画一些更好吗？后面
Dialogue: 0,2:45:41.09,2:45:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,2:45:47.50,2:45:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,2:45:50.57,2:45:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我要做什么来着……
Dialogue: 0,2:45:57.57,2:45:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这里，腮红呢，果然
Dialogue: 0,2:46:00.79,2:46:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,得加上去呢
Dialogue: 0,2:46:12.44,2:46:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是太浓了
Dialogue: 0,2:46:20.77,2:46:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,再小一点
Dialogue: 0,2:46:26.67,2:46:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,像还是有点像的，相似程度的话
Dialogue: 0,2:46:34.10,2:46:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,隐隐约约的像
Dialogue: 0,2:46:42.04,2:46:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:46:54.38,2:46:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——稍微…
Dialogue: 0,2:46:58.01,2:46:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这边更接近吧
Dialogue: 0,2:47:05.26,2:47:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,再把眼皮往下一……
Dialogue: 0,2:47:07.60,2:47:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,点…
Dialogue: 0,2:47:13.61,2:47:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,再加粗？
Dialogue: 0,2:47:19.53,2:47:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,2:47:23.08,2:47:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等，面部涂装的
Dialogue: 0,2:47:30.76,2:47:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,蹭出去的部分
Dialogue: 0,2:47:33.84,2:47:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:47:34.35,2:47:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这些全都会动吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:47:37.67,2:47:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,原来这些全都会动啊
Dialogue: 0,2:47:50.39,2:47:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,2:47:51.69,2:47:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么，这个…
Dialogue: 0,2:47:52.99,2:47:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这个点
Dialogue: 0,2:47:54.57,2:47:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:48:01.53,2:48:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有个奇怪的素材
Dialogue: 0,2:48:32.47,2:48:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，想一口气全移动起来啊
Dialogue: 0,2:48:45.26,2:48:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这种感觉吗……
Dialogue: 0,2:48:49.08,2:48:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:49:10.50,2:49:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越搞不懂了
Dialogue: 0,2:49:18.91,2:49:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,太难力
Dialogue: 0,2:49:22.14,2:49:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,越画越搞不懂了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:49:29.01,2:49:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,印象里应该是这样的呢
Dialogue: 0,2:49:34.45,2:49:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这样一搞的话呢
Dialogue: 0,2:49:38.28,2:49:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,2:49:39.25,2:49:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,会那个嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:49:42.27,2:49:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,2:49:43.84,2:49:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,双眼皮也想换呢……
Dialogue: 0,2:49:46.57,2:49:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,开始完型崩坏力
Dialogue: 0,2:49:50.58,2:49:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,左边那个参考图呢
Dialogue: 0,2:49:52.52,2:49:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有点琉璃犬味了
Dialogue: 0,2:49:55.29,2:49:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,戴上帽子是不是会像呢
Dialogue: 0,2:49:58.58,2:49:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有帽子的话…
Dialogue: 0,2:50:01.88,2:50:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看着会像吗
Dialogue: 0,2:50:05.04,2:50:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,用细线
Dialogue: 0,2:50:07.37,2:50:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是因为没画轮廓，所以看起来才怪怪的呢
Dialogue: 0,2:50:11.51,2:50:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只有单色的话
Dialogue: 0,2:50:12.72,2:50:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:50:13.34,2:50:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的颜色，用了奇怪的颜色啊
Dialogue: 0,2:50:23.92,2:50:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只画轮廓…
Dialogue: 0,2:50:27.37,2:50:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,2:50:29.91,2:50:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,画上
Dialogue: 0,2:50:31.26,2:50:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,的话
Dialogue: 0,2:50:47.27,2:50:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,会变得像吗
Dialogue: 0,2:50:49.59,2:50:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:51:04.85,2:51:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,2:51:19.74,2:51:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要吧
Dialogue: 0,2:51:26.83,2:51:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要吧
Dialogue: 0,2:51:33.93,2:51:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，那个…
Dialogue: 0,2:51:35.40,2:51:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,直线…
Dialogue: 0,2:51:37.54,2:51:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,「笔的设置里有描边功能哦」
Dialogue: 0,2:51:41.36,2:51:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,笔的设置？我看看
Dialogue: 0,2:51:44.83,2:51:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,描边功能是哪个
Dialogue: 0,2:51:46.80,2:51:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这个？
Dialogue: 0,2:51:49.18,2:51:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:51:49.99,2:51:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:51:53.75,2:51:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:51:59.00,2:52:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么…等等等等，搞不懂搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,2:52:02.33,2:52:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有描边了？
Dialogue: 0,2:52:09.27,2:52:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:52:10.08,2:52:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，啊——
Dialogue: 0,2:52:19.88,2:52:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,线条……好脏！
Dialogue: 0,2:52:28.29,2:52:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然描上边了
Dialogue: 0,2:52:34.55,2:52:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,有点……w
Dialogue: 0,2:52:39.17,2:52:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微那个……不需要吧
Dialogue: 0,2:52:42.82,2:52:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不放大看看的话，总觉得…
Dialogue: 0,2:52:46.23,2:52:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好脏
Dialogue: 0,2:52:48.80,2:52:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然帮我解谜很开心
Dialogue: 0,2:52:51.32,2:52:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但原本线条就不是直的
Dialogue: 0,2:52:54.13,2:52:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,因为弯弯曲曲的嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:52:55.94,2:52:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有的话，反而觉得多余…
Dialogue: 0,2:52:58.39,2:52:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不好吧
Dialogue: 0,2:53:16.22,2:53:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不没有比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,2:53:19.44,2:53:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还要，还要再模糊一点
Dialogue: 0,2:53:21.65,2:53:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧，感觉迷茫了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:53:27.70,2:53:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有完型崩坏吗
Dialogue: 0,2:53:32.74,2:53:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但是……画上去比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,2:53:37.26,2:53:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,像耳朵一样的
Dialogue: 0,2:53:38.96,2:53:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,毛
Dialogue: 0,2:53:46.18,2:53:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,2:53:47.46,2:53:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,双马尾的部分
Dialogue: 0,2:53:49.43,2:53:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等等等等
Dialogue: 0,2:53:50.60,2:53:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,描边先关掉
Dialogue: 0,2:54:08.80,2:54:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:54:21.59,2:54:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,果然这个
Dialogue: 0,2:54:23.01,2:54:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…耳朵
Dialogue: 0,2:54:24.52,2:54:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,与其说耳朵
Dialogue: 0,2:54:27.82,2:54:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,头发
Dialogue: 0,2:54:30.82,2:54:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有的话可能就会看着像
Dialogue: 0,2:54:36.13,2:54:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不觉得吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:54:38.54,2:54:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是
Dialogue: 0,2:54:48.41,2:54:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,2:54:51.77,2:54:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有没有，会影响…
Dialogue: 0,2:54:55.59,2:54:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得差很多
Dialogue: 0,2:55:05.23,2:55:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,出来的这个
Dialogue: 0,2:55:07.29,2:55:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是说回来，这
Dialogue: 0,2:55:09.16,2:55:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦把轮廓画得太清楚的话…
Dialogue: 0,2:55:13.75,2:55:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这个的感觉……
Dialogue: 0,2:55:22.26,2:55:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微浅一点的
Dialogue: 0,2:55:24.03,2:55:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不是浅…果然还是深一点的好吗……
Dialogue: 0,2:55:43.94,2:55:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,像描摹一样
Dialogue: 0,2:55:56.69,2:55:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,叠加颜色
Dialogue: 0,2:56:17.02,2:56:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是太难了
Dialogue: 0,2:56:26.14,2:56:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没法画的可爱——
Dialogue: 0,2:56:28.89,2:56:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉说……
Dialogue: 0,2:56:30.46,2:56:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而且很扁平
Dialogue: 0,2:56:35.33,2:56:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然也不是没有觉得有点可惜
Dialogue: 0,2:56:39.96,2:56:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得，非常…
Dialogue: 0,2:56:45.23,2:56:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,难
Dialogue: 0,2:56:59.41,2:57:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,到底哪里不一样呢
Dialogue: 0,2:57:02.75,2:57:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真难搞啊
Dialogue: 0,2:57:05.64,2:57:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不懂了
Dialogue: 0,2:57:07.89,2:57:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时
Dialogue: 0,2:57:11.55,2:57:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好脏……
Dialogue: 0,2:57:14.04,2:57:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好脏啊
Dialogue: 0,2:57:15.64,2:57:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,太脏了
Dialogue: 0,2:57:17.52,2:57:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,果然头发…
Dialogue: 0,2:57:20.18,2:57:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,2:57:21.72,2:57:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,擦掉吗……
Dialogue: 0,2:57:28.10,2:57:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不是这样
Dialogue: 0,2:57:38.29,2:57:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不对呢
Dialogue: 0,2:57:43.59,2:57:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,「是不是有点蓬乱感」
Dialogue: 0,2:57:45.67,2:57:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,大体上呢
Dialogue: 0,2:57:49.40,2:57:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始觉得感觉还不错……
Dialogue: 0,2:58:01.77,2:58:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,狗狗感
Dialogue: 0,2:58:11.20,2:58:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在哪里、哪里搞错了呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:58:17.97,2:58:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「已经很接近了」
Dialogue: 0,2:58:20.37,2:58:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「乍看一眼能知道是谁」真的？
Dialogue: 0,2:58:23.38,2:58:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,「把参考放到旁边吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:58:26.12,2:58:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我好歹是照着样本做的哦
Dialogue: 0,2:58:31.46,2:58:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且呢
Dialogue: 0,2:58:39.55,2:58:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,2:58:47.45,2:58:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要稍微离远点看吗
Dialogue: 0,2:58:52.17,2:58:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,2:59:02.35,2:59:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,刘海怎么样呢～
Dialogue: 0,2:59:13.34,2:59:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,脸的部件本身…
Dialogue: 0,2:59:17.62,2:59:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还行？
Dialogue: 0,2:59:19.06,2:59:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等水分
Dialogue: 0,2:59:20.87,2:59:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,先补充水分
Dialogue: 0,2:59:27.55,2:59:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,「明明还行的」啊真的？还行？
Dialogue: 0,2:59:40.26,2:59:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,脸的话……
Dialogue: 0,2:59:42.47,2:59:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,脸的话……说的……是呢
Dialogue: 0,2:59:51.24,2:59:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,全部挪起来吗
Dialogue: 0,2:59:57.27,2:59:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「换毛期{\alpha&H80&}的琉璃犬{\alpha&H00&}」
Dialogue: 0,3:00:05.32,3:00:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个……是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,3:00:15.83,3:00:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,3:00:20.22,3:00:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,比想象的更
Dialogue: 0,3:00:23.50,3:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有难度
Dialogue: 0,3:00:25.45,3:00:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,脸像琉璃酱吗
Dialogue: 0,3:00:32.07,3:00:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,脸像的话
Dialogue: 0,3:00:33.73,3:00:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,会有点开心
Dialogue: 0,3:00:43.98,3:00:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是头发……的关系吗
Dialogue: 0,3:01:15.27,3:01:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:01:32.98,3:01:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还要更直一点呢
Dialogue: 0,3:01:39.88,3:01:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,首先线条……
Dialogue: 0,3:01:42.15,3:01:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不画的直的话
Dialogue: 0,3:01:44.70,3:01:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就成不了事
Dialogue: 0,3:02:04.96,3:02:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么才能
Dialogue: 0,3:02:07.64,3:02:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,把线
Dialogue: 0,3:02:09.26,3:02:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,画直啊
Dialogue: 0,3:02:11.87,3:02:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,线条
Dialogue: 0,3:02:14.71,3:02:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么做才能…
Dialogue: 0,3:02:16.97,3:02:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,变得笔直呢
Dialogue: 0,3:02:23.38,3:02:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,头发…难的就是难啊
Dialogue: 0,3:02:30.99,3:02:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,再次觉得
Dialogue: 0,3:02:33.37,3:02:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,做得好的Liver们
Dialogue: 0,3:02:35.61,3:02:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:02:38.09,3:02:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:02:42.70,3:02:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大家……
Dialogue: 0,3:02:43.88,3:02:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,无一例外都太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,3:02:59.86,3:03:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,3:03:04.22,3:03:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,画图里也有画直线的功能对吧
Dialogue: 0,3:03:08.05,3:03:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,「也有人用数位板画的吧」
Dialogue: 0,3:03:09.82,3:03:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真假的啊？有吗
Dialogue: 0,3:03:15.13,3:03:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,说到底能用数位板画吗
Dialogue: 0,3:03:23.46,3:03:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不用Switch的手柄的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:03:26.61,3:03:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不难吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:03:28.58,3:03:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没那回事？
Dialogue: 0,3:04:06.43,3:04:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,「不从底座上拿下来就没法用数位板」
Dialogue: 0,3:04:09.82,3:04:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,「所以在直播里好像不行」
Dialogue: 0,3:04:11.61,3:04:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,3:04:15.72,3:04:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不过能用啊
Dialogue: 0,3:04:17.38,3:04:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,数位板
Dialogue: 0,3:04:18.63,3:04:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且可以？
Dialogue: 0,3:04:47.19,3:04:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪？
Dialogue: 0,3:04:48.77,3:04:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,搞错了
Dialogue: 0,3:04:54.36,3:04:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？啊这里
Dialogue: 0,3:04:57.71,3:04:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没有闭合吗
Dialogue: 0,3:05:12.91,3:05:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,总感觉……
Dialogue: 0,3:05:16.92,3:05:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,算了算了
Dialogue: 0,3:05:18.63,3:05:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就做到这样吗
Dialogue: 0,3:05:21.41,3:05:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,检讨过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:05:23.30,3:05:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,3:05:24.62,3:05:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:05:27.32,3:05:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然感觉有点那什么
Dialogue: 0,3:05:34.01,3:05:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,检讨过了吗……ww
Dialogue: 0,3:05:37.35,3:05:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,小学生会画的
Dialogue: 0,3:05:40.27,3:05:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,连小学生都能像样的画吗
Dialogue: 0,3:05:51.09,3:05:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,美、美大生的
Dialogue: 0,3:05:54.22,3:05:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,身份还是还回去罢
Dialogue: 0,3:05:57.24,3:05:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,美大生……
Dialogue: 0,3:06:00.73,3:06:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,退还
Dialogue: 0,3:06:04.12,3:06:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,事件
Dialogue: 0,3:06:07.60,3:06:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,再一次，成为拜尔金沃斯学院生
Dialogue: 0,3:06:13.10,3:06:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,去一次吧
Dialogue: 0,3:06:14.69,3:06:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,检讨过了
Dialogue: 0,3:06:16.61,3:06:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这个侧边部分，这里其实发量还要更大
Dialogue: 0,3:06:21.74,3:06:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上的话
Dialogue: 0,3:06:25.24,3:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,其实，是这种程度？
Dialogue: 0,3:06:27.75,3:06:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,对……
Dialogue: 0,3:06:30.89,3:06:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,3:06:32.55,3:06:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,其实啊
Dialogue: 0,3:06:35.86,3:06:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，不知为什么
Dialogue: 0,3:06:42.70,3:06:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不，那个，我知道了
Dialogue: 0,3:06:46.77,3:06:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，琉璃酱
Dialogue: 0,3:06:50.41,3:06:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,太过
Dialogue: 0,3:06:51.71,3:06:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱的问题吧
Dialogue: 0,3:06:55.27,3:06:58.08,AN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}※もへもへの絵文字：\N跟着歌曲中写假名的指示\N最后拼出一张人脸的那个东西
Dialogue: 0,3:06:55.28,3:06:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是跟着歌一起话的话……
Dialogue: 0,3:06:58.66,3:07:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我也能画出来
Dialogue: 0,3:07:03.43,3:07:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,3:07:04.80,3:07:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,过于可爱这种事
Dialogue: 0,3:07:07.26,3:07:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,会有
Dialogue: 0,3:07:09.45,3:07:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,问题啊
Dialogue: 0,3:07:11.53,3:07:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是太过可爱了
Dialogue: 0,3:07:14.67,3:07:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有那种事
Dialogue: 0,3:07:15.98,3:07:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,吧
Dialogue: 0,3:07:18.49,3:07:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,3:07:37.94,3:07:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,会断掉呢，这里
Dialogue: 0,3:07:45.42,3:07:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊——
Dialogue: 0,3:07:51.44,3:07:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,乱七八糟
Dialogue: 0,3:07:52.72,3:07:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,倒也不是至今最差的，相对花了时间
Dialogue: 0,3:08:00.56,3:08:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:08:02.89,3:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不对
Dialogue: 0,3:08:06.06,3:08:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,总感觉……
Dialogue: 0,3:08:07.94,3:08:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么看上去那么偷工减料啊
Dialogue: 0,3:08:11.84,3:08:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,大概琉璃酱……
Dialogue: 0,3:08:13.80,3:08:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，之前没有那种模糊的感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:08:17.73,3:08:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，果然还是头发啊
Dialogue: 0,3:08:24.16,3:08:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,也太陷入苦战了吧，果然还是默认的更好吧
Dialogue: 0,3:08:32.34,3:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等，如果要妥协的话
Dialogue: 0,3:08:36.29,3:08:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话，这边还好点呢
Dialogue: 0,3:08:38.76,3:08:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话，也许什么都不动会更好
Dialogue: 0,3:08:44.30,3:08:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是描边的线吗
Dialogue: 0,3:08:47.15,3:08:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有种不是这个的感觉……
Dialogue: 0,3:08:49.58,3:08:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都不画……
Dialogue: 0,3:08:52.13,3:08:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至可能还更像也说不定
Dialogue: 0,3:08:56.80,3:08:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,3:09:02.72,3:09:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,重置吧
Dialogue: 0,3:09:08.64,3:09:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还……
Dialogue: 0,3:09:09.40,3:09:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，还是这个更好也说不定
Dialogue: 0,3:09:13.37,3:09:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,还是这个……
Dialogue: 0,3:09:16.06,3:09:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是作品不一样
Dialogue: 0,3:09:19.45,3:09:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不是更好吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:09:21.24,3:09:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此……
Dialogue: 0,3:09:35.09,3:09:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要是太过……
Dialogue: 0,3:09:36.23,3:09:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,画得太细致反而不好哦
Dialogue: 0,3:09:47.33,3:09:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,3:09:51.31,3:09:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,特意的不要大张旗鼓
Dialogue: 0,3:09:58.55,3:09:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,去画
Dialogue: 0,3:10:11.63,3:10:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就像这样呢
Dialogue: 0,3:10:16.60,3:10:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也许，还是这个好一点吧，大概
Dialogue: 0,3:10:27.27,3:10:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,3:10:49.30,3:10:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,真难啊
Dialogue: 0,3:10:55.81,3:10:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,画狗狗这事
Dialogue: 0,3:10:58.57,3:10:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,琉璃犬
Dialogue: 0,3:10:59.89,3:11:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好难
Dialogue: 0,3:11:01.26,3:11:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,3:11:02.99,3:11:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,都说画动物很难嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:11:06.96,3:11:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,动物难画是公认的嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:11:34.41,3:11:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,3:11:35.23,3:11:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有点厚重感倒是
Dialogue: 0,3:11:43.94,3:11:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,算了算了
Dialogue: 0,3:11:46.81,3:11:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,算了算了，还有鼻子和…
Dialogue: 0,3:11:52.50,3:11:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得比刚才好一些，比起刚才
Dialogue: 0,3:12:01.63,3:12:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,3:12:04.51,3:12:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,开始失去对捏角色的自信了
Dialogue: 0,3:12:11.37,3:12:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,3:12:14.61,3:12:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,狗狗那个很可爱果然还是留下…
Dialogue: 0,3:12:17.70,3:12:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为很可爱所以一开始也想好好的画的可爱呢……
Dialogue: 0,3:12:21.78,3:12:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不过大概这个画了也看不见呢
Dialogue: 0,3:12:27.07,3:12:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看得见吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:12:32.52,3:12:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,反过来说太深了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:12:36.25,3:12:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还是该变形抽象一下的
Dialogue: 0,3:12:39.88,3:12:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看不见也行吧
Dialogue: 0,3:12:42.99,3:12:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我学会妥协了
Dialogue: 0,3:12:59.52,3:13:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我还以为琉璃酱比较容易画呢——
Dialogue: 0,3:13:04.51,3:13:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,「说起来，这是第一个非人类居民呢」
Dialogue: 0,3:13:07.00,3:13:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,3:13:10.00,3:13:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我本来打算接下来也画非人类的居民的
Dialogue: 0,3:13:15.08,3:13:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,开始变得不确定了呢
Dialogue: 0,3:13:22.60,3:13:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,3:13:24.16,3:13:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的
Dialogue: 0,3:13:27.43,3:13:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,认不出来
Dialogue: 0,3:13:31.86,3:13:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是
Dialogue: 0,3:13:33.08,3:13:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,初见的话
Dialogue: 0,3:13:35.21,3:13:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,能认出是琉璃酱的人……
Dialogue: 0,3:13:38.92,3:13:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,会有吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:13:44.48,3:13:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,「哭肿了？」
Dialogue: 0,3:13:46.28,3:13:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有点太浓了？
Dialogue: 0,3:13:49.28,3:13:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「拉远看不就好了吗？」
Dialogue: 0,3:13:51.11,3:13:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,3:13:53.00,3:13:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有帽子的话…会那个吗……
Dialogue: 0,3:13:58.16,3:13:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛，不过比刚才好点吧……
Dialogue: 0,3:13:59.50,3:14:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像作品不一样……
Dialogue: 0,3:14:01.60,3:14:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是那种感觉呢
Dialogue: 0,3:14:06.30,3:14:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,多少有点？
Dialogue: 0,3:14:11.28,3:14:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是看上去不一样啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:14:14.07,3:14:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅不了自己啊
Dialogue: 0,3:14:17.35,3:14:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法原谅自己
Dialogue: 0,3:14:23.00,3:14:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,行吗，真的就这样？
Dialogue: 0,3:14:24.75,3:14:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,妥协…不过
Dialogue: 0,3:14:26.29,3:14:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对，不要妥协继续劳动的结果就是那个
Dialogue: 0,3:14:29.70,3:14:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,3:14:30.51,3:14:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,3:14:31.79,3:14:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就好
Dialogue: 0,3:14:33.29,3:14:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别动了，我
Dialogue: 0,3:14:35.22,3:14:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,别折腾了
Dialogue: 0,3:14:38.43,3:14:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别再弄了，我大概…
Dialogue: 0,3:14:41.47,3:14:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,反正再怎么弄也没用
Dialogue: 0,3:14:46.96,3:14:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,住手吧
Dialogue: 0,3:14:49.20,3:14:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你看，已经不知道发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,3:14:55.91,3:14:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是什么样来着？
Dialogue: 0,3:15:00.04,3:15:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是怎么弄的来着？
Dialogue: 0,3:15:05.19,3:15:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我是怎么做的？
Dialogue: 0,3:15:10.64,3:15:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是怎么做的来着……
Dialogue: 0,3:15:14.48,3:15:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,老师您冷静一下
Dialogue: 0,3:15:16.41,3:15:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要是没去碰就好了……
Dialogue: 0,3:15:20.12,3:15:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,话说，这就是极限？
Dialogue: 0,3:15:22.14,3:15:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,3:15:24.62,3:15:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就算说别弄了……
Dialogue: 0,3:15:31.54,3:15:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不，就是，想能不能做些什么
Dialogue: 0,3:15:39.57,3:15:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀真可爱，脸再稍微…
Dialogue: 0,3:15:49.25,3:15:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,无法原谅啊我
Dialogue: 0,3:15:51.11,3:15:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:15:52.14,3:15:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,3:15:54.22,3:15:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有的话可能更好
Dialogue: 0,3:16:02.51,3:16:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有的话更好吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:16:04.36,3:16:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,头发碍事看不清…自己画的头发好碍事
Dialogue: 0,3:16:10.94,3:16:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「变得像在垂死挣扎w」嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:16:14.68,3:16:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,确实完全是这样呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:16:27.04,3:16:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,只知道有什么地方不对
Dialogue: 0,3:16:38.83,3:16:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊……有什么不对呢……
Dialogue: 0,3:16:53.33,3:16:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,「你和照片不太一样啊」
Dialogue: 0,3:16:58.01,3:17:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,「修过反而违和感更强了，这是大家都会经历的路w」
Dialogue: 0,3:17:03.08,3:17:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这个的话——怎么样……
Dialogue: 0,3:17:06.73,3:17:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样，已经不能再改了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:17:11.14,3:17:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,诶能看出来吗这个？
Dialogue: 0,3:17:13.39,3:17:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，是琉璃酱啊——之类的
Dialogue: 0,3:17:17.62,3:17:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我是看不出
Dialogue: 0,3:17:20.25,3:17:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谁啊，有这种Liver吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:17:23.32,3:17:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,成这样
Dialogue: 0,3:17:27.33,3:17:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,算了，没办法吧
Dialogue: 0,3:17:29.18,3:17:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,「感觉离记忆有点远」
Dialogue: 0,3:17:32.12,3:17:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,大概，越是摆弄的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:17:34.97,3:17:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,越会陷入沼泽
Dialogue: 0,3:17:36.13,3:17:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定被施加了这种能力的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,3:17:43.82,3:17:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛吗——
Dialogue: 0,3:17:47.47,3:17:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,「戴上帽子吧w」
Dialogue: 0,3:17:48.74,3:17:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就算戴上了帽子
Dialogue: 0,3:17:51.37,3:17:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然可能会好一点……算了算了
Dialogue: 0,3:17:54.76,3:17:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,3:17:55.51,3:17:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真的对不起
Dialogue: 0,3:17:57.90,3:17:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱，我的理解…
Dialogue: 0,3:17:59.95,3:18:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,实在太浅了
Dialogue: 0,3:18:04.77,3:18:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,啊呀——真是不甘心
Dialogue: 0,3:18:04.83,3:18:08.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哎呀，好不甘心啊，还差一点…
Dialogue: 0,3:18:08.89,3:18:10.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不行了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:18:11.38,3:18:14.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,至少对于其他Liver是谁这点
Dialogue: 0,3:18:15.09,3:18:16.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么说稍微
Dialogue: 0,3:18:16.50,3:18:17.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还是能认出来的…
Dialogue: 0,3:18:19.08,3:18:20.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就叫琉璃酱
Dialogue: 0,3:18:26.63,3:18:28.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，栞叶
Dialogue: 0,3:18:28.47,3:18:29.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也填进去吧
Dialogue: 0,3:18:33.80,3:18:34.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,全名
Dialogue: 0,3:18:35.76,3:18:37.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯…但是…
Dialogue: 0,3:18:38.53,3:18:39.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉适合吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:18:40.96,3:18:43.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西…是西西…酱
Dialogue: 0,3:18:45.28,3:18:47.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就叫琉璃比较好吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:18:49.89,3:18:50.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱…
Dialogue: 0,3:18:52.59,3:18:53.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就琉璃吧
Dialogue: 0,3:18:58.84,3:18:59.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,3:19:01.84,3:19:03.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:19:04.53,3:19:05.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？等等
Dialogue: 0,3:19:08.27,3:19:09.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍等一下w
Dialogue: 0,3:19:10.85,3:19:11.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我可能知道了
Dialogue: 0,3:19:11.84,3:19:13.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概那个…
Dialogue: 0,3:19:14.01,3:19:15.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是太靠上了
Dialogue: 0,3:19:21.64,3:19:22.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,3:19:37.01,3:19:39.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微往下调一格
Dialogue: 0,3:19:39.24,3:19:40.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,了以后
Dialogue: 0,3:19:42.38,3:19:43.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，有一点点！
Dialogue: 0,3:19:45.32,3:19:46.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一点点…
Dialogue: 0,3:19:48.00,3:19:49.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还太高了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:19:52.40,3:19:54.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也许找到违和感了…
Dialogue: 0,3:19:58.80,3:20:00.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,眼睛的位置…
Dialogue: 0,3:20:02.99,3:20:05.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再怎么说下过头…不
Dialogue: 0,3:20:09.14,3:20:10.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再怎么说也太大了吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:20:15.12,3:20:16.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍、稍微等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,3:20:24.17,3:20:24.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,3:20:24.80,3:20:26.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,刚才那样更好
Dialogue: 0,3:20:36.97,3:20:38.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:20:46.83,3:20:48.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,唔…
Dialogue: 0,3:20:53.53,3:20:54.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:20:58.83,3:21:01.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「眼睛间距靠拢一点也可以吧」靠拢看看？
Dialogue: 0,3:21:03.29,3:21:06.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微感觉……有点不对呢
Dialogue: 0,3:21:07.40,3:21:10.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉间距宽一点…比较像
Dialogue: 0,3:21:10.99,3:21:13.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，快别搞了，我自己
Dialogue: 0,3:21:13.25,3:21:14.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,到这里为止吧
Dialogue: 0,3:21:16.11,3:21:17.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,到此为止别搞了
Dialogue: 0,3:21:20.92,3:21:22.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再往前可是沼泽啊
Dialogue: 0,3:21:27.41,3:21:28.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,停下吧
Dialogue: 0,3:21:28.76,3:21:29.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再继续的话
Dialogue: 0,3:21:30.10,3:21:32.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就是在折磨自己了
Dialogue: 0,3:21:33.04,3:21:35.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉越是折腾越感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:21:35.63,3:21:39.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一辈子大概都会感到不满意
Dialogue: 0,3:21:39.11,3:21:41.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然感觉也没那么糟
Dialogue: 0,3:21:41.39,3:21:43.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不好说呢……
Dialogue: 0,3:21:47.62,3:21:50.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个感觉，再稍微…
Dialogue: 0,3:21:51.13,3:21:51.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好好地…
Dialogue: 0,3:21:53.84,3:21:55.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想要做得更好呢
Dialogue: 0,3:21:55.22,3:21:56.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就自称本人吧
Dialogue: 0,3:22:01.94,3:22:03.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,本人…
Dialogue: 0,3:22:07.84,3:22:09.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然……后
Dialogue: 0,3:22:09.73,3:22:10.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,自定义
Dialogue: 0,3:22:11.60,3:22:14.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「我觉得做得很可爱哦」真的？
Dialogue: 0,3:22:15.71,3:22:19.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果不这么说的话，我一辈子都要陷在这个沼泽里了
Dialogue: 0,3:22:50.01,3:22:51.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，这种程度吗
Dialogue: 0,3:22:55.11,3:22:56.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，这样如何
Dialogue: 0,3:23:08.23,3:23:09.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再稍微…
Dialogue: 0,3:23:11.49,3:23:13.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，大概这种感觉吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:16.94,3:23:18.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还是太细了？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:22.69,3:23:23.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,3:23:25.07,3:23:26.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不在
Dialogue: 0,3:23:26.97,3:23:29.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,行动模式是，急性子
Dialogue: 0,3:23:30.46,3:23:32.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,偏急性子的吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:33.45,3:23:34.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,措辞…
Dialogue: 0,3:23:36.01,3:23:39.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉比较直接一点…？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:40.23,3:23:42.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,倒是有直接的印象呢……
Dialogue: 0,3:23:42.12,3:23:43.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,温和的……
Dialogue: 0,3:23:43.36,3:23:44.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,直接的……
Dialogue: 0,3:23:45.19,3:23:46.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,表情是…？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:48.45,3:23:52.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,丰富但偏冷面吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:53.51,3:23:54.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,丰富一点…
Dialogue: 0,3:23:54.98,3:23:57.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，更偏向冷面…？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:59.56,3:24:00.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,思维方式……
Dialogue: 0,3:24:00.71,3:24:02.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,认真的印象…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:03.85,3:24:07.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是意外地、意外地活泼，有随性的一面
Dialogue: 0,3:24:08.22,3:24:10.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也是个个性丰富的人呢
Dialogue: 0,3:24:11.56,3:24:14.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,乍一看…还是更偏向这边吧
Dialogue: 0,3:24:17.02,3:24:20.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说来虽然非常像常识人，但其实相当有个性
Dialogue: 0,3:24:21.06,3:24:22.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有丰富的印象…w
Dialogue: 0,3:24:26.93,3:24:30.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过果然还是更偏向常识人吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:34.13,3:24:35.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,到底怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:41.48,3:24:43.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哎，是个性吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:44.86,3:24:46.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「Liver们都很有个性」
Dialogue: 0,3:24:46.48,3:24:49.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是啊，说到这个大家都有个性感…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:49.81,3:24:53.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，但说起来好歹是警察啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:54.78,3:24:56.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要说的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:57.26,3:24:59.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,更偏向于这边吧
Dialogue: 0,3:25:03.70,3:25:07.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「16类型中是哪一个吗？我觉得是常识人型」
Dialogue: 0,3:25:08.18,3:25:09.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:10.28,3:25:12.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微偏认真…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:13.22,3:25:16.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我觉得大概是……这边吧
Dialogue: 0,3:25:21.02,3:25:22.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不好说呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:23.84,3:25:25.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没错吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:28.43,3:25:29.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「姑且」w
Dialogue: 0,3:25:29.50,3:25:34.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,与其说姑且，Liver们都是很有
Dialogue: 0,3:25:34.26,3:25:35.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,个性的呢
Dialogue: 0,3:25:41.26,3:25:44.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就设置成这样吧，暂时先
Dialogue: 0,3:25:46.25,3:25:48.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要是不对的话再改吧
Dialogue: 0,3:25:49.04,3:25:50.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,干爽系，自信者
Dialogue: 0,3:25:50.90,3:25:54.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,形式主义、讨厌失败、急躁、说话直接、注重成果
Dialogue: 0,3:25:55.07,3:25:57.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉有点不一样
Dialogue: 0,3:25:57.37,3:26:00.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,干练型，强势拼搏的类xi
Dialogue: 0,3:26:00.19,3:26:00.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,类型
Dialogue: 0,3:26:01.16,3:26:05.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,目标定得越高越有干劲，也有丢三落四的一面
Dialogue: 0,3:26:06.33,3:26:08.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也有丢三落四的一面…嗯…
Dialogue: 0,3:26:09.07,3:26:12.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉对的上的地方虽然是对的上的……
Dialogue: 0,3:26:13.79,3:26:15.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但还没那么…
Dialogue: 0,3:26:17.11,3:26:20.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉也没有呢，急躁，这个那个
Dialogue: 0,3:26:20.60,3:26:24.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人的时候也是，已经怎么说干爽系什么的有点像…
Dialogue: 0,3:26:25.08,3:26:27.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉出来过那样的描述
Dialogue: 0,3:26:32.54,3:26:33.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就这样吧，好
Dialogue: 0,3:26:36.82,3:26:38.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「要为琉璃建房子了吗」
Dialogue: 0,3:26:38.58,3:26:41.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「这次开始可以在你喜欢的地方建了」啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:26:41.71,3:26:43.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:26:45.27,3:26:47.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等等，琉璃酱也是啊，变成琉璃了
Dialogue: 0,3:26:48.28,3:26:50.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有违和感吗，还是没关系吗……
Dialogue: 0,3:26:51.93,3:26:54.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后在莉泽大人的旁边，做邻居
Dialogue: 0,3:26:55.42,3:26:56.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，错位了
Dialogue: 0,3:26:56.71,3:26:58.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,A型血人要大发狂了
Dialogue: 0,3:26:58.92,3:27:01.81,SCRIPT,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜那个，你是主人吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:27:02.18,3:27:03.39,SCRIPT,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜初次见面，本人
Dialogue: 0,3:27:03.41,3:27:05.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉两边的双马尾……
Dialogue: 0,3:27:04.60,3:27:05.64,SCRIPT,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜名为琉璃
Dialogue: 0,3:27:06.05,3:27:07.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉扎的好毛糙……
Dialogue: 0,3:27:06.39,3:27:09.10,SCRIPT,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜我是干爽系干练型
Dialogue: 0,3:27:09.37,3:27:11.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜目标越高越有干劲的类型
Dialogue: 0,3:27:12.47,3:27:14.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜请多关照
Dialogue: 0,3:27:13.70,3:27:15.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,请多关照～
Dialogue: 0,3:27:18.80,3:27:20.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,3:27:20.83,3:27:24.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那么给琉璃酱的第一个食物，就给我的手作蛋糕吧
Dialogue: 0,3:27:27.73,3:27:28.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:27:28.84,3:27:30.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜我开动了
Dialogue: 0,3:27:34.86,3:27:37.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有两对双马尾啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:27:38.28,3:27:39.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,算了算了……
Dialogue: 0,3:27:39.96,3:27:41.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不能再多在意了……
Dialogue: 0,3:27:41.52,3:27:43.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,别在意了啊，我自己
Dialogue: 0,3:27:43.77,3:27:45.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,别看，别看违和感
Dialogue: 0,3:27:48.58,3:27:51.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜我觉得自己也是相当不服输的
Dialogue: 0,3:27:53.01,3:27:54.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不服输
Dialogue: 0,3:27:56.90,3:27:58.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像这样摸呢
Dialogue: 0,3:28:01.22,3:28:02.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是双马尾……
Dialogue: 0,3:28:02.96,3:28:05.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,四马尾……？这该叫什么
Dialogue: 0,3:28:06.94,3:28:08.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,因为是双……
Dialogue: 0,3:28:09.55,3:28:11.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,四、四马尾……
Dialogue: 0,3:28:12.22,3:28:14.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,米斯塔会讨厌的
Dialogue: 0,3:28:14.37,3:28:15.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「很可爱哦」
Dialogue: 0,3:28:15.89,3:28:16.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:28:18.32,3:28:20.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「话说回来，这次开始没看侧面呢」
Dialogue: 0,3:28:20.68,3:28:23.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我想侧面已经不该再去在意了
Dialogue: 0,3:28:29.70,3:28:31.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也没办法吧
Dialogue: 0,3:28:31.40,3:28:31.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,已经…
Dialogue: 0,3:28:34.87,3:28:35.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,3:28:39.70,3:28:40.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,3:28:43.05,3:28:44.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜深夜好
Dialogue: 0,3:28:45.71,3:28:47.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是看不出是谁呢……
Dialogue: 0,3:28:46.45,3:28:47.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜脑子里想太多了
Dialogue: 0,3:28:47.73,3:28:49.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜脑袋晕晕的
Dialogue: 0,3:28:50.68,3:28:53.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,让我看看让我看看，在想什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:28:53.21,3:28:54.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜拿走拿走～
Dialogue: 0,3:28:58.14,3:28:59.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,红豆糯米饭？
Dialogue: 0,3:29:01.12,3:29:02.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,肚子饿了？
Dialogue: 0,3:29:05.20,3:29:07.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,红豆糯米饭？这个是？
Dialogue: 0,3:29:05.20,3:29:07.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜清爽多了
Dialogue: 0,3:29:07.53,3:29:09.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这是什么？是红豆糯米饭啊
Dialogue: 0,3:29:11.78,3:29:12.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:29:15.35,3:29:16.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,3:29:17.74,3:29:19.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我现在注意到了，那个……
Dialogue: 0,3:29:19.83,3:29:21.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯？等一下
Dialogue: 0,3:29:22.99,3:29:23.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，太好了
Dialogue: 0,3:29:23.99,3:29:26.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我还以为鲜奶油蛋糕会掉到榜外
Dialogue: 0,3:29:30.42,3:29:32.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是想吃吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:29:34.37,3:29:35.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜我开动了
Dialogue: 0,3:29:36.68,3:29:38.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,因为大约是在脑子里
Dialogue: 0,3:29:39.14,3:29:41.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,现在应该是想要吧
Dialogue: 0,3:29:42.61,3:29:43.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如何？
Dialogue: 0,3:29:46.67,3:29:47.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢？……
Dialogue: 0,3:29:48.63,3:29:49.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,第一名
Dialogue: 0,3:29:53.86,3:29:55.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜别人碰过的东西…
Dialogue: 0,3:29:55.93,3:29:57.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜总觉得不太想碰了
Dialogue: 0,3:29:58.14,3:29:59.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然能理解……
Dialogue: 0,3:29:59.64,3:30:00.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过不过
Dialogue: 0,3:30:01.79,3:30:03.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,心情到也不是不明白哦
Dialogue: 0,3:30:03.75,3:30:06.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个，不知道是谁碰过的感觉有点…
Dialogue: 0,3:30:07.30,3:30:10.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就会有点在意到底是谁碰过之类的…
Dialogue: 0,3:30:13.26,3:30:14.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么了莉泽大人
Dialogue: 0,3:30:13.98,3:30:14.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜ 晚上好
Dialogue: 0,3:30:15.20,3:30:16.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,3:30:16.74,3:30:19.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜想吃主人做的东西
Dialogue: 0,3:30:19.41,3:30:21.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我的？！可以哦
Dialogue: 0,3:30:23.77,3:30:26.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过这个会喜欢吗……甜食
Dialogue: 0,3:30:23.77,3:30:24.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜我开动了
Dialogue: 0,3:30:29.76,3:30:30.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,3:30:33.26,3:30:35.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，非常好吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:30:36.44,3:30:38.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还好还好，你不会在照顾我的心情吧
Dialogue: 0,3:30:41.81,3:30:44.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过没排进榜内w
Dialogue: 0,3:30:44.82,3:30:46.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,谁都没get到
Dialogue: 0,3:30:48.52,3:30:49.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我的……
Dialogue: 0,3:30:50.92,3:30:53.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，有、有点恋爱了呢
Dialogue: 0,3:30:54.97,3:30:56.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜这份心情……
Dialogue: 0,3:30:56.51,3:30:58.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜到底是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:30:58.28,3:31:00.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一直在为恋爱烦恼啊
Dialogue: 0,3:31:00.08,3:31:04.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜虽然不太了解莉泽·赫尔埃斯塔大人，但我感受到了命运
Dialogue: 0,3:31:02.43,3:31:03.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然不太了解ww
Dialogue: 0,3:31:04.77,3:31:07.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜我，应该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,3:31:05.50,3:31:07.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然不太了解呢
Dialogue: 0,3:31:08.74,3:31:11.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能确实有那种奇妙的命运呢
Dialogue: 0,3:31:13.50,3:31:15.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「突然告白」/「自己去想」
Dialogue: 0,3:31:15.89,3:31:16.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,太冷淡了～
Dialogue: 0,3:31:17.18,3:31:18.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「还是放弃比较好」……
Dialogue: 0,3:31:19.38,3:31:21.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「首先从朋友开始」
Dialogue: 0,3:31:21.39,3:31:23.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等等，如果都还不太了解的话
Dialogue: 0,3:31:24.94,3:31:26.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,首先…
Dialogue: 0,3:31:26.38,3:31:28.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不、不太懂，不了解什么的
Dialogue: 0,3:31:29.49,3:31:31.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就喜欢上是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,3:31:31.50,3:31:33.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,首先不该从朋友开始吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:31:36.75,3:31:37.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,3:31:39.15,3:31:41.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,首先不该先是朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:31:40.36,3:31:41.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜原来如此
Dialogue: 0,3:31:41.25,3:31:42.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜首先从朋友开始呢……
Dialogue: 0,3:31:43.45,3:31:45.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜该聊点什么好呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:31:46.86,3:31:50.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊《全职猎人》我虽然觉得肯定没错……
Dialogue: 0,3:31:54.21,3:31:56.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,该聊什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:31:58.69,3:32:00.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,全职猎人……
Dialogue: 0,3:32:01.09,3:32:04.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,全职猎人，我觉得肯定没错…
Dialogue: 0,3:32:04.35,3:32:06.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那么全职猎人，推荐这个
Dialogue: 0,3:32:04.35,3:32:07.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜我明白了，我这就去聊全职猎人
Dialogue: 0,3:32:08.01,3:32:11.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一起做水见式的话应该能变亲密…
Dialogue: 0,3:32:14.52,3:32:16.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜晚上好，莉泽·赫露艾斯塔桑
Dialogue: 0,3:32:20.33,3:32:21.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜和我……
Dialogue: 0,3:32:20.65,3:32:21.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,能行吗～
Dialogue: 0,3:32:23.71,3:32:26.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜聊聊全职猎人吧
Dialogue: 0,3:32:26.36,3:32:27.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,3:32:27.86,3:32:29.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这种的很能触动哦
Dialogue: 0,3:32:28.07,3:32:28.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:32:29.34,3:32:32.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜正好我也在想全职猎人的事
Dialogue: 0,3:32:30.68,3:32:31.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,3:32:31.56,3:32:32.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,3:32:32.68,3:32:34.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜从月之美兔桑的身上感受到了命运
Dialogue: 0,3:32:34.38,3:32:35.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍等，不妙
Dialogue: 0,3:32:35.20,3:32:37.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜请和我成为朋友
Dialogue: 0,3:32:36.60,3:32:37.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等
Dialogue: 0,3:32:37.40,3:32:38.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,3:32:38.51,3:32:39.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人
Dialogue: 0,3:32:40.30,3:32:41.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,3:32:42.24,3:32:43.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,你明白吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:32:43.08,3:32:44.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还有空露露哦……
Dialogue: 0,3:32:44.97,3:32:46.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还有空露露哦！
Dialogue: 0,3:32:46.98,3:32:50.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,关系亲密变成朋友是可以但是不要忘记哦
Dialogue: 0,3:32:51.92,3:32:52.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,糟了…
Dialogue: 0,3:32:54.39,3:32:55.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦哦……关系是很快乐
Dialogue: 0,3:32:56.42,3:32:59.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还、还差得远呢，关系是最快乐的是我
Dialogue: 0,3:33:00.11,3:33:00.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,目前还
Dialogue: 0,3:33:01.39,3:33:02.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,目前还…
Dialogue: 0,3:33:02.86,3:33:04.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「哦？铃原的样子…」
Dialogue: 0,3:33:05.05,3:33:08.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,目前还、还想，作壁上观
Dialogue: 0,3:33:09.36,3:33:11.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,3:33:12.68,3:33:14.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「什么不妙？说来听听」
Dialogue: 0,3:33:14.55,3:33:15.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，总觉得我的
Dialogue: 0,3:33:16.34,3:33:19.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样我能插手的空间不就没了吗，不对是空露露
Dialogue: 0,3:33:21.14,3:33:22.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露要…
Dialogue: 0,3:33:23.66,3:33:25.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,被{\alpha&H90&}N{\alpha&H00&}TR了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:33:25.63,3:33:27.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没关系吗？在声援的时候
Dialogue: 0,3:33:27.77,3:33:29.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不知不觉就被抢走了的那种
Dialogue: 0,3:33:34.99,3:33:38.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？急le，急没没没，完全没
Dialogue: 0,3:33:38.36,3:33:39.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,完全…
Dialogue: 0,3:33:40.46,3:33:41.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,完全…
Dialogue: 0,3:33:42.48,3:33:43.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,泽…？
Dialogue: 0,3:33:43.83,3:33:46.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说到泽的话……i泽吗
Dialogue: 0,3:33:47.31,3:33:49.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,床酱会这么叫
Dialogue: 0,3:33:49.79,3:33:50.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,i泽，泽
Dialogue: 0,3:33:53.41,3:33:55.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概也有叫泽吧
Dialogue: 0,3:33:59.12,3:34:00.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽，泽…
Dialogue: 0,3:34:01.00,3:34:03.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么叫呢，莉泽吗
Dialogue: 0,3:34:05.17,3:34:06.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,名字…
Dialogue: 0,3:34:08.63,3:34:10.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总感觉可以叫泽
Dialogue: 0,3:34:13.27,3:34:15.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,叫「泽」？还是「莉泽」？泽……
Dialogue: 0,3:34:18.60,3:34:19.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜呀～泽
Dialogue: 0,3:34:23.37,3:34:25.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「一般来说就叫莉泽吧」
Dialogue: 0,3:34:25.62,3:34:27.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哪边好呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:34:31.32,3:34:33.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「就叫莉泽酱可好……」
Dialogue: 0,3:34:33.74,3:34:35.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,叫莉泽酱更好吗？……
Dialogue: 0,3:34:37.45,3:34:38.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,泽！
Dialogue: 0,3:34:39.51,3:34:39.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,泽
Dialogue: 0,3:34:45.48,3:34:46.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜呀～月之美兔
Dialogue: 0,3:34:47.24,3:34:48.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,月之美兔ww
Dialogue: 0,3:34:49.02,3:34:51.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,考虑一圈下来这也可以呢
Dialogue: 0,3:34:51.94,3:34:53.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,用全名来叫…
Dialogue: 0,3:34:55.77,3:34:58.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,用全名称呼美兔桑的莉泽大人
Dialogue: 0,3:34:59.07,3:35:00.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉会这样
Dialogue: 0,3:35:01.96,3:35:03.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「没听说过」「去掉敬称」
Dialogue: 0,3:35:04.20,3:35:05.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,呀～月之美兔
Dialogue: 0,3:35:09.95,3:35:11.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,委员长
Dialogue: 0,3:35:11.55,3:35:12.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,距离感…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:15.47,3:35:17.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:17.85,3:35:20.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,管美兔桑，叫委员长吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:22.97,3:35:25.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就定叫委员长吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:26.63,3:35:29.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔委员长，叫委员长吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:32.89,3:35:35.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,应该是哪种印象？
Dialogue: 0,3:35:36.18,3:35:38.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔委员长、委员长…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:42.59,3:35:43.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,委员长…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:44.19,3:35:45.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「就叫『月酱』？」
Dialogue: 0,3:35:46.26,3:35:48.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,月酱…还是叫美兔桑好了？
Dialogue: 0,3:35:51.93,3:35:53.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔桑委员长…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:56.32,3:35:57.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「或者美兔桑」
Dialogue: 0,3:35:58.09,3:35:59.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶——哪个好？
Dialogue: 0,3:36:00.67,3:36:04.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,叫美兔桑吗？叫美兔桑印象里更多的感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:36:05.07,3:36:06.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就叫美兔桑吧
Dialogue: 0,3:36:06.98,3:36:09.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「也想看美兔美兔的世界线」
Dialogue: 0,3:36:09.66,3:36:10.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:11.12,3:36:13.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果开始交往的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:14.87,3:36:16.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那种叫法也可以
Dialogue: 0,3:36:17.10,3:36:18.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是我的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:19.01,3:36:21.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会把美兔桑叫做美兔美兔啊
Dialogue: 0,3:36:23.18,3:36:24.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔亲
Dialogue: 0,3:36:24.47,3:36:25.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「美兔美兔 呢？」
Dialogue: 0,3:36:25.44,3:36:27.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，我也会叫美兔美兔呢
Dialogue: 0,3:36:28.13,3:36:31.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一起叫…就这么叫也没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,3:36:31.76,3:36:33.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就叫美兔美兔？
Dialogue: 0,3:36:36.41,3:36:37.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔酱？
Dialogue: 0,3:36:38.69,3:36:39.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,交往之后…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:40.83,3:36:41.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:42.53,3:36:44.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那么，这里就先加桑吧，桑
Dialogue: 0,3:36:44.64,3:36:46.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,暂时先这样，还没，还没
Dialogue: 0,3:36:46.94,3:36:48.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还先要加着桑
Dialogue: 0,3:36:52.37,3:36:53.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,先叫美兔桑吧
Dialogue: 0,3:36:54.23,3:36:55.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,暂时先呢，暂时
Dialogue: 0,3:36:56.74,3:36:58.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,能感觉到有距离感吗w
Dialogue: 0,3:36:58.34,3:36:59.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,3:36:59.73,3:37:01.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就这样，还没，还没
Dialogue: 0,3:36:59.81,3:37:01.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜因为全职猎人感受到了命运
Dialogue: 0,3:37:01.96,3:37:03.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还没，还没到时候
Dialogue: 0,3:37:01.96,3:37:03.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜和泽成为了朋友
Dialogue: 0,3:37:04.08,3:37:06.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜美兔桑说不定是命运之人
Dialogue: 0,3:37:07.18,3:37:08.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人？
Dialogue: 0,3:37:08.80,3:37:09.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,3:37:13.24,3:37:14.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:37:16.18,3:37:16.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,3:37:16.94,3:37:19.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,委员长，该怎么选呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:37:20.92,3:37:21.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉…
Dialogue: 0,3:37:22.43,3:37:24.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,小个性之类的如何……
Dialogue: 0,3:37:28.23,3:37:29.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「肌肉的问候」w
Dialogue: 0,3:37:29.85,3:37:32.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，「是！」也不错呢
Dialogue: 0,3:37:32.51,3:37:34.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有种全职猎人的感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:37:37.07,3:37:38.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「罗圈腿的站姿」ww
Dialogue: 0,3:37:39.31,3:37:41.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,直立不动…扶眼镜……
Dialogue: 0,3:37:41.99,3:37:43.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「很轻浮的问候」
Dialogue: 0,3:37:46.99,3:37:48.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊……小孩喷雾是……
Dialogue: 0,3:37:49.36,3:37:50.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,3:37:51.50,3:37:53.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,笔记本电脑…
Dialogue: 0,3:37:56.86,3:37:58.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「起立立正啊」
Dialogue: 0,3:37:58.28,3:38:00.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，但是确实呢，那个也是
Dialogue: 0,3:38:00.90,3:38:01.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有的话也算有吧
Dialogue: 0,3:38:02.02,3:38:03.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「有点沉闷w」
Dialogue: 0,3:38:03.83,3:38:04.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,3:38:05.95,3:38:07.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,起立！立正！
Dialogue: 0,3:38:10.63,3:38:12.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,给个道具吧……
Dialogue: 0,3:38:13.74,3:38:15.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那么给对砂锤试试？
Dialogue: 0,3:38:16.89,3:38:17.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,道具
Dialogue: 0,3:38:18.19,3:38:19.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,先就砂锤
Dialogue: 0,3:38:23.99,3:38:25.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,3:38:26.54,3:38:30.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要和莉泽大人一起用沙锤嗨起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:38:29.14,3:38:30.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜非常感谢！
Dialogue: 0,3:38:30.64,3:38:32.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，你一直很想要这个啊
Dialogue: 0,3:38:30.98,3:38:32.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜这个，我一直很想要的
Dialogue: 0,3:38:33.96,3:38:36.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想要沙锤…
Dialogue: 0,3:38:36.53,3:38:39.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，脸颊都红了～
Dialogue: 0,3:38:40.36,3:38:42.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好近好近，距离有点…
Dialogue: 0,3:38:43.84,3:38:44.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,！
Dialogue: 0,3:38:44.74,3:38:45.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱？
Dialogue: 0,3:38:47.12,3:38:49.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「琉璃好像一直在盯着莉泽·赫露艾斯塔」
Dialogue: 0,3:38:50.33,3:38:52.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等，很在意莉泽大人…
Dialogue: 0,3:38:52.21,3:38:53.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,人气也太高了吧
Dialogue: 0,3:38:54.13,3:38:57.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这就是文武双全人气爆高公主的力量
Dialogue: 0,3:38:55.99,3:38:57.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜打扰一下
Dialogue: 0,3:38:58.01,3:38:59.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜我叫琉璃
Dialogue: 0,3:39:00.09,3:39:01.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，插到她们当中了
Dialogue: 0,3:39:00.31,3:39:01.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜你好，琉璃桑
Dialogue: 0,3:39:01.94,3:39:04.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜我叫莉泽·赫露艾斯塔
Dialogue: 0,3:39:02.72,3:39:04.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:39:06.99,3:39:08.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦～一面之缘
Dialogue: 0,3:39:12.98,3:39:17.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「琉璃在坦白说一边鼻子堵住了很难呼吸的样子」
Dialogue: 0,3:39:19.39,3:39:22.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,很合得来，也是也是，那当然会这样了
Dialogue: 0,3:39:24.62,3:39:26.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,死死的盯着……
Dialogue: 0,3:39:26.68,3:39:28.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,3:39:28.47,3:39:30.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,三角关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:39:31.67,3:39:35.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，不对不对该去搭话，不对可能很难搭上话吗
Dialogue: 0,3:39:35.80,3:39:37.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶～我该怎么办才好？…
Dialogue: 0,3:39:39.71,3:39:42.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「是花粉症吗？」啊……嗯，会很难受呢
Dialogue: 0,3:39:43.56,3:39:46.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,而另一方，空露露正在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,3:39:46.83,3:39:48.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还是把空露露叫起来比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,3:39:49.26,3:39:51.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,朋友，要被抢走咯ww
Dialogue: 0,3:39:52.43,3:39:54.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽说朋友也没有抢不抢走一说
Dialogue: 0,3:39:55.36,3:39:57.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,算了算了睡的好香呢
Dialogue: 0,3:39:59.50,3:40:00.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:40:00.92,3:40:02.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事？真的？
Dialogue: 0,3:40:02.69,3:40:04.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不会被孤立吧？在岛上
Dialogue: 0,3:40:07.08,3:40:09.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真的可以吗，就这么睡着…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:10.12,3:40:11.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等等有点歪了…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:13.77,3:40:14.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,3:40:17.46,3:40:18.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,3:40:22.32,3:40:23.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:24.86,3:40:26.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微聚集起来吧，往这边
Dialogue: 0,3:40:26.49,3:40:28.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉这边有点孤零零的呢
Dialogue: 0,3:40:29.21,3:40:31.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然迟早得建起来，这边
Dialogue: 0,3:40:32.65,3:40:34.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想造陆地啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:35.73,3:40:38.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「在游戏里倒是睡得真多」是呢
Dialogue: 0,3:40:38.80,3:40:43.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露很能睡，代替我睡觉，这个世界线的…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:43.84,3:40:44.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:47.70,3:40:50.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,很嗨呢……
Dialogue: 0,3:40:53.23,3:40:54.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之也是
Dialogue: 0,3:40:54.88,3:40:56.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是好事情
Dialogue: 0,3:40:57.52,3:40:59.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，那么
Dialogue: 0,3:40:59.81,3:41:01.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不停的造吧
Dialogue: 0,3:41:04.73,3:41:08.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,话说我已经在想，已经70…
Dialogue: 0,3:41:09.56,3:41:11.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,多少人都可以的话
Dialogue: 0,3:41:15.89,3:41:17.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,角色创造…
Dialogue: 0,3:41:17.68,3:41:18.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,…的话
Dialogue: 0,3:41:20.76,3:41:23.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,私底下捏好然后在直播里展示出来比较好吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:41:23.66,3:41:25.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个还是太花时间了吧大概
Dialogue: 0,3:41:28.60,3:41:30.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哪边比较好呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:41:32.75,3:41:34.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是唰唰地做好
Dialogue: 0,3:41:34.95,3:41:37.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后啪地一下展示出来这样比较好？
Dialogue: 0,3:41:39.15,3:41:40.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那样倒也行
Dialogue: 0,3:41:41.64,3:41:43.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像「我捏了多少多少人」这样的
Dialogue: 0,3:41:43.37,3:41:46.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽说最初是一个个捏的感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:41:48.39,3:41:50.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果用触控笔的话，在私底下捏吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:41:50.78,3:41:52.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是啊～
Dialogue: 0,3:41:54.27,3:41:56.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「捏脸先告一段落了吗」
Dialogue: 0,3:41:57.36,3:41:58.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是啊～
Dialogue: 0,3:41:58.24,3:41:59.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「私底下有捏的时间吗？」
Dialogue: 0,3:41:59.76,3:42:01.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,时间是挤出来的嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:42:02.67,3:42:04.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事，没问题
Dialogue: 0,3:42:07.53,3:42:09.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「私底下的话似乎就能用触控笔了呢」
Dialogue: 0,3:42:10.01,3:42:11.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊不过我没有触控笔
Dialogue: 0,3:42:12.07,3:42:13.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,触控笔是什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:42:13.62,3:42:14.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说回来…
Dialogue: 0,3:42:15.55,3:42:16.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,触控笔是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,3:42:19.74,3:42:22.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,私底下的话就能用触控笔……
Dialogue: 0,3:42:24.04,3:42:28.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对啊，毕竟我要花挺长时间的
Dialogue: 0,3:42:28.59,3:42:31.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果只做基底的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:42:32.95,3:42:34.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像那样也可以
Dialogue: 0,3:42:38.27,3:42:39.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在睡觉呢
Dialogue: 0,3:42:42.75,3:42:44.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之也可以呢
Dialogue: 0,3:42:45.30,3:42:47.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,十人……也聚集不少人了
Dialogue: 0,3:42:47.39,3:42:48.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「来扩张岛吧」
Dialogue: 0,3:42:48.92,3:42:50.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是啊，像这种……
Dialogue: 0,3:42:51.32,3:42:52.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,地方稍微……
Dialogue: 0,3:42:54.15,3:42:55.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有想做的事
Dialogue: 0,3:42:55.51,3:42:58.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,话说自动售货机放过了吗？放过了放过了
Dialogue: 0,3:43:00.54,3:43:02.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,栅栏也想做呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:43:06.31,3:43:08.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「如果有好好睡觉的时间的话」
Dialogue: 0,3:43:08.56,3:43:12.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过感觉忙的时候，很难做到
Dialogue: 0,3:43:12.48,3:43:15.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在直播上做之类的也完全
Dialogue: 0,3:43:15.32,3:43:17.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我觉得会这样做的
Dialogue: 0,3:43:20.26,3:43:25.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「铺满原创的地面的话，想必会成为很有个性的岛」
Dialogue: 0,3:43:25.72,3:43:30.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「开始之前先决定底子吧，从无底开始做也可以…」
Dialogue: 0,3:43:30.59,3:43:33.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「选择样品在上面画也可以哦」
Dialogue: 0,3:43:34.12,3:43:39.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「以以前做的为基础的情况下，复制做好的东西来做也可」
Dialogue: 0,3:43:42.42,3:43:43.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,道路……
Dialogue: 0,3:43:44.59,3:43:46.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没有做好的东西
Dialogue: 0,3:43:47.40,3:43:49.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个草坪……
Dialogue: 0,3:43:52.12,3:43:53.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还再稍微
Dialogue: 0,3:43:53.58,3:43:55.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想扩大
Dialogue: 0,3:44:01.04,3:44:03.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,草坪那边…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:08.42,3:44:10.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,草坪…画上去也可以吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:15.07,3:44:17.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「快要NijiFes了不要勉强哦」
Dialogue: 0,3:44:17.88,3:44:19.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,3:44:22.04,3:44:23.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题的
Dialogue: 0,3:44:25.21,3:44:26.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊把这个…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:39.46,3:44:41.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像这样？例如…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:43.22,3:44:45.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,名字是，草坪？
Dialogue: 0,3:44:50.60,3:44:53.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「在直播上做，或者在私下做都挺好吧」
Dialogue: 0,3:44:53.87,3:44:54.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也是呢
Dialogue: 0,3:44:55.55,3:44:56.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像那种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:58.02,3:44:58.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,轻松地
Dialogue: 0,3:44:59.38,3:45:01.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想随性地做
Dialogue: 0,3:45:05.44,3:45:07.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还能设置常不常进去呢
Dialogue: 0,3:45:11.80,3:45:13.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢，但是色调……
Dialogue: 0,3:45:14.06,3:45:17.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不一样的话看起来如何呢，没问题吗？…
Dialogue: 0,3:45:21.24,3:45:22.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊总觉得有点不对
Dialogue: 0,3:45:33.54,3:45:35.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不感觉……那什么吗
Dialogue: 0,3:45:35.76,3:45:37.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不感觉有点那什么吗
Dialogue: 0,3:45:42.08,3:45:44.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是，这颜色也算是漂亮的草地吧
Dialogue: 0,3:45:45.89,3:45:48.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个绿色也未必不好吧
Dialogue: 0,3:45:52.11,3:45:53.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「人工草坪感」
Dialogue: 0,3:45:54.67,3:45:56.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「太绿了？」
Dialogue: 0,3:45:56.69,3:45:59.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶，草坪从一开始就有吗？稍等哦
Dialogue: 0,3:46:01.11,3:46:03.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，而且范围挺
Dialogue: 0,3:46:03.22,3:46:04.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,挺广的…
Dialogue: 0,3:46:05.41,3:46:06.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,能这样哦
Dialogue: 0,3:46:15.24,3:46:17.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然也觉得漂亮…
Dialogue: 0,3:46:22.42,3:46:24.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样就到最大了吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:46:31.91,3:46:34.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,海还是留着比较好吧，再怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,3:46:41.44,3:46:42.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,海
Dialogue: 0,3:46:44.57,3:46:46.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,…还是存在比较好吧，填埋过去…
Dialogue: 0,3:46:51.00,3:46:52.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:46:52.85,3:46:53.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这是什么？这
Dialogue: 0,3:46:57.84,3:46:59.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是这个吗难道…
Dialogue: 0,3:47:01.14,3:47:02.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:47:07.21,3:47:08.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，海…
Dialogue: 0,3:47:19.91,3:47:20.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,海…
Dialogue: 0,3:47:30.46,3:47:33.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,椰子树之类的什么更…
Dialogue: 0,3:47:34.10,3:47:36.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有草坪路呢，有的有的…
Dialogue: 0,3:47:37.90,3:47:39.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,结果自己做了草坪
Dialogue: 0,3:47:45.02,3:47:46.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,草丛…
Dialogue: 0,3:47:48.85,3:47:51.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一个Mii…
Dialogue: 0,3:47:52.50,3:47:54.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对应一个家
Dialogue: 0,3:47:55.32,3:47:56.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是必要的呢
Dialogue: 0,3:47:57.19,3:47:59.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像那样的话
Dialogue: 0,3:48:00.83,3:48:03.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,最大大概能容纳多少人呢
Dialogue: 0,3:48:08.43,3:48:10.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对，那个啊
Dialogue: 0,3:48:10.15,3:48:12.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃虽然捏好了
Dialogue: 0,3:48:12.29,3:48:16.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个石神望酱也想捏呐
Dialogue: 0,3:48:17.91,3:48:19.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这绝对很难啊
Dialogue: 0,3:48:19.58,3:48:21.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是在私底下捏比较好？
Dialogue: 0,3:48:22.25,3:48:23.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么抉择呢
Dialogue: 0,3:48:23.56,3:48:25.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,先试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,3:48:28.28,3:48:29.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,毕竟大家都在睡呢
Dialogue: 0,3:48:32.51,3:48:34.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「岛是不是会越来越大的」啊
Dialogue: 0,3:48:34.99,3:48:37.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样啊，会扩张的吗
Dialogue: 0,3:48:38.00,3:48:40.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这里能住下70个人吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:48:45.03,3:48:46.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「石神酱看起来很难呢」
Dialogue: 0,3:48:47.01,3:48:49.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，肯定很难啊
Dialogue: 0,3:48:51.25,3:48:53.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,超级难的样子
Dialogue: 0,3:48:55.16,3:48:57.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶，怎么…不难吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:48:57.48,3:48:59.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等一下，再稍微晚一点吧
Dialogue: 0,3:49:01.34,3:49:02.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「毕竟是异色瞳」
Dialogue: 0,3:49:02.53,3:49:04.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊对啊，眼……
Dialogue: 0,3:49:04.41,3:49:06.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不对，能调吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:49:08.18,3:49:10.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「比琉璃大小姐容易吗？」
Dialogue: 0,3:49:10.61,3:49:12.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,实际不知道呢那个……
Dialogue: 0,3:49:13.04,3:49:14.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果能触控的话
Dialogue: 0,3:49:15.97,3:49:19.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,你看，有点……不是这样的感觉呢
Dialogue: 0,3:49:20.23,3:49:20.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,3:49:27.47,3:49:30.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等偷……在偷听呢
Dialogue: 0,3:49:33.62,3:49:36.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「挑战一下，如果太难了撤退也没关系不是吗」
Dialogue: 0,3:49:36.86,3:49:38.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也是，确实…
Dialogue: 0,3:49:40.21,3:49:42.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想要插一脚进去的感觉…啊
Dialogue: 0,3:49:43.90,3:49:45.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,正在慢跑
Dialogue: 0,3:49:46.58,3:49:48.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人也太受欢迎了吧
Dialogue: 0,3:49:53.33,3:49:54.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在烦恼中？
Dialogue: 0,3:49:59.60,3:50:00.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:01.71,3:50:02.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,打嗝停不下来
Dialogue: 0,3:50:02.85,3:50:05.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,交给我吧，打嗝就该轮到空露露了
Dialogue: 0,3:50:06.21,3:50:07.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,打嗝治疗专家空露露
Dialogue: 0,3:50:08.23,3:50:09.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好了起来工作了
Dialogue: 0,3:50:11.14,3:50:11.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,3:50:11.86,3:50:14.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说起来那个也行吗？算了
Dialogue: 0,3:50:15.54,3:50:16.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜有什么困扰的吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:16.89,3:50:18.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有什么困扰的了？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:16.89,3:50:18.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜打嗝……
Dialogue: 0,3:50:18.44,3:50:19.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜嗝
Dialogue: 0,3:50:19.77,3:50:21.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,打嗝的话就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,3:50:19.77,3:50:21.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜止不住……嗝
Dialogue: 0,3:50:23.90,3:50:27.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜原来如此，这可是大工程呢
Dialogue: 0,3:50:25.99,3:50:27.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大工程呢w
Dialogue: 0,3:50:27.69,3:50:29.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好严重的打嗝
Dialogue: 0,3:50:27.90,3:50:29.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜还请您手下留情
Dialogue: 0,3:50:32.62,3:50:34.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，不错呢～
Dialogue: 0,3:50:42.82,3:50:43.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,心动…？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:44.21,3:50:45.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个是…
Dialogue: 0,3:50:46.18,3:50:48.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜露露酱，原来会露出这样的表情呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:50:48.78,3:50:50.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是只是止住了打嗝吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:50.16,3:50:52.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜希望她用那样的神情看着我……
Dialogue: 0,3:50:52.74,3:50:54.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜对露露酱的这个心情…
Dialogue: 0,3:50:54.76,3:50:56.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜难道是恋爱吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:57.37,3:50:58.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽…大人？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:59.67,3:51:03.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是恋爱吧！应该是恋爱！应该是！
Dialogue: 0,3:51:04.91,3:51:07.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶，但是会变得不得了吧
Dialogue: 0,3:51:07.29,3:51:09.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不会变的泥沼一样吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:51:10.55,3:51:13.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎怎怎，怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,3:51:13.82,3:51:14.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过但是……
Dialogue: 0,3:51:15.04,3:51:18.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对自己的心情不能说谎，那一定是恋爱吧
Dialogue: 0,3:51:19.12,3:51:20.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是恋爱呢
Dialogue: 0,3:51:19.89,3:51:20.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜这就是
Dialogue: 0,3:51:20.96,3:51:23.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能喜欢上了
Dialogue: 0,3:51:21.12,3:51:21.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜爱
Dialogue: 0,3:51:22.85,3:51:23.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜我……
Dialogue: 0,3:51:24.61,3:51:27.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜想和露露酱交往变得幸福！
Dialogue: 0,3:51:28.09,3:51:29.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人……
Dialogue: 0,3:51:32.55,3:51:33.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是怎么办
Dialogue: 0,3:51:34.13,3:51:35.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,3:51:38.93,3:51:39.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么这样……
Dialogue: 0,3:51:43.46,3:51:46.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「{\alpha&H80&}莉泽{\alpha&H00&}正在死死的盯着空露露」
Dialogue: 0,3:51:48.46,3:51:50.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？在跑在跑
Dialogue: 0,3:51:49.91,3:51:51.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜鲜奶油蛋糕、鲜奶油蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,3:51:52.16,3:51:55.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事吧？鲜奶油蛋糕鲜奶油蛋糕？刚才说什么了
Dialogue: 0,3:51:56.49,3:51:57.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,谁、谁？
Dialogue: 0,3:51:57.64,3:51:58.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等一下w
Dialogue: 0,3:51:59.87,3:52:04.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,关于我要去哪里……在追的话，倒确实是在追的
Dialogue: 0,3:52:05.05,3:52:06.25,AN_p2,,0,0,0,,※琉璃很无聊，想要随便谁过来
Dialogue: 0,3:52:06.93,3:52:08.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,很无聊……
Dialogue: 0,3:52:08.34,3:52:10.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那那空露露去吧，去和琉璃碰面
Dialogue: 0,3:52:12.55,3:52:14.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「在空露露的身上发生了什么？」
Dialogue: 0,3:52:17.76,3:52:18.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,唔啊，眼睛好吓人…
Dialogue: 0,3:52:19.42,3:52:20.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？等一下www
Dialogue: 0,3:52:22.23,3:52:24.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是吧，纠葛不清了嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:52:25.15,3:52:26.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃…酱…
Dialogue: 0,3:52:28.06,3:52:28.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,扑通
Dialogue: 0,3:52:30.84,3:52:33.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,恋爱就那么容……ww
Dialogue: 0,3:52:33.80,3:52:36.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个岛好像被下了什么奇怪的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,3:52:34.48,3:52:35.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜感觉是喜欢的人
Dialogue: 0,3:52:36.03,3:52:38.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜在这空露露岛上竟然存在呢
Dialogue: 0,3:52:36.90,3:52:39.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像不恋爱就会死一样
Dialogue: 0,3:52:40.38,3:52:41.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:52:40.38,3:52:41.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样优秀的人……
Dialogue: 0,3:52:41.95,3:52:44.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜叫琉璃桑吗……
Dialogue: 0,3:52:42.11,3:52:44.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,已经纠缠的不得了了
Dialogue: 0,3:52:45.53,3:52:49.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜看着琉璃桑，就会有不可思议的感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:52:49.77,3:52:50.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个是…
Dialogue: 0,3:52:49.77,3:52:50.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜这个是…
Dialogue: 0,3:52:51.21,3:52:52.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜是恋爱吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:52.40,3:52:55.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露，学会了一见钟情ww
Dialogue: 0,3:52:56.95,3:53:00.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是恋爱吗？不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,3:53:00.93,3:53:03.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,所谓的一见钟情吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:53:04.19,3:53:05.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是恋爱呢
Dialogue: 0,3:53:05.83,3:53:07.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「稍微冷静一下吧w」
Dialogue: 0,3:53:07.67,3:53:10.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶这个这个说是恋爱的话会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,3:53:12.35,3:53:14.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,首先我喜欢琉璃酱
Dialogue: 0,3:53:15.07,3:53:17.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后琉璃酱喜欢莉泽大人
Dialogue: 0,3:53:17.32,3:53:21.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,委员长也喜欢莉泽大人，莉泽大人喜欢我？
Dialogue: 0,3:53:23.69,3:53:24.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,3:53:26.36,3:53:27.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「少来，这就是恋爱！」
Dialogue: 0,3:53:27.48,3:53:28.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「是恋爱罢」
Dialogue: 0,3:53:29.34,3:53:32.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,全都要开始恋爱的倾向，大家
Dialogue: 0,3:53:32.38,3:53:33.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没察觉到吗
Dialogue: 0,3:53:34.31,3:53:35.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这没事吗
Dialogue: 0,3:53:37.93,3:53:39.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,最后会怎样呢……
Dialogue: 0,3:53:43.83,3:53:46.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「黏糊糊的」那就是恋爱吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:53:47.57,3:53:49.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是恋爱吗？「发展成不得了的情况了」
Dialogue: 0,3:53:49.33,3:53:50.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「恋爱死亡游戏」
Dialogue: 0,3:53:50.80,3:53:54.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能必须得恋爱才行，不然谁都幸福不了的那种嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:53:55.92,3:53:59.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,周二悬疑，什么杀人事件之类的
Dialogue: 0,3:53:59.79,3:54:01.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,发生也不奇怪哦
Dialogue: 0,3:54:04.00,3:54:06.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「恋爱战斗大逃杀」
Dialogue: 0,3:54:06.94,3:54:08.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「是恋爱哦，恋爱」
Dialogue: 0,3:54:08.76,3:54:12.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那么暂时，暂时吗，要不要试试恋爱？
Dialogue: 0,3:54:13.15,3:54:14.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜是啊！
Dialogue: 0,3:54:14.73,3:54:17.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜俺想和琉璃桑交往！
Dialogue: 0,3:54:14.94,3:54:15.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,恋爱
Dialogue: 0,3:54:17.07,3:54:19.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那就是恋爱啊，空露露大概，虽说不太确定
Dialogue: 0,3:54:27.36,3:54:30.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,单恋、稍微知道点
Dialogue: 0,3:54:30.51,3:54:34.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,喜欢不喜欢什么乱七八糟的都还没说过话呢
Dialogue: 0,3:54:34.89,3:54:37.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,而在那背后扬长而去的是，莉泽大人……
Dialogue: 0,3:54:40.71,3:54:43.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后，西西酱……
Dialogue: 0,3:54:43.47,3:54:44.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还有葵酱呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:54:45.39,3:54:47.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样？大家……
Dialogue: 0,3:54:47.78,3:54:49.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微整理一下状况如何
Dialogue: 0,3:54:52.48,3:54:55.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔也一直在睡觉呢
Dialogue: 0,3:54:57.07,3:55:01.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「其实你没在看的时候，空露露岛也发生了很多事」
Dialogue: 0,3:55:02.31,3:55:05.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「Mii她们发生的事会通过新闻来广播的样子」
Dialogue: 0,3:55:05.33,3:55:07.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「要不要建立一个新闻广播局？」
Dialogue: 0,3:55:10.74,3:55:12.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦～好大
Dialogue: 0,3:55:13.83,3:55:15.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就放在这附近……
Dialogue: 0,3:55:20.62,3:55:22.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,试着把它堆到角落去了
Dialogue: 0,3:55:22.87,3:55:27.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜虽然很突然，为您插播一条新闻
Dialogue: 0,3:55:22.87,3:55:25.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,呃，大家晚上好，空露露
Dialogue: 0,3:55:25.64,3:55:27.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为您带来新闻速报
Dialogue: 0,3:55:28.19,3:55:30.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜有一条令人振奋的消息
Dialogue: 0,3:55:31.86,3:55:37.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜终于在空露露岛上，开设了「空露露岛新闻广播局」
Dialogue: 0,3:55:37.64,3:55:38.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,开力
Dialogue: 0,3:55:38.10,3:55:45.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜新闻广播局会为您传达每日一次的岛上热点话题
Dialogue: 0,3:55:45.51,3:55:46.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,Mii新闻～
Dialogue: 0,3:55:46.45,3:55:51.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜请不要错过每日收看新闻广播局的速报
Dialogue: 0,3:55:54.39,3:55:57.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜新闻速报，由空露露为您播报
Dialogue: 0,3:55:57.85,3:56:02.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在新闻播报的工作室存在前的……新闻播报
Dialogue: 0,3:56:02.73,3:56:04.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为什么会有啊这座岛
Dialogue: 0,3:56:06.90,3:56:08.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜只找到虫子啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:56:09.15,3:56:11.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,呃，稍微等等你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,3:56:11.51,3:56:15.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虫子，在找什么。说能找到的只有虫子
Dialogue: 0,3:56:16.36,3:56:18.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我有点怕我呢
Dialogue: 0,3:56:19.07,3:56:20.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露桑在找什么…
Dialogue: 0,3:56:23.23,3:56:25.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微观察一下吗
Dialogue: 0,3:56:24.50,3:56:26.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜鲜奶油蛋糕的配方
Dialogue: 0,3:56:26.31,3:56:28.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜好像掉在这一带了
Dialogue: 0,3:56:26.68,3:56:28.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,之前好像ww
Dialogue: 0,3:56:29.50,3:56:34.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是被鲜奶油蛋糕囚禁了？怎么在梦里也一直是鲜奶油蛋糕…
Dialogue: 0,3:56:34.39,3:56:35.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊琉璃酱也在哦
Dialogue: 0,3:56:38.87,3:56:40.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,讨厌都变红了～
Dialogue: 0,3:56:43.33,3:56:44.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:56:44.32,3:56:45.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不行哦，一拳殴上去的话
Dialogue: 0,3:56:47.11,3:56:49.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，逃跑了——啊——
Dialogue: 0,3:56:50.44,3:56:52.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,害羞
Dialogue: 0,3:56:52.74,3:56:54.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,很害羞呢
Dialogue: 0,3:56:55.08,3:56:56.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,3:56:56.64,3:56:59.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜我竟然如此接近了憧憬的琉璃桑
Dialogue: 0,3:56:59.62,3:57:01.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等、等等……
Dialogue: 0,3:57:02.05,3:57:03.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我觉得能再接近一点哦
Dialogue: 0,3:57:03.85,3:57:05.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再试着搭话一下吧
Dialogue: 0,3:57:05.64,3:57:08.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,连自我介绍都还没做呢
Dialogue: 0,3:57:10.25,3:57:11.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶这时候感觉有点可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,3:57:12.64,3:57:13.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,3:57:13.76,3:57:15.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱大概会觉得吓人哦
Dialogue: 0,3:57:17.17,3:57:19.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人一直在跑呢
Dialogue: 0,3:57:24.13,3:57:25.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,三角关系……
Dialogue: 0,3:57:26.34,3:57:27.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是这样呢
Dialogue: 0,3:57:31.79,3:57:33.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是看过头了？有点……
Dialogue: 0,3:57:39.54,3:57:41.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,别给别人压力哟，空露露
Dialogue: 0,3:57:42.77,3:57:43.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉无聊……
Dialogue: 0,3:57:43.90,3:57:46.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那，这就该空露露
Dialogue: 0,3:57:47.13,3:57:47.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,3:57:48.13,3:57:49.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,打个招呼吧
Dialogue: 0,3:57:51.81,3:57:53.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜晚上好，空露露桑
Dialogue: 0,3:57:54.88,3:57:55.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露～
Dialogue: 0,3:57:57.43,3:57:58.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜要和我
Dialogue: 0,3:58:00.93,3:58:03.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜聊聊全职猎人的话题吗
Dialogue: 0,3:58:02.10,3:58:03.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦——！
Dialogue: 0,3:58:04.98,3:58:06.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱！
Dialogue: 0,3:58:05.60,3:58:06.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜诶！
Dialogue: 0,3:58:06.78,3:58:10.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜正好俺也在想全职猎人的事
Dialogue: 0,3:58:08.50,3:58:11.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,俺一直在想着全职猎人
Dialogue: 0,3:58:11.19,3:58:13.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜从琉璃桑身上感受到了命运
Dialogue: 0,3:58:13.97,3:58:16.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜请和俺成为朋友！
Dialogue: 0,3:58:16.00,3:58:17.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉能成为朋友！
Dialogue: 0,3:58:20.08,3:58:21.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,3:58:26.47,3:58:28.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,成为朋友了呢～
Dialogue: 0,3:58:28.67,3:58:30.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人真的一直在跑步呢
Dialogue: 0,3:58:31.73,3:58:33.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:58:35.38,3:58:36.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,喜欢、关系变成很开心了呢
Dialogue: 0,3:58:36.99,3:58:38.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,太好了太好了
Dialogue: 0,3:58:39.00,3:58:40.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就该叫露露酱
Dialogue: 0,3:58:41.58,3:58:44.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就让她叫露露酱吧……
Dialogue: 0,3:58:44.62,3:58:45.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:58:45.80,3:58:46.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,酱露露……ww
Dialogue: 0,3:58:46.32,3:58:48.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,酱露露也可以ww
Dialogue: 0,3:58:49.53,3:58:50.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总是……
Dialogue: 0,3:58:50.69,3:58:52.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就酱露露？干脆就
Dialogue: 0,3:58:54.36,3:58:56.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜酱露露，好久不见
Dialogue: 0,3:59:00.24,3:59:01.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,酱琉璃？
Dialogue: 0,3:59:01.55,3:59:03.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,酱，琉璃酱
Dialogue: 0,3:59:10.40,3:59:11.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱
Dialogue: 0,3:59:14.43,3:59:16.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜晚上好，琉璃酱
Dialogue: 0,3:59:16.87,3:59:17.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱～
Dialogue: 0,3:59:18.20,3:59:21.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,酱露露，写成……酱露露也没事吧
Dialogue: 0,3:59:21.86,3:59:23.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,酱露露感觉也不错呢
Dialogue: 0,3:59:25.29,3:59:27.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜因为全职猎人而感觉到命运
Dialogue: 0,3:59:27.83,3:59:29.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜和酱露露成为朋友了
Dialogue: 0,3:59:29.46,3:59:30.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,酱露露了啊
Dialogue: 0,3:59:30.29,3:59:33.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜琉璃酱说不定是命运之人
Dialogue: 0,3:59:33.13,3:59:34.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,命运之人吗
Dialogue: 0,3:59:43.70,3:59:44.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,3:59:44.85,3:59:46.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,给个慢跑让三人和谐相处www
Dialogue: 0,3:59:49.33,3:59:51.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我也可以慢跑
Dialogue: 0,3:59:51.58,3:59:53.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人也能慢跑
Dialogue: 0,3:59:53.69,3:59:54.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,三个人…
Dialogue: 0,3:59:55.84,3:59:57.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个，那么
Dialogue: 0,3:59:57.59,3:59:58.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是挺好的吗
Dialogue: 0,3:59:59.24,4:00:00.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,三个人好好相处
Dialogue: 0,4:00:01.09,4:00:03.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,以交往的形式，怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,4:00:08.56,4:00:09.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,4:00:10.66,4:00:12.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大家一起慢跑w
Dialogue: 0,4:00:12.37,4:00:13.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「不会很尴尬吗？」
Dialogue: 0,4:00:14.59,4:00:16.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「黏糊糊慢跑」
Dialogue: 0,4:00:16.59,4:00:18.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「要三角关系慢跑吗」
Dialogue: 0,4:00:21.78,4:00:23.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍…稍微试试看吧ww
Dialogue: 0,4:00:24.49,4:00:27.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,打招呼前有点喜欢上了慢跑
Dialogue: 0,4:00:28.03,4:00:30.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样三个人有共同话题了
Dialogue: 0,4:00:30.43,4:00:31.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,4:00:33.07,4:00:34.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,4:00:33.23,4:00:34.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会变成什么样呢
Dialogue: 0,4:00:34.43,4:00:37.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个岛的三角关系…不对是四角关系吧
Dialogue: 0,4:00:35.08,4:00:36.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜这个我一直很想要
Dialogue: 0,4:00:37.55,4:00:38.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,委员长也…
Dialogue: 0,4:00:39.82,4:00:41.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,委员长！委员长！
Dialogue: 0,4:00:42.69,4:00:44.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,醒醒，过来一下啊
Dialogue: 0,4:00:44.94,4:00:45.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,过来过来…
Dialogue: 0,4:00:48.02,4:00:48.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:00:51.07,4:00:52.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜还睁不开眼睛呢
Dialogue: 0,4:00:51.70,4:00:53.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这是病呢
Dialogue: 0,4:00:57.03,4:01:00.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，既然想到这里了，就行动吧
Dialogue: 0,4:00:58.99,4:01:00.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜好温暖
Dialogue: 0,4:01:05.71,4:01:08.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,送毛衣会比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,4:01:08.94,4:01:10.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜想成为恋人
Dialogue: 0,4:01:11.80,4:01:15.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,首先不该好好相处吗？那样的话就该…
Dialogue: 0,4:01:18.00,4:01:19.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,首先……
Dialogue: 0,4:01:28.96,4:01:29.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜想成为恋人
Dialogue: 0,4:01:29.38,4:01:29.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,4:01:30.49,4:01:32.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,ww在能听到的位置
Dialogue: 0,4:01:33.18,4:01:36.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那样的话，先成为朋友吧姑且
Dialogue: 0,4:01:37.24,4:01:39.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,刚才摔倒了？没事吧
Dialogue: 0,4:01:44.45,4:01:45.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,4:01:51.47,4:01:54.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等、莉泽大人，真是我行我素呢
Dialogue: 0,4:01:54.40,4:01:56.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，跑着逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,4:01:56.88,4:01:59.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜我竟然如此接近了憧憬的泽……
Dialogue: 0,4:01:59.57,4:02:00.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,泽！
Dialogue: 0,4:02:07.46,4:02:09.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那样就满足了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:02:10.30,4:02:12.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但你说过想成为恋人呢……
Dialogue: 0,4:02:15.27,4:02:15.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,泽！
Dialogue: 0,4:02:17.60,4:02:18.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,Fa？！
Dialogue: 0,4:02:19.73,4:02:21.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么悄悄地？
Dialogue: 0,4:02:21.55,4:02:23.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「在进行完全没有意义的对话」ww
Dialogue: 0,4:02:24.15,4:02:25.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是挺好的吗，没有意义的对话
Dialogue: 0,4:02:26.84,4:02:29.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有意义的对话到底是什么，倒不如说
Dialogue: 0,4:02:32.97,4:02:36.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错不错，怎么悄悄地就去琉璃酱家了
Dialogue: 0,4:02:37.53,4:02:38.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露很行嘛
Dialogue: 0,4:02:39.15,4:02:40.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看起来开心，看起来开心
Dialogue: 0,4:02:43.15,4:02:48.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事吧？没说奇怪的话、距离感太近、施加压力吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:02:48.32,4:02:49.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露你
Dialogue: 0,4:02:53.09,4:02:55.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦但是看上去好快乐好快乐
Dialogue: 0,4:02:56.98,4:02:58.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在家里约会呢
Dialogue: 0,4:03:01.40,4:03:02.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,其他人在睡觉？
Dialogue: 0,4:03:02.93,4:03:03.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在睡觉呢
Dialogue: 0,4:03:07.88,4:03:09.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,夜型人类…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:11.35,4:03:14.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是因为昨天睡了很多吗，与其说是昨天…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:14.55,4:03:18.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这么有精神，竟然在深夜慢跑……
Dialogue: 0,4:03:19.80,4:03:23.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微还是想增加点人数啊，再稍微…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:24.39,4:03:26.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,果然晚上播的话
Dialogue: 0,4:03:26.16,4:03:28.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,晚上大家都睡了嘛…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:28.48,4:03:32.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个早上或者白天的时候是不是真的更好一点呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:36.12,4:03:38.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后，刚才稍微说过的…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:40.04,4:03:41.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微试试看吧，
Dialogue: 0,4:03:41.88,4:03:44.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,限制时间设置为30分钟
Dialogue: 0,4:03:44.39,4:03:45.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,30分钟挑战…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:47.81,4:03:49.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那就先做好底子…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:51.14,4:03:53.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在直播外
Dialogue: 0,4:03:53.58,4:03:54.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,调整好
Dialogue: 0,4:03:54.88,4:03:56.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样的工程怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,4:04:01.03,4:04:03.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「毕竟晚上睡觉的人多嘛」
Dialogue: 0,4:04:06.67,4:04:07.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,4:04:08.19,4:04:09.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,试试看
Dialogue: 0,4:04:10.83,4:04:12.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉很难～
Dialogue: 0,4:04:13.95,4:04:15.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,首先基底…
Dialogue: 0,4:04:16.81,4:04:18.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,做好吧
Dialogue: 0,4:04:19.41,4:04:21.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,…好，现在开始30分钟内
Dialogue: 0,4:04:22.05,4:04:23.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,暂时先到做哪里…
Dialogue: 0,4:04:24.28,4:04:26.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,把石神望酱…
Dialogue: 0,4:04:26.65,4:04:27.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,能捏出来吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:04:28.73,4:04:29.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,挑战
Dialogue: 0,4:04:37.13,4:04:39.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,眉毛意外的不太清楚是怎么样的呢，一直挡着……
Dialogue: 0,4:04:47.70,4:04:49.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概这样吗……？
Dialogue: 0,4:04:55.87,4:04:57.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总觉得是这种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,4:04:59.48,4:05:00.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是故意的……
Dialogue: 0,4:05:02.97,4:05:03.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,4:05:04.42,4:05:05.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大家……
Dialogue: 0,4:05:07.00,4:05:08.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,因为已经用那个了…
Dialogue: 0,4:05:10.32,4:05:12.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这种笑的表情
Dialogue: 0,4:05:12.43,4:05:14.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,硬要说是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,4:05:17.65,4:05:18.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,4:05:19.58,4:05:21.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一直只在用这个
Dialogue: 0,4:05:25.24,4:05:26.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,故意地…
Dialogue: 0,4:05:29.36,4:05:30.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,即使这样…
Dialogue: 0,4:05:33.71,4:05:34.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:05:40.53,4:05:41.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,4:05:45.10,4:05:46.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,眼睛
Dialogue: 0,4:05:48.19,4:05:50.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,眼睛…很难呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:05:52.72,4:05:54.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,眼睛是很难的呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:05:59.91,4:06:05.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像…那个，睫毛的感觉和葵酱之类的有点像
Dialogue: 0,4:06:05.71,4:06:08.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但那样的话闭上眼睛就完蛋了啊
Dialogue: 0,4:06:20.65,4:06:22.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是果然还是那个吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:06:24.22,4:06:26.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,另一边，该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,4:06:41.29,4:06:43.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,取决于选哪个呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:06:44.89,4:06:46.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,选灰色底色吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:06:57.47,4:06:59.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,暂时呢选这个
Dialogue: 0,4:06:59.65,4:07:02.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶～该怎么表现呢
Dialogue: 0,4:07:09.46,4:07:12.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「只画一边吗」只能这样了吧
Dialogue: 0,4:07:23.22,4:07:25.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个好好地在眼睛上呢
Dialogue: 0,4:07:32.29,4:07:33.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,4:07:38.58,4:07:40.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后睫毛
Dialogue: 0,4:07:51.15,4:07:52.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这种感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:07:53.13,4:07:54.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微…
Dialogue: 0,4:07:54.91,4:07:57.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,太突出了吗……
Dialogue: 0,4:07:59.01,4:08:01.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,应该没到这种程度……但是
Dialogue: 0,4:08:03.18,4:08:05.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,反过来说这个调到这边的话
Dialogue: 0,4:08:05.94,4:08:06.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也许会像
Dialogue: 0,4:08:23.99,4:08:25.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微有点可怕呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:08:29.56,4:08:33.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果感觉再偏移的话就有点不对了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:08:40.47,4:08:42.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真难啊
Dialogue: 0,4:08:48.12,4:08:51.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉…稍微，有点太夸张了吗
Dialogue: 0,4:08:59.87,4:09:01.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,只能画了…
Dialogue: 0,4:09:02.95,4:09:04.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是吗，之后再
Dialogue: 0,4:09:31.70,4:09:34.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像画上去比较好呢
Dialogue: 0,4:09:56.72,4:09:59.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯，不需要3根呢
Dialogue: 0,4:10:08.59,4:10:10.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，但是，如果这样做的话如何
Dialogue: 0,4:10:15.61,4:10:19.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个伸得很长的，把它缩短…
Dialogue: 0,4:10:21.92,4:10:23.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，这样的话…
Dialogue: 0,4:10:24.56,4:10:26.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,违和感没那么强了
Dialogue: 0,4:10:33.64,4:10:35.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,4:10:42.11,4:10:43.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,姑……且
Dialogue: 0,4:10:44.16,4:10:45.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,…这样呢
Dialogue: 0,4:10:52.92,4:10:54.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点难啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:02.80,4:11:04.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样的话可能更像吧
Dialogue: 0,4:11:06.77,4:11:08.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「可能相当程度的捕捉到了特征」
Dialogue: 0,4:11:09.05,4:11:09.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,4:11:11.52,4:11:12.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还……
Dialogue: 0,4:11:13.91,4:11:14.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,完全
Dialogue: 0,4:11:20.24,4:11:22.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,比较那个呢…没那么…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:24.47,4:11:26.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没那么多去调整呢
Dialogue: 0,4:11:31.09,4:11:34.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要是能再稍微小一点就好了
Dialogue: 0,4:11:38.79,4:11:40.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概这样？
Dialogue: 0,4:11:41.28,4:11:41.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,4:11:47.85,4:11:48.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,4:11:48.93,4:11:49.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,4:11:50.07,4:11:53.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想再稍微调低一下眼睛整体的位置
Dialogue: 0,4:12:17.99,4:12:19.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，说起来发型
Dialogue: 0,4:12:24.71,4:12:26.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,先……调整颜色
Dialogue: 0,4:12:31.77,4:12:34.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样，大概这种程度？
Dialogue: 0,4:12:37.61,4:12:39.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要更白一些吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:12:41.01,4:12:42.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概这样？
Dialogue: 0,4:12:50.76,4:12:51.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,4:12:51.78,4:12:54.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,之前不是有那种缎带之类的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,4:12:59.77,4:13:00.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,4:13:09.09,4:13:10.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,缎带
Dialogue: 0,4:13:17.97,4:13:18.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,黑色？
Dialogue: 0,4:13:24.51,4:13:26.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要说像……也是像的吧
Dialogue: 0,4:13:36.27,4:13:37.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯 ——
Dialogue: 0,4:13:47.71,4:13:49.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好难啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:13:49.94,4:13:51.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊——…
Dialogue: 0,4:13:53.30,4:13:54.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,4:13:59.02,4:14:00.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还有15分钟就
Dialogue: 0,4:14:02.10,4:14:03.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,15分钟的话这个…
Dialogue: 0,4:14:05.04,4:14:06.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,直到极限
Dialogue: 0,4:14:07.82,4:14:09.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,试试看吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:14:20.62,4:14:22.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,能像到什么程度呢
Dialogue: 0,4:14:23.00,4:14:24.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概就是这种挑战的感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,4:14:35.08,4:14:37.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像这样闭上眼睛的时候——
Dialogue: 0,4:14:38.88,4:14:41.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,绝对会变得很奇怪对吧……
Dialogue: 0,4:14:43.34,4:14:44.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要画刘海吗
Dialogue: 0,4:15:11.28,4:15:14.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,其实，这里是这样
Dialogue: 0,4:15:15.43,4:15:16.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想这样画
Dialogue: 0,4:15:24.80,4:15:27.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,眼睛闭上的时候呢，就…
Dialogue: 0,4:15:29.61,4:15:31.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也许
Dialogue: 0,4:15:33.91,4:15:35.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没办法了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:15:40.75,4:15:44.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,横向，横向的话，闭眼的时候是…
Dialogue: 0,4:15:44.99,4:15:47.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没办法…的感觉
Dialogue: 0,4:15:54.36,4:15:58.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要把瞳孔改成红色的话，该怎么弄…
Dialogue: 0,4:15:59.82,4:16:01.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,才行呢
Dialogue: 0,4:16:21.73,4:16:24.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,重叠色、明亮……
Dialogue: 0,4:16:31.48,4:16:33.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,平滑…
Dialogue: 0,4:16:34.26,4:16:37.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,画笔功能还是没太搞懂呢
Dialogue: 0,4:16:43.83,4:16:46.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不透明度之类的透明度…
Dialogue: 0,4:16:49.02,4:16:51.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,果然还是很难啊
Dialogue: 0,4:16:59.95,4:17:00.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好吓人w
Dialogue: 0,4:17:04.48,4:17:08.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这就是……人类和恶魔的混血儿
Dialogue: 0,4:17:16.24,4:17:18.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,唉——该怎么弄…
Dialogue: 0,4:17:24.70,4:17:28.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,话说眼睛，闭上的时候，会变得很离谱对吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:17:31.30,4:17:31.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,痛…
Dialogue: 0,4:17:33.98,4:17:37.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「好像是涂面部彩绘的方法哦～」
Dialogue: 0,4:17:41.27,4:17:44.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「闭上眼睛的话会残留下来呢」
Dialogue: 0,4:18:01.15,4:18:03.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会残留成什么样？可以稍微看看吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:18:11.25,4:18:14.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想必会变得很恶心的感觉
Dialogue: 0,4:18:32.41,4:18:33.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好想看看啊
Dialogue: 0,4:18:39.73,4:18:42.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是做不出渐变效果啊？
Dialogue: 0,4:18:53.80,4:18:58.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,渐变，渐变，渐变……
Dialogue: 0,4:19:07.07,4:19:08.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯——？
Dialogue: 0,4:19:26.28,4:19:26.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,4:19:27.52,4:19:27.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,4:19:44.36,4:19:47.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉变像了，但是相对的…
Dialogue: 0,4:19:50.98,4:19:53.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,连黑的地方，都变得奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,4:19:58.05,4:19:58.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像
Dialogue: 0,4:19:59.13,4:20:01.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,完成了，渐变
Dialogue: 0,4:20:08.86,4:20:10.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点刺了…
Dialogue: 0,4:20:15.06,4:20:17.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,睫毛也带上渐变了
Dialogue: 0,4:20:25.01,4:20:26.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「闭上的话会怎么样{\alpha&H80&}好在意{\alpha&H00&}」
Dialogue: 0,4:20:26.74,4:20:28.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真的是，对吧，就是这个问题
Dialogue: 0,4:20:41.74,4:20:43.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个……对吧
Dialogue: 0,4:20:44.69,4:20:47.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,很像呢，只要不闭眼的话
Dialogue: 0,4:20:48.96,4:20:51.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,只要眼睛一直睁着的话……
Dialogue: 0,4:21:05.82,4:21:08.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像不闭眼之类的
Dialogue: 0,4:21:08.34,4:21:10.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那种事情……做不到吗
Dialogue: 0,4:21:24.03,4:21:26.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽说也不是看上去像恐怖的东西
Dialogue: 0,4:21:30.77,4:21:33.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果干脆脸全靠画怎么样…
Dialogue: 0,4:21:50.33,4:21:51.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,4:21:58.90,4:22:00.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯哼哼…
Dialogue: 0,4:22:02.70,4:22:04.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「睁着眼睛睡觉吗」
Dialogue: 0,4:22:05.31,4:22:06.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概…？
Dialogue: 0,4:22:11.01,4:22:13.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,头发感觉好难
Dialogue: 0,4:22:44.36,4:22:46.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,很难哦
Dialogue: 0,4:22:57.60,4:23:00.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总觉得这里不行的我…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:22.04,4:23:23.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再稍微……
Dialogue: 0,4:23:23.79,4:23:25.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,擅长一点…对吧
Dialogue: 0,4:23:25.36,4:23:27.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想要做好的呢
Dialogue: 0,4:23:32.11,4:23:34.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然是想做好的
Dialogue: 0,4:23:52.49,4:23:54.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这一片呢
Dialogue: 0,4:23:56.49,4:23:58.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉就该保持原样
Dialogue: 0,4:24:10.39,4:24:12.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,放大一些就容易画呢
Dialogue: 0,4:24:28.19,4:24:30.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉是，像这样…
Dialogue: 0,4:24:30.93,4:24:33.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对吗，不对吗
Dialogue: 0,4:24:34.81,4:24:36.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽说不太清楚…
Dialogue: 0,4:24:36.86,4:24:38.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:24:42.79,4:24:44.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要是像的话就好了
Dialogue: 0,4:25:05.47,4:25:08.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「放大了就容易看清楚线呢」
Dialogue: 0,4:25:08.31,4:25:09.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,4:25:13.61,4:25:15.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,外表很…
Dialogue: 0,4:25:16.24,4:25:17.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像石神
Dialogue: 0,4:25:18.64,4:25:20.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「氛围有了」真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:25:21.65,4:25:22.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:25:33.75,4:25:35.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,氛围画出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,4:25:46.73,4:25:48.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后，这边是…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:12.04,4:26:14.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也取决于能做到什么程度呢
Dialogue: 0,4:26:29.82,4:26:30.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,4:26:32.45,4:26:33.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊这边
Dialogue: 0,4:26:37.20,4:26:38.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后粉色的…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:41.51,4:26:42.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,网格
Dialogue: 0,4:26:44.16,4:26:45.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想填进去…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:47.12,4:26:49.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「如果是摇杆操作，那相当努力了」
Dialogue: 0,4:26:49.89,4:26:50.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我努力
Dialogue: 0,4:26:51.77,4:26:52.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,用摇杆…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:53.75,4:26:55.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,请让我努力
Dialogue: 0,4:27:00.91,4:27:02.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有检讨过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:27:26.65,4:27:28.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,和这边吧～
Dialogue: 0,4:27:33.82,4:27:35.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶，颜色好像不一样…
Dialogue: 0,4:27:36.75,4:27:38.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,刚才用什么颜色画的？
Dialogue: 0,4:27:43.70,4:27:44.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个吗
Dialogue: 0,4:27:57.44,4:27:59.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这里用粉色…
Dialogue: 0,4:28:00.89,4:28:01.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,盖起来
Dialogue: 0,4:28:33.48,4:28:35.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯——……
Dialogue: 0,4:28:38.66,4:28:39.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像像……
Dialogue: 0,4:28:40.45,4:28:41.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,又好像不太像
Dialogue: 0,4:28:46.80,4:28:51.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好难啊，不懂呢，越来越不懂了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:28:58.25,4:29:00.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「忘记时间的铃原」
Dialogue: 0,4:29:01.98,4:29:03.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,已经……
Dialogue: 0,4:29:06.01,4:29:07.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,到时间了吗
Dialogue: 0,4:29:29.95,4:29:31.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后再稍微
Dialogue: 0,4:29:31.97,4:29:34.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉更红一些
Dialogue: 0,4:29:37.72,4:29:40.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过到没这么红呢
Dialogue: 0,4:29:41.06,4:29:43.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样画更容易认出来？
Dialogue: 0,4:29:45.60,4:29:46.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总觉得……
Dialogue: 0,4:29:48.38,4:29:49.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,4:29:49.51,4:29:50.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,线……
Dialogue: 0,4:29:50.95,4:29:52.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,辣椒丝ww
Dialogue: 0,4:29:53.42,4:29:57.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像沾了根辣椒丝似的，粉色这种程度就够了吗
Dialogue: 0,4:29:59.64,4:30:01.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这边更粗呢
Dialogue: 0,4:30:26.69,4:30:28.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,发色……像这样……
Dialogue: 0,4:30:30.20,4:30:31.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果有很多的话
Dialogue: 0,4:30:32.66,4:30:34.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真是不得了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:30:37.30,4:30:38.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我是如此想的
Dialogue: 0,4:30:43.32,4:30:45.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,辣椒丝，对，就是那个
Dialogue: 0,4:30:58.30,4:31:00.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是有点太粗了
Dialogue: 0,4:31:05.64,4:31:11.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,本来说是30分钟能做到什么程度，大概是这种感觉吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:31:19.08,4:31:20.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好脏啊
Dialogue: 0,4:31:22.38,4:31:23.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好脏
Dialogue: 0,4:31:24.75,4:31:26.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,完全
Dialogue: 0,4:31:29.19,4:31:32.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,完全不像，怎么办
Dialogue: 0,4:31:37.84,4:31:39.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,伤脑筋啊……
Dialogue: 0,4:31:42.68,4:31:44.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,吓了一跳
Dialogue: 0,4:31:46.39,4:31:47.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过总之
Dialogue: 0,4:31:48.41,4:31:51.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就是这种感觉吧w
Dialogue: 0,4:31:53.64,4:31:55.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好糟，太糟糕……
Dialogue: 0,4:31:58.06,4:31:59.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,糟糕过头了
Dialogue: 0,4:32:00.29,4:32:03.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对自己画工的水平……
Dialogue: 0,4:32:03.45,4:32:06.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,又有些惊愕，不过算了
Dialogue: 0,4:32:10.22,4:32:11.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,算了算了
Dialogue: 0,4:32:14.12,4:32:15.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,姑且呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:32:16.20,4:32:17.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？刘海是哪个来着
Dialogue: 0,4:32:21.96,4:32:23.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,呃，是哪个来着
Dialogue: 0,4:32:26.22,4:32:28.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,刘海……是哪个来着？
Dialogue: 0,4:32:30.70,4:32:32.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「线条也许不画更好」
Dialogue: 0,4:32:33.02,4:32:34.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也是呢
Dialogue: 0,4:32:35.03,4:32:36.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是这么想了
Dialogue: 0,4:32:44.02,4:32:45.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，好像是这个吧，应该
Dialogue: 0,4:32:45.89,4:32:47.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，不过这个，侧面……
Dialogue: 0,4:32:48.18,4:32:49.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没有秃头不错呢
Dialogue: 0,4:32:54.41,4:32:56.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,左边感觉不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,4:33:09.80,4:33:11.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再稍微等一下
Dialogue: 0,4:33:27.24,4:33:30.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,整体再稍微往下一点吗
Dialogue: 0,4:33:31.35,4:33:31.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,4:33:34.55,4:33:37.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我总是会不知不觉的在眼睛上画？
Dialogue: 0,4:33:43.65,4:33:44.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,4:33:46.02,4:33:48.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这种程度也行吗……
Dialogue: 0,4:33:51.22,4:33:52.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:33:56.80,4:34:00.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再、再往下一点也可以吧，既然如此
Dialogue: 0,4:34:10.57,4:34:12.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然很难
Dialogue: 0,4:34:19.92,4:34:23.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「确实从轮廓上来说再往下一点会比较好ww」
Dialogue: 0,4:34:23.42,4:34:24.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,4:34:27.40,4:34:29.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说的是呢
Dialogue: 0,4:34:53.92,4:34:54.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:34:59.78,4:35:00.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这什么
Dialogue: 0,4:35:03.58,4:35:04.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,4:35:04.50,4:35:07.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,断掉的头发的端头吗
Dialogue: 0,4:35:53.72,4:35:56.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真难呢……
Dialogue: 0,4:36:00.75,4:36:03.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,把线条稍微擦掉的话，多少能……
Dialogue: 0,4:36:06.22,4:36:08.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会不会好一点？
Dialogue: 0,4:36:19.46,4:36:21.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,从上面盖掉
Dialogue: 0,4:37:16.64,4:37:17.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,4:37:19.35,4:37:21.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「今天能玩到几点？」
Dialogue: 0,4:37:21.40,4:37:24.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,本来想着今天轻松点就好……
Dialogue: 0,4:37:26.39,4:37:29.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,相当相当的相当相当……总之
Dialogue: 0,4:37:30.45,4:37:33.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,毕竟都做到这里了……
Dialogue: 0,4:37:34.08,4:37:34.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,4:37:36.16,4:37:38.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,只有石神望
Dialogue: 0,4:37:38.12,4:37:40.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就算画完了
Dialogue: 0,4:37:40.52,4:37:43.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也无所谓——有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,4:37:45.91,4:37:49.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然感觉全涂满也可以啦……
Dialogue: 0,4:37:50.47,4:37:52.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,线完全不留
Dialogue: 0,4:37:52.73,4:37:55.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然也有想留下一点也可以……
Dialogue: 0,4:38:26.08,4:38:28.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还有，要是有发卡的话
Dialogue: 0,4:38:30.06,4:38:31.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也许会像
Dialogue: 0,4:38:36.20,4:38:39.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,只制作望酱好了，干脆
Dialogue: 0,4:38:49.39,4:38:51.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再近一点吗
Dialogue: 0,4:39:03.43,4:39:04.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,4:39:11.04,4:39:12.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,发卡太长了？
Dialogue: 0,4:39:49.13,4:39:51.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,光是有没有这个发卡……
Dialogue: 0,4:39:52.74,4:39:55.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,差别会很大吧？是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,4:39:59.17,4:40:00.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点长了
Dialogue: 0,4:40:00.93,4:40:03.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等下再调一下长度吧
Dialogue: 0,4:40:40.05,4:40:42.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,把稍微长了点的部分
Dialogue: 0,4:40:47.21,4:40:48.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,切掉
Dialogue: 0,4:40:49.50,4:40:53.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,乍一看，是不是捏的很可爱？有好好的
Dialogue: 0,4:40:53.64,4:40:54.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像那么回事？
Dialogue: 0,4:40:56.05,4:40:57.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,乍一看
Dialogue: 0,4:41:23.98,4:41:24.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,4:41:33.75,4:41:35.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉相当不错
Dialogue: 0,4:41:36.98,4:41:38.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉不错感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,4:41:40.13,4:41:40.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,4:41:41.33,4:41:42.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,剩下的是……
Dialogue: 0,4:41:43.09,4:41:43.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,4:41:44.41,4:41:45.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个发卡是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,4:41:59.23,4:42:01.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个发卡是…蔷……
Dialogue: 0,4:42:01.99,4:42:03.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,蔷薇吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:42:08.01,4:42:09.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像是蔷薇呢
Dialogue: 0,4:42:24.38,4:42:26.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,4:42:27.60,4:42:29.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个蔷薇是
Dialogue: 0,4:42:33.38,4:42:35.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,蔷薇有点难画吧
Dialogue: 0,4:42:42.40,4:42:43.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,果然还是
Dialogue: 0,4:42:48.36,4:42:49.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这种程度的颜色吧
Dialogue: 0,4:43:01.67,4:43:03.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过像是……
Dialogue: 0,4:43:04.18,4:43:07.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总感觉有点像的程度的话
Dialogue: 0,4:43:11.32,4:43:12.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,能行吗
Dialogue: 0,4:43:20.53,4:43:23.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这边大概被盖住看不见了吧
Dialogue: 0,4:43:39.77,4:43:40.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,4:43:52.39,4:43:54.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是这种感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:43:55.07,4:43:56.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,4:43:57.18,4:43:58.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在此之上
Dialogue: 0,4:43:58.85,4:43:59.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对我来说……
Dialogue: 0,4:44:01.31,4:44:03.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对我来说太难了哦
Dialogue: 0,4:44:17.70,4:44:19.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,难道没有更细的笔吗
Dialogue: 0,4:44:26.10,4:44:28.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,最细的是这个？
Dialogue: 0,4:44:51.16,4:44:52.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好的，完成
Dialogue: 0,4:44:54.29,4:44:55.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好的，完成！
Dialogue: 0,4:44:57.00,4:44:58.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,4:45:01.08,4:45:01.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在此之上……
Dialogue: 0,4:45:02.21,4:45:03.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,只是眼睛闭住的时候
Dialogue: 0,4:45:04.27,4:45:06.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会变成什么样，有点害怕呢
Dialogue: 0,4:45:09.05,4:45:10.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,腮红腮红
Dialogue: 0,4:45:21.22,4:45:23.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是什么颜色啊，腮红
Dialogue: 0,4:45:29.45,4:45:31.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍等弄的更浓一点
Dialogue: 0,4:45:32.43,4:45:34.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还是能看到颜色比较好
Dialogue: 0,4:45:37.29,4:45:38.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「闭上眼睛的时候会在意啊」
Dialogue: 0,4:45:39.34,4:45:41.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,估计会变得很不得了吧
Dialogue: 0,4:45:57.23,4:45:59.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，怎么样呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:46:00.51,4:46:01.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,尽力完成的…
Dialogue: 0,4:46:03.27,4:46:04.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望酱w
Dialogue: 0,4:46:06.90,4:46:08.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢，
Dialogue: 0,4:46:08.53,4:46:10.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,戴上饰品之后总觉得
Dialogue: 0,4:46:10.75,4:46:12.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微变像了点？
Dialogue: 0,4:46:13.31,4:46:14.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「闭上眼睛会飘在上面吗？」
Dialogue: 0,4:46:14.85,4:46:16.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概会飘在上面的
Dialogue: 0,4:46:18.00,4:46:20.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好了，稍微看一下吧
Dialogue: 0,4:46:21.25,4:46:22.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,试着闭上眼睛看看
Dialogue: 0,4:46:24.14,4:46:27.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊不过只有一瞬间的话，能……能看出来吗
Dialogue: 0,4:46:30.67,4:46:35.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉像是隐形眼镜浮起来了，像是贴在眼皮上
Dialogue: 0,4:46:36.20,4:46:38.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,乍一看还感觉不错？
Dialogue: 0,4:46:38.95,4:46:40.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还是很可爱的
Dialogue: 0,4:46:41.00,4:46:44.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还是很花时间呢，无论如何都…总之那个…
Dialogue: 0,4:46:44.38,4:46:46.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之会做好各种各样的备着
Dialogue: 0,4:46:47.83,4:46:49.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会准备好的
Dialogue: 0,4:46:49.13,4:46:52.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后，展示给大家看，然后直播的时候也会做的
Dialogue: 0,4:46:53.70,4:46:56.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就顺其自然吧
Dialogue: 0,4:46:58.51,4:47:00.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「一直有红色的能看到」
Dialogue: 0,4:47:00.64,4:47:02.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,远看的话还不错？
Dialogue: 0,4:47:04.44,4:47:06.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「只是眨眼的话不显眼呢」
Dialogue: 0,4:47:06.43,4:47:07.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,4:47:08.74,4:47:09.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题啦
Dialogue: 0,4:47:10.48,4:47:11.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,4:47:12.26,4:47:14.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题吧？可以了吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:47:17.61,4:47:18.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，那接下来…
Dialogue: 0,4:47:22.79,4:47:24.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微有点高的吧
Dialogue: 0,4:47:26.38,4:47:27.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？缎带的……
Dialogue: 0,4:47:31.75,4:47:35.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯——如果是161的话
Dialogue: 0,4:47:36.23,4:47:38.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就和我差不多高啊
Dialogue: 0,4:47:39.51,4:47:40.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概这么高？
Dialogue: 0,4:47:41.91,4:47:44.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,因为我身高162厘米
Dialogue: 0,4:47:45.48,4:47:47.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概就是这样吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:47:48.63,4:47:50.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我认为，大概吧
Dialogue: 0,4:47:51.99,4:47:54.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「是视觉错觉啦，没问题」
Dialogue: 0,4:47:54.48,4:47:56.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,算了，误差啦
Dialogue: 0,4:47:59.51,4:48:00.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,4:48:01.98,4:48:03.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶，怎么办好呢
Dialogue: 0,4:48:03.36,4:48:06.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望、望
Dialogue: 0,4:48:07.30,4:48:08.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神
Dialogue: 0,4:48:11.05,4:48:12.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神…
Dialogue: 0,4:48:12.74,4:48:13.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,望
Dialogue: 0,4:48:22.32,4:48:22.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,望…
Dialogue: 0,4:48:27.35,4:48:29.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,w…an
Dialogue: 0,4:48:30.88,4:48:31.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,望…
Dialogue: 0,4:48:34.60,4:48:35.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,先这样
Dialogue: 0,4:48:36.28,4:48:36.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,以后
Dialogue: 0,4:48:40.36,4:48:41.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯……还……
Dialogue: 0,4:48:42.21,4:48:43.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还行吧
Dialogue: 0,4:48:47.80,4:48:50.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，然后恋爱对象全能…
Dialogue: 0,4:48:51.86,4:48:53.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好了，会变成什么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,4:48:54.91,4:48:56.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会变成什么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,4:49:00.56,4:49:01.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,4:49:08.91,4:49:12.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,10月29日可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:49:15.11,4:49:16.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,生日…
Dialogue: 0,4:49:19.95,4:49:22.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,10月29日可以对吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:49:25.61,4:49:27.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没，没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:49:29.94,4:49:31.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没弄错吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:49:32.36,4:49:33.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点不安呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:49:35.12,4:49:35.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:49:37.49,4:49:40.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是10月29号吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:49:44.47,4:49:48.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,2000岁，为什么用疑问句？在非官方Wiki里
Dialogue: 0,4:49:51.07,4:49:52.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,4:49:56.32,4:49:58.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,非官方Wiki…
Dialogue: 0,4:49:59.13,4:49:59.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,里…
Dialogue: 0,4:50:03.39,4:50:05.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,神无月的死者的
Dialogue: 0,4:50:05.32,4:50:06.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,祭典…
Dialogue: 0,4:50:08.99,4:50:09.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,生日…
Dialogue: 0,4:50:11.95,4:50:16.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「10月29日官方记述着」那就好
Dialogue: 0,4:50:17.36,4:50:18.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:50:20.08,4:50:21.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点不安了
Dialogue: 0,4:50:23.38,4:50:24.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,4:50:24.55,4:50:25.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,OK…
Dialogue: 0,4:50:27.04,4:50:27.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大人
Dialogue: 0,4:50:30.47,4:50:32.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对写着神无月的死者的ww
Dialogue: 0,4:50:33.22,4:50:34.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,祭典…
Dialogue: 0,4:50:39.81,4:50:40.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,吓了一跳
Dialogue: 0,4:50:42.58,4:50:45.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是10月29日吧
Dialogue: 0,4:50:45.76,4:50:47.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题吧……
Dialogue: 0,4:50:48.74,4:50:50.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,神无月，这个念什么
Dialogue: 0,4:50:50.92,4:50:51.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,神
Dialogue: 0,4:50:51.80,4:50:53.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,神、神无月？
Dialogue: 0,4:50:54.53,4:50:56.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是神无月吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:50:58.87,4:51:02.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「非官方Wiki上也模棱两可地写着呢ww」
Dialogue: 0,4:51:08.66,4:51:11.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，也…是啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:51:15.84,4:51:16.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,爷？
Dialogue: 0,4:51:21.21,4:51:22.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,第一人称…
Dialogue: 0,4:51:23.32,4:51:24.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,爷，吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:51:25.75,4:51:26.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,网络迷因w
Dialogue: 0,4:51:29.39,4:51:31.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望…
Dialogue: 0,4:51:31.89,4:51:33.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我的话，还挺
Dialogue: 0,4:51:37.04,4:51:37.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,4:51:38.18,4:51:39.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,都用俺了
Dialogue: 0,4:51:40.36,4:51:41.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「第一人称爷有点」
Dialogue: 0,4:51:42.00,4:51:44.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我、我的话…
Dialogue: 0,4:51:45.33,4:51:46.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哪个好？我还是
Dialogue: 0,4:51:48.98,4:51:50.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,爷呢
Dialogue: 0,4:51:51.83,4:51:54.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「俺都有，什么都行啦」
Dialogue: 0,4:51:54.05,4:51:55.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「因为是自称……」
Dialogue: 0,4:51:56.08,4:51:57.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,爷…
Dialogue: 0,4:51:58.99,4:52:00.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我、我吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:52:03.56,4:52:04.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,用我吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:52:09.86,4:52:10.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,4:52:16.30,4:52:17.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还挺
Dialogue: 0,4:52:18.98,4:52:20.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,快的感觉
Dialogue: 0,4:52:35.02,4:52:37.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样？速度还要更快吗
Dialogue: 0,4:52:41.92,4:52:43.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「神无月是10月」啊
Dialogue: 0,4:52:43.90,4:52:45.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,原来如此，是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,4:53:02.04,4:53:03.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微提上来了一点
Dialogue: 0,4:53:06.27,4:53:07.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,4:53:10.32,4:53:12.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也还行……吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:53:12.63,4:53:13.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,姑且
Dialogue: 0,4:53:22.07,4:53:23.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不在
Dialogue: 0,4:53:25.04,4:53:26.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,利落的…
Dialogue: 0,4:53:26.46,4:53:32.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽说还挺利落的一面…但也有悠闲的一面吗
Dialogue: 0,4:53:34.46,4:53:36.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但、但是利落…悠闲吗
Dialogue: 0,4:53:37.30,4:53:38.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那还是选利落吗
Dialogue: 0,4:53:39.07,4:53:42.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有悠闲地一面但又利落吗
Dialogue: 0,4:53:43.46,4:53:46.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说话方式，还挺直接的吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:53:51.16,4:53:54.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,冷面，表情冷……
Dialogue: 0,4:53:55.26,4:53:58.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,乍一看感觉很冷但其实还挺丰富的啊
Dialogue: 0,4:54:00.40,4:54:02.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「声音顿挫调的很强的话……
Dialogue: 0,4:54:03.35,4:54:04.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会变的像关西腔呢」
Dialogue: 0,4:54:05.05,4:54:06.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,4:54:07.22,4:54:10.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,认真…我觉得是认真吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:54:14.16,4:54:16.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看起来酷酷的
Dialogue: 0,4:54:17.76,4:54:18.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「月份的旧名…
Dialogue: 0,4:54:19.41,4:54:22.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,…能说得出来吗？」诶……不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,4:54:22.98,4:54:24.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,霜月……
Dialogue: 0,4:54:24.57,4:54:28.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个，在全职猎人里，那个是有出现过吗
Dialogue: 0,4:54:29.81,4:54:30.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,占卜…
Dialogue: 0,4:54:31.53,4:54:32.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,个性…
Dialogue: 0,4:54:33.17,4:54:37.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然还挺是个常识人，但是个性…
Dialogue: 0,4:54:38.09,4:54:39.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,吗
Dialogue: 0,4:54:45.32,4:54:48.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,个性、丰富…大家都是这样啦
Dialogue: 0,4:54:48.63,4:54:51.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但如果非要选一个的话，我觉得更偏有个性的感觉
Dialogue: 0,4:54:54.03,4:54:55.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望酱
Dialogue: 0,4:54:56.13,4:54:58.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,从我这边来看的感觉……
Dialogue: 0,4:55:00.61,4:55:01.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:55:05.96,4:55:10.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,利落感觉还可以稍微调高一点呢……
Dialogue: 0,4:55:10.24,4:55:14.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Underground……石神望S
Dialogue: 0,4:55:16.81,4:55:18.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,唔嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:55:19.78,4:55:22.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯，就先这样吧
Dialogue: 0,4:55:28.55,4:55:29.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,4:55:33.30,4:55:35.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「随和、重视直觉和气势、大大咧咧」
Dialogue: 0,4:55:35.97,4:55:38.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「乐观、容易热情也容易冷下来」
Dialogue: 0,4:55:38.24,4:55:39.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「热闹型」
Dialogue: 0,4:55:39.24,4:55:42.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「什么都能乐在其中，马上能和陌生人变熟」
Dialogue: 0,4:55:42.59,4:55:44.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「能把困难的事变成乐趣的人」
Dialogue: 0,4:55:44.71,4:55:47.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶，这、这不是很符合吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:55:50.61,4:55:52.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是很像吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:55:56.68,4:55:58.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉还挺符合的
Dialogue: 0,4:55:58.88,4:56:01.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在我心目中
Dialogue: 0,4:56:02.44,4:56:05.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可爱～诶，感觉画得还挺可爱的
Dialogue: 0,4:56:11.97,4:56:14.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「来建石神望的家吧！」
Dialogue: 0,4:56:16.29,4:56:18.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,已经建好啦，就在这里
Dialogue: 0,4:56:19.28,4:56:22.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,放到委员长旁边……虽然现在还比较空
Dialogue: 0,4:56:22.57,4:56:24.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之会越来越多的
Dialogue: 0,4:56:26.47,4:56:27.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊好可爱～
Dialogue: 0,4:56:26.47,4:56:27.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜初次见面，主人！
Dialogue: 0,4:56:28.63,4:56:29.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我是
Dialogue: 0,4:56:29.82,4:56:30.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜石神望
Dialogue: 0,4:56:31.60,4:56:33.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我是氛围系热闹型
Dialogue: 0,4:56:31.78,4:56:33.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,望S，想让她这么说呢
Dialogue: 0,4:56:33.77,4:56:34.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,望
Dialogue: 0,4:56:34.20,4:56:36.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜什么事都能乐在其中的性格
Dialogue: 0,4:56:35.31,4:56:35.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,S
Dialogue: 0,4:56:37.06,4:56:38.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜从今天开始多多指教
Dialogue: 0,4:56:39.68,4:56:41.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯感觉很像很像
Dialogue: 0,4:56:44.00,4:56:44.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,4:56:45.23,4:56:46.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好那么
Dialogue: 0,4:56:46.24,4:56:47.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为这样的 
Dialogue: 0,4:56:49.22,4:56:51.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望酱呢，啊
Dialogue: 0,4:56:52.40,4:56:55.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,本来想拿出我手作的鲜奶油蛋糕来着…
Dialogue: 0,4:56:59.79,4:57:00.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,4:57:00.84,4:57:01.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,请吧
Dialogue: 0,4:57:01.83,4:57:02.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我开动了
Dialogue: 0,4:57:04.75,4:57:06.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「超级可爱的」对吧超可爱
Dialogue: 0,4:57:08.42,4:57:11.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,头发稍微等等眼睛别闭起来ww
Dialogue: 0,4:57:11.50,4:57:13.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,眼睛有点变成恶魔了
Dialogue: 0,4:57:14.55,4:57:17.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,眼、眼睛有没有什么合不上的设定……
Dialogue: 0,4:57:17.70,4:57:19.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是有嘛，机器
Dialogue: 0,4:57:19.89,4:57:21.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那种机器
Dialogue: 0,4:57:21.16,4:57:22.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,拷问机器什么的东西
Dialogue: 0,4:57:23.27,4:57:25.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,眼睛瞪的巨大，不能闭起来的那种
Dialogue: 0,4:57:32.34,4:57:33.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,4:57:35.42,4:57:37.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哇哦～
Dialogue: 0,4:57:41.68,4:57:42.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦，莉泽新闻！
Dialogue: 0,4:57:42.11,4:57:45.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜虽然很突然，现在为您插播一条新闻
Dialogue: 0,4:57:46.64,4:57:48.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜有一条令人振奋的好消息
Dialogue: 0,4:57:48.12,4:57:49.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,海洋的整备取得进展！
Dialogue: 0,4:57:49.86,4:57:54.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜空露露岛周边的海域被整备，可以作为岛屿的土地来使用了
Dialogue: 0,4:57:54.60,4:57:55.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,更进一步
Dialogue: 0,4:57:55.37,4:57:59.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜「继续扩大陆地，希望打造一个能享受更多乐趣的岛」
Dialogue: 0,4:57:57.05,4:57:58.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,变得更宽广了～
Dialogue: 0,4:57:59.95,4:58:01.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜收到了这样的声音
Dialogue: 0,4:58:01.91,4:58:06.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜据说岛上的居民增加的话，作为岛屿可用的海域会进一步扩大
Dialogue: 0,4:58:06.79,4:58:08.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,喔～好诶好诶
Dialogue: 0,4:58:08.32,4:58:08.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜好的
Dialogue: 0,4:58:09.81,4:58:12.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜新闻速报，由莉泽·赫露艾斯塔为您播报
Dialogue: 0,4:58:13.10,4:58:14.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错，不错呢
Dialogue: 0,4:58:15.90,4:58:18.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，感觉居民也增加了…
Dialogue: 0,4:58:20.16,4:58:22.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微热闹起来了的感觉
Dialogue: 0,4:58:23.32,4:58:25.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真不错呢
Dialogue: 0,4:58:27.84,4:58:32.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石的岛…想稍微往下调一点呢
Dialogue: 0,4:58:34.43,4:58:35.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样差不多？
Dialogue: 0,4:58:38.49,4:58:39.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,4:58:43.37,4:58:44.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，不见了
Dialogue: 0,4:58:44.97,4:58:46.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那么怎么样了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:58:50.00,4:58:51.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,4:58:52.84,4:58:55.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,从远处看的话已经…
Dialogue: 0,4:58:56.20,4:58:57.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,很完美了
Dialogue: 0,4:58:59.35,4:59:01.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也好好的做出异色瞳了
Dialogue: 0,4:59:04.58,4:59:06.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等等有点吓人啊那个……
Dialogue: 0,4:59:06.71,4:59:10.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个表情，眼白部分变得通红…
Dialogue: 0,4:59:13.31,4:59:17.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点被画了涂鸦的感觉。不过可爱嘛，这样也可以
Dialogue: 0,4:59:19.07,4:59:21.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,年末的时候，用什么…
Dialogue: 0,4:59:21.71,4:59:22.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,羽子板还是什么的
Dialogue: 0,4:59:23.27,4:59:24.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊可爱！
Dialogue: 0,4:59:24.66,4:59:25.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露～
Dialogue: 0,4:59:26.63,4:59:30.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,连衣服都想精心制作了呢～
Dialogue: 0,4:59:33.63,4:59:34.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可爱可爱。
Dialogue: 0,4:59:33.94,4:59:36.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜一起来玩保龄球吧
Dialogue: 0,4:59:37.41,4:59:38.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,来试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,4:59:40.11,4:59:42.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「把球滚过去打倒所有的瓶子吧」
Dialogue: 0,4:59:42.64,4:59:44.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,洗勾倒是可以……
Dialogue: 0,4:59:44.03,4:59:46.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？这是所谓的人类保龄球吗
Dialogue: 0,4:59:48.84,4:59:51.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,首先，嘿！
Dialogue: 0,4:59:57.69,4:59:59.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？好的好的好的
Dialogue: 0,4:59:59.42,5:00:01.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,三球，下一球决胜负
Dialogue: 0,5:00:02.62,5:00:04.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，失w…啊——
Dialogue: 0,5:00:05.29,5:00:06.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，莉泽大人对不起…对不起
Dialogue: 0,5:00:08.68,5:00:11.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这游戏有点可怕吧人体保龄球
Dialogue: 0,5:00:12.74,5:00:15.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜很遗憾，给您这个
Dialogue: 0,5:00:17.33,5:00:17.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,5:00:18.63,5:00:20.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,厕纸
Dialogue: 0,5:00:22.20,5:00:23.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,谢谢～
Dialogue: 0,5:00:25.04,5:00:26.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好诶，拿到东西了
Dialogue: 0,5:00:27.28,5:00:29.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉经常拿到厕纸呢
Dialogue: 0,5:00:34.92,5:00:37.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但也很可爱呢，可爱可爱
Dialogue: 0,5:00:38.00,5:00:39.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好开心
Dialogue: 0,5:00:39.90,5:00:42.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,来吧，收藏收藏……
Dialogue: 0,5:00:43.80,5:00:44.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？还没？
Dialogue: 0,5:00:48.29,5:00:51.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「一边想着反正对方也听不懂一边开怀大笑」诶？
Dialogue: 0,5:00:54.58,5:00:55.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,5:00:55.84,5:00:57.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,人类真可怕
Dialogue: 0,5:00:57.79,5:01:01.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想着反正对方也听不懂一边开怀大笑是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:02.44,5:01:04.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还有这种事？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:06.56,5:01:07.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？等等w
Dialogue: 0,5:01:07.43,5:01:10.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这么长时间都在这么想着聊天吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:14.82,5:01:16.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，有点郁闷了？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:19.44,5:01:20.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，怎么了呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:21.50,5:01:22.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜晚上好
Dialogue: 0,5:01:22.76,5:01:23.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,5:01:23.69,5:01:24.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点郁闷呢
Dialogue: 0,5:01:24.37,5:01:26.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜想和露露酱住在一起
Dialogue: 0,5:01:27.77,5:01:29.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我觉得不错哦？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:30.27,5:01:32.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶，但等等等等，想告白？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:36.26,5:01:38.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我觉得不错，我觉得不错。
Dialogue: 0,5:01:37.46,5:01:41.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜如果和露露一起住的话，想尝试各种事情
Dialogue: 0,5:01:41.55,5:01:45.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜但说到和露露酱一起住时，能一起做的事
Dialogue: 0,5:01:45.83,5:01:46.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜又有什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:46.72,5:01:47.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,慢跑？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:48.44,5:01:49.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,游戏，FS游，啊
Dialogue: 0,5:01:50.00,5:01:53.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想让你玩…但因为想让你玩…
Dialogue: 0,5:01:54.49,5:01:55.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,故意选做饭？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:56.59,5:01:57.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,慢跑？
Dialogue: 0,5:01:59.61,5:02:01.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,每天想一起做的事
Dialogue: 0,5:02:01.70,5:02:02.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,广播体操…
Dialogue: 0,5:02:03.46,5:02:04.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,第一
Dialogue: 0,5:02:04.85,5:02:06.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，2434体操？
Dialogue: 0,5:02:07.25,5:02:10.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「FS游」「看电影吧」「玩恐怖游戏」？
Dialogue: 0,5:02:11.23,5:02:13.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等这是我想做的事啊
Dialogue: 0,5:02:15.40,5:02:16.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,生化危机？
Dialogue: 0,5:02:17.30,5:02:19.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,只能让你玩FS游了ww
Dialogue: 0,5:02:20.45,5:02:21.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,每天慢跑
Dialogue: 0,5:02:21.80,5:02:23.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是，慢跑
Dialogue: 0,5:02:23.68,5:02:25.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要作为每天的日程
Dialogue: 0,5:02:25.69,5:02:27.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,完全不是什么好事
Dialogue: 0,5:02:27.20,5:02:31.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,每天的话门槛挺高的我觉得，再怎么说
Dialogue: 0,5:02:31.85,5:02:34.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嘛，现实点说的话…
Dialogue: 0,5:02:34.85,5:02:37.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽露露Radio，每天？
Dialogue: 0,5:02:38.10,5:02:39.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,每日Listen？
Dialogue: 0,5:02:40.08,5:02:42.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，我呢，个人想听
Dialogue: 0,5:02:43.15,5:02:46.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但得考虑到不能给负担呢
Dialogue: 0,5:02:46.50,5:02:52.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,果然也是呢，没有负担，而且每天都能享受的
Dialogue: 0,5:03:10.38,5:03:11.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是这个吧……
Dialogue: 0,5:03:16.64,5:03:17.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,5:03:20.13,5:03:21.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜恐怖游戏
Dialogue: 0,5:03:22.17,5:03:23.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大概是吧……
Dialogue: 0,5:03:22.33,5:03:24.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜我知道了，这就去说！
Dialogue: 0,5:03:25.82,5:03:27.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，去说吧
Dialogue: 0,5:03:30.00,5:03:32.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜那个，有点话要说…
Dialogue: 0,5:03:34.63,5:03:37.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样看的话，我，空露露
Dialogue: 0,5:03:34.82,5:03:37.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,露露｜怎么了？一本正经的
Dialogue: 0,5:03:38.22,5:03:41.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜如果，假设我们住在同一个家
Dialogue: 0,5:03:41.45,5:03:43.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜每天一起做的事，应该是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,5:03:42.31,5:03:44.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是喜欢……琉璃酱的吧……
Dialogue: 0,5:03:46.00,5:03:47.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事吗，会变成什么样……
Dialogue: 0,5:03:46.85,5:03:47.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜一、二
Dialogue: 0,5:03:49.15,5:03:50.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽&空露露｜恐怖游戏
Dialogue: 0,5:03:50.69,5:03:53.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊完美一致！
Dialogue: 0,5:03:52.02,5:03:54.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜好厉害，完美对上了！
Dialogue: 0,5:03:55.02,5:03:57.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜和我一起住吧！
Dialogue: 0,5:03:56.62,5:03:58.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这可只能一起住了呢
Dialogue: 0,5:04:02.23,5:04:04.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,果然该是恐怖游戏呢
Dialogue: 0,5:04:06.44,5:04:09.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,太好了太好了，相性可能完美呢
Dialogue: 0,5:04:12.06,5:04:13.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好——诶
Dialogue: 0,5:04:13.76,5:04:16.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,决定一起住了——
Dialogue: 0,5:04:16.46,5:04:17.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜我们会好好相处的！
Dialogue: 0,5:04:17.95,5:04:19.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好好相处
Dialogue: 0,5:04:18.56,5:04:22.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜话说回来，现在家太小了，所以想建一个新家
Dialogue: 0,5:04:21.58,5:04:22.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,新家？
Dialogue: 0,5:04:23.26,5:04:24.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,5:04:26.93,5:04:28.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,建个家吧
Dialogue: 0,5:04:33.53,5:04:34.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,5:04:34.85,5:04:37.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大豪宅，在这附近建试试？
Dialogue: 0,5:04:40.03,5:04:41.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错啊，在商店附近
Dialogue: 0,5:04:41.16,5:04:42.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜在这个家能快乐的生活
Dialogue: 0,5:04:43.69,5:04:47.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜话说，有没有好名字能够表现出我们呢
Dialogue: 0,5:04:47.01,5:04:48.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,能表现出我们？
Dialogue: 0,5:04:48.26,5:04:50.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜如果有好名字的话，请告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,5:04:49.32,5:04:51.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊～莉泽露露？
Dialogue: 0,5:04:53.90,5:04:55.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,果然得是莉泽露露呢
Dialogue: 0,5:04:58.05,5:04:59.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我们
Dialogue: 0,5:05:03.11,5:05:04.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是莉泽露露啊
Dialogue: 0,5:05:10.69,5:05:11.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,5:05:12.21,5:05:13.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,5:05:13.53,5:05:15.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜我们是莉泽露露
Dialogue: 0,5:05:15.37,5:05:16.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽露露
Dialogue: 0,5:05:17.78,5:05:21.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜那么，从今天开始我们就用莉泽露露的名号！
Dialogue: 0,5:05:17.78,5:05:19.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,你们两人是莉泽露露
Dialogue: 0,5:05:21.28,5:05:22.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,5:05:21.68,5:05:23.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜非常棒的名字，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,5:05:23.79,5:05:24.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: 0,5:05:24.77,5:05:27.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜今后也请多多关照莉泽露露～
Dialogue: 0,5:05:26.89,5:05:29.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,今后也请多多关照莉泽露露～
Dialogue: 0,5:05:30.95,5:05:32.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好啊好啊
Dialogue: 0,5:05:32.92,5:05:34.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,超级棒啊
Dialogue: 0,5:05:38.76,5:05:40.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,送什么礼物呢
Dialogue: 0,5:05:40.94,5:05:42.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,恐怖游戏？
Dialogue: 0,5:05:46.69,5:05:48.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,肥皂泡…
Dialogue: 0,5:05:48.60,5:05:51.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,舞蹈也不错啊
Dialogue: 0,5:05:52.15,5:05:55.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个舞蹈，试着一起学学看吧
Dialogue: 0,5:05:55.93,5:05:58.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,街舞入门DVD！
Dialogue: 0,5:06:01.95,5:06:02.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,两人
Dialogue: 0,5:06:03.01,5:06:04.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,友好地
Dialogue: 0,5:06:04.38,5:06:06.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,学吧，现在
Dialogue: 0,5:06:07.55,5:06:10.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉，刚才是不是想抢啊空露露
Dialogue: 0,5:06:11.93,5:06:13.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜谢谢
Dialogue: 0,5:06:16.47,5:06:17.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,5:06:19.83,5:06:23.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜虽然很突然，这里为您插播一条新闻
Dialogue: 0,5:06:23.57,5:06:26.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露新闻为您播报新闻
Dialogue: 0,5:06:25.20,5:06:27.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜有一条令人振奋的消息
Dialogue: 0,5:06:28.18,5:06:32.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜为了纪念居民们的满足度等级提升10次
Dialogue: 0,5:06:32.31,5:06:36.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜似乎正在进行给主人的感谢活动
Dialogue: 0,5:06:36.30,5:06:39.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜让我们立刻联系现场
Dialogue: 0,5:06:36.30,5:06:38.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦，感谢活动是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,5:06:53.12,5:06:54.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,5:06:56.63,5:06:57.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,全｜主人
Dialogue: 0,5:06:58.33,5:06:59.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,全｜一直以来
Dialogue: 0,5:06:59.85,5:07:02.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,全｜非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,5:07:06.79,5:07:08.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,谢谢谢谢
Dialogue: 0,5:07:07.73,5:07:10.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜向主人传递感谢之情
Dialogue: 0,5:07:11.10,5:07:12.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜非常美妙的表演呢
Dialogue: 0,5:07:12.97,5:07:14.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,非常棒呢
Dialogue: 0,5:07:15.53,5:07:18.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜新闻速报，由空露露为您播报
Dialogue: 0,5:07:19.15,5:07:21.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露为您播报～
Dialogue: 0,5:07:23.72,5:07:25.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦——
Dialogue: 0,5:07:27.29,5:07:29.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错呢不错呢
Dialogue: 0,5:07:29.93,5:07:31.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？好、广
Dialogue: 0,5:07:31.30,5:07:33.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「变成大房子了呢！」
Dialogue: 0,5:07:33.05,5:07:34.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这不是大豪宅吗
Dialogue: 0,5:07:34.80,5:07:37.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「在X按钮显示的家庭菜单中」
Dialogue: 0,5:07:37.19,5:07:40.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「可以更改客厅的外观和房子的称呼哦」
Dialogue: 0,5:07:41.55,5:07:42.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露的房间
Dialogue: 0,5:07:43.10,5:07:44.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点煞风景呢
Dialogue: 0,5:07:44.91,5:07:48.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶～一起，在看恐怖电影
Dialogue: 0,5:07:53.32,5:07:54.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好啊好啊
Dialogue: 0,5:07:55.36,5:07:56.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错呢
Dialogue: 0,5:07:56.67,5:07:58.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶感觉很快乐
Dialogue: 0,5:08:00.99,5:08:02.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好棒的家～
Dialogue: 0,5:08:04.06,5:08:07.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,太大了吧，与其说两人住不如说是家庭住的感觉
Dialogue: 0,5:08:08.50,5:08:13.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,居住人数，六、六个人、七个人住下都似乎没问题
Dialogue: 0,5:08:14.48,5:08:16.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，在郁闷呢
Dialogue: 0,5:08:18.03,5:08:19.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在郁闷呢
Dialogue: 0,5:08:20.67,5:08:23.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜这种心情，到底，是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:08:21.71,5:08:22.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,5:08:22.21,5:08:23.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样啊，那确实是郁闷
Dialogue: 0,5:08:24.68,5:08:25.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,确实有这事……
Dialogue: 0,5:08:26.36,5:08:28.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜对泽的心情抑制不住
Dialogue: 0,5:08:28.61,5:08:29.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,告白——？
Dialogue: 0,5:08:29.24,5:08:30.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜想要去告白……
Dialogue: 0,5:08:35.88,5:08:39.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等阻止下来比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,5:08:42.80,5:08:46.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就算说会支持她，在现在这个感觉下也有点…
Dialogue: 0,5:08:49.21,5:08:51.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果说不行会有什么反应呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:08:53.17,5:08:55.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,现在，正在同居中，没事吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:08:57.91,5:08:58.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「三个人住就行了」
Dialogue: 0,5:08:59.00,5:09:01.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是吧，对啊，说的没错
Dialogue: 0,5:09:02.20,5:09:03.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,委员长也……
Dialogue: 0,5:09:03.38,5:09:07.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个房间…那个房间，大家住就行了嘛
Dialogue: 0,5:09:08.80,5:09:09.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会变成怎样呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:09:11.32,5:09:12.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会支持哦……
Dialogue: 0,5:09:12.75,5:09:14.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶但是呢……
Dialogue: 0,5:09:14.47,5:09:16.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会怎么样啊……那个
Dialogue: 0,5:09:26.29,5:09:27.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那样不行
Dialogue: 0,5:09:28.62,5:09:30.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果说不行的话，那么
Dialogue: 0,5:09:30.57,5:09:32.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,明白了，我会忍耐
Dialogue: 0,5:09:33.19,5:09:34.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会这样吗
Dialogue: 0,5:09:34.48,5:09:36.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,姑且支持一下
Dialogue: 0,5:09:39.71,5:09:40.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,分手？
Dialogue: 0,5:09:42.88,5:09:44.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是向新的方向…
Dialogue: 0,5:09:46.09,5:09:47.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,转向比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,5:09:48.40,5:09:48.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,5:09:51.39,5:09:53.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,暂时先否定吧，暂时先呢
Dialogue: 0,5:09:53.87,5:09:55.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还、还、还太早了
Dialogue: 0,5:09:56.35,5:09:59.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不知道，心意虽说可能会改变
Dialogue: 0,5:10:00.03,5:10:02.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但先放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,5:10:03.55,5:10:04.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜为什么不行？
Dialogue: 0,5:10:05.19,5:10:06.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为什么不行？
Dialogue: 0,5:10:06.62,5:10:08.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「因为不相配」ww
Dialogue: 0,5:10:08.79,5:10:10.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真失li，好过分啊
Dialogue: 0,5:10:11.09,5:10:12.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「因为嫉妒」
Dialogue: 0,5:10:12.56,5:10:13.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「因为有对象了」
Dialogue: 0,5:10:13.72,5:10:14.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「还太早」
Dialogue: 0,5:10:14.98,5:10:16.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等时机成熟
Dialogue: 0,5:10:17.11,5:10:19.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等变得舍不得破坏的时候之类的
Dialogue: 0,5:10:20.43,5:10:21.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还太早
Dialogue: 0,5:10:21.46,5:10:22.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜现在不行吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:10:23.19,5:10:24.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜明白了
Dialogue: 0,5:10:26.78,5:10:28.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊——对不起啊——
Dialogue: 0,5:10:29.35,5:10:32.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不——有点烦恼，再稍微
Dialogue: 0,5:10:33.98,5:10:36.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜这样的样子，不是真正的本人
Dialogue: 0,5:10:38.37,5:10:39.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,5:10:43.47,5:10:46.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是直接破坏比较好呢——
Dialogue: 0,5:10:49.68,5:10:50.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还真是……诶？
Dialogue: 0,5:10:50.91,5:10:52.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,郁闷了郁闷了怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,5:10:52.77,5:10:53.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,吵架？
Dialogue: 0,5:10:56.06,5:10:57.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊在跳舞…
Dialogue: 0,5:11:03.43,5:11:04.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,5:11:05.16,5:11:06.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在郁闷呢
Dialogue: 0,5:11:08.44,5:11:09.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜空露露——！！！！
Dialogue: 0,5:11:09.56,5:11:10.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露
Dialogue: 0,5:11:11.63,5:11:14.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜虽然有些在意琉璃酱的事
Dialogue: 0,5:11:13.59,5:11:14.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊——啊——
Dialogue: 0,5:11:14.54,5:11:16.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜俺和琉璃酱的相性
Dialogue: 0,5:11:16.97,5:11:18.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,5:11:18.61,5:11:20.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一边住在一起
Dialogue: 0,5:11:26.12,5:11:30.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，相性我觉得不错……但是稍微等等
Dialogue: 0,5:11:30.37,5:11:31.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,5:11:31.98,5:11:33.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露你
Dialogue: 0,5:11:33.81,5:11:35.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样真的好吗
Dialogue: 0,5:11:38.69,5:11:40.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一边住在同一个家里
Dialogue: 0,5:11:41.45,5:11:43.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一边想着其他女人的事
Dialogue: 0,5:11:44.04,5:11:45.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那样做真的好吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:11:46.13,5:11:48.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「这什么关系」不妙！
Dialogue: 0,5:11:48.78,5:11:49.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不妙
Dialogue: 0,5:11:51.09,5:11:52.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能不合适？
Dialogue: 0,5:11:53.60,5:11:56.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说可能不合适，是不是直接这么说比较好？
Dialogue: 0,5:11:56.73,5:11:59.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,复杂，超级复杂的
Dialogue: 0,5:11:59.34,5:12:00.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,谁都不会幸福
Dialogue: 0,5:12:01.00,5:12:02.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉正在向这个结局发展？
Dialogue: 0,5:12:03.60,5:12:07.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在这个家里看到血
Dialogue: 0,5:12:07.50,5:12:08.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉会
Dialogue: 0,5:12:09.47,5:12:14.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说可能不合适，这对空露露来说
Dialogue: 0,5:12:14.30,5:12:16.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,反而是更温柔的选项吧
Dialogue: 0,5:12:18.12,5:12:19.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要试试看吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:12:20.72,5:12:23.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是不太合适呢～
Dialogue: 0,5:12:23.31,5:12:24.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,5:12:25.21,5:12:26.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜有点遗憾……
Dialogue: 0,5:12:28.63,5:12:29.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，改变了
Dialogue: 0,5:12:29.74,5:12:32.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，变成「是不是要放弃呢」了啊
Dialogue: 0,5:12:35.77,5:12:38.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜Mii新闻，你每天都看吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:12:39.13,5:12:41.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜俺上新闻的时候
Dialogue: 0,5:12:41.48,5:12:44.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜为了不消失，请好好保护呢！
Dialogue: 0,5:12:43.66,5:12:46.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,保护以免消失？那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,5:12:46.56,5:12:50.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，虽然让你有点消沉了，但不好说呢
Dialogue: 0,5:12:52.16,5:12:53.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦等等等ww
Dialogue: 0,5:12:54.59,5:12:55.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,5:12:56.82,5:13:00.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，比想象中更像街舞啊
Dialogue: 0,5:13:03.33,5:13:05.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，睡得好早…
Dialogue: 0,5:13:07.00,5:13:08.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一直在睡呢，我…
Dialogue: 0,5:13:10.75,5:13:12.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，睡了睡了
Dialogue: 0,5:13:12.13,5:13:13.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，在做夢呢！
Dialogue: 0,5:13:15.94,5:13:17.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,让我看看眼睛
Dialogue: 0,5:13:18.20,5:13:20.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉像被涂鸦了的人
Dialogue: 0,5:13:20.02,5:13:22.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过这样也很可爱不是吗？我有点喜欢呢
Dialogue: 0,5:13:24.40,5:13:25.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,5:13:26.45,5:13:27.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,眼睛的
Dialogue: 0,5:13:27.83,5:13:28.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,叉叉
Dialogue: 0,5:13:30.10,5:13:30.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可爱
Dialogue: 0,5:13:32.67,5:13:34.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊等等等，想看
Dialogue: 0,5:13:35.09,5:13:36.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,梦里…
Dialogue: 0,5:13:40.23,5:13:41.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好了…
Dialogue: 0,5:13:45.41,5:13:46.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯？存钱罐
Dialogue: 0,5:13:45.65,5:13:50.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜是谁啊，在这里乱扔小猪存钱罐的
Dialogue: 0,5:13:47.19,5:13:48.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,5:13:49.40,5:13:50.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也许有既视感
Dialogue: 0,5:13:50.62,5:13:51.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看到过
Dialogue: 0,5:13:53.97,5:13:54.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜诶？
Dialogue: 0,5:13:54.40,5:13:55.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个好像在哪见过
Dialogue: 0,5:14:00.29,5:14:01.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个好像看过了啊
Dialogue: 0,5:14:10.24,5:14:12.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,无限循环不觉得很吓人吗
Dialogue: 0,5:14:14.94,5:14:19.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,恐怖故事啊这个，这不就是鲜奶油蛋糕变成金猪了嘛
Dialogue: 0,5:14:20.26,5:14:22.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「我们看到11点吧……」w
Dialogue: 0,5:14:23.07,5:14:24.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为什么是11点？
Dialogue: 0,5:14:24.17,5:14:27.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，原来如此，塞满直播的12小时限制吗
Dialogue: 0,5:14:27.94,5:14:28.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样一来……
Dialogue: 0,5:14:28.82,5:14:30.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然很可爱
Dialogue: 0,5:14:31.08,5:14:34.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可爱到让人想一直看下去的程度吧
Dialogue: 0,5:14:37.18,5:14:38.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好可怕…
Dialogue: 0,5:14:41.64,5:14:43.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？宠物什么时候有啊
Dialogue: 0,5:14:43.52,5:14:45.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊那个有点吓人啊，那个眼睛
Dialogue: 0,5:14:46.32,5:14:49.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,只有被吓到时的眼睛有点太吓人了
Dialogue: 0,5:14:49.60,5:14:51.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,猪猪的存钱罐
Dialogue: 0,5:14:54.88,5:14:57.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「又拿到宝物了呢」
Dialogue: 0,5:14:57.61,5:15:00.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「宝物虽然可以送给Mii作为礼物」
Dialogue: 0,5:15:00.55,5:15:03.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「但如果能卖掉换成钱，说不定能成为某种助力」
Dialogue: 0,5:15:04.57,5:15:07.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「……这座岛上没有卖宝物的地方呢」
Dialogue: 0,5:15:07.97,5:15:12.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「交给『典当屋』来建设岛吧！」
Dialogue: 0,5:15:17.86,5:15:19.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,典当屋……
Dialogue: 0,5:15:20.04,5:15:22.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这里勉强可以吗
Dialogue: 0,5:15:22.92,5:15:24.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？能行
Dialogue: 0,5:15:24.43,5:15:27.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然有些密集了，也行吧
Dialogue: 0,5:15:29.92,5:15:33.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜虽然很突然，现在插播一条新闻
Dialogue: 0,5:15:34.63,5:15:35.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔新闻…
Dialogue: 0,5:15:35.30,5:15:37.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜有一条令人振奋的消息
Dialogue: 0,5:15:39.01,5:15:43.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜终于空露露岛开设了「典当屋」
Dialogue: 0,5:15:39.01,5:15:40.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,典当屋开了～
Dialogue: 0,5:15:43.65,5:15:49.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜典当屋声明不管什么不要的宝物都可以典当
Dialogue: 0,5:15:49.47,5:15:53.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜居民们表示「好像连石头都买……」
Dialogue: 0,5:15:50.07,5:15:51.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不管什么……
Dialogue: 0,5:15:52.33,5:15:53.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,5:15:53.65,5:15:54.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石头都——
Dialogue: 0,5:15:53.92,5:15:56.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜「意外的东西也许能卖出高价」
Dialogue: 0,5:15:56.85,5:15:59.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜这样的传闻开始散播开来
Dialogue: 0,5:15:57.93,5:16:00.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我的手作鲜奶油蛋糕之类的
Dialogue: 0,5:16:00.75,5:16:01.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜好的
Dialogue: 0,5:16:01.62,5:16:02.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,意外地…
Dialogue: 0,5:16:02.42,5:16:06.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜新闻速报，由修女克莱尔为您播报
Dialogue: 0,5:16:08.70,5:16:10.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦——
Dialogue: 0,5:16:12.63,5:16:13.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大卖特卖
Dialogue: 0,5:16:13.93,5:16:16.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,新闻广播塔上面有个New了呢
Dialogue: 0,5:16:18.71,5:16:20.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵酱New～s
Dialogue: 0,5:16:19.28,5:16:20.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜新的一天开始了
Dialogue: 0,5:16:20.79,5:16:24.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜为您播报5月7日的Mii新闻
Dialogue: 0,5:16:23.37,5:16:25.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,日期好像好早就变了
Dialogue: 0,5:16:25.37,5:16:27.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜变成了意料之外的结果
Dialogue: 0,5:16:26.08,5:16:27.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？这个世界的
Dialogue: 0,5:16:27.81,5:16:28.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,天使和恶魔？
Dialogue: 0,5:16:28.79,5:16:30.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜觉得力量训练变得好麻烦
Dialogue: 0,5:16:30.61,5:16:34.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜西西氏其「脑内之战」出乎了事前的预料
Dialogue: 0,5:16:33.96,5:16:36.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我是恶魔的低语…？
Dialogue: 0,5:16:35.02,5:16:37.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜最终以败给诱惑告终
Dialogue: 0,5:16:36.93,5:16:38.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,力量训练还是该做啊
Dialogue: 0,5:16:37.96,5:16:42.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜西西氏表示「恶魔的说辞更能接受」
Dialogue: 0,5:16:42.56,5:16:44.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜因此以睡午觉度过了
Dialogue: 0,5:16:43.23,5:16:44.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，睡午觉我觉得也不错
Dialogue: 0,5:16:44.97,5:16:45.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,睡睡午觉比较好哦
Dialogue: 0,5:16:45.34,5:16:46.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜询问街坊
Dialogue: 0,5:16:47.13,5:16:49.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜真是令人高兴的新闻
Dialogue: 0,5:16:50.07,5:16:51.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜这是整蛊吧？
Dialogue: 0,5:16:53.96,5:16:56.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是街头采访啊，外景采访
Dialogue: 0,5:16:54.89,5:16:58.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜4点的新闻，由本葵为您播报
Dialogue: 0,5:16:56.75,5:16:58.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,4点的新闻……
Dialogue: 0,5:16:59.15,5:17:01.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莫非是，时间划分的新闻？
Dialogue: 0,5:17:01.95,5:17:03.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是一天一次之类的
Dialogue: 0,5:17:04.07,5:17:08.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「在新闻广播局可以观看各新闻的重播」
Dialogue: 0,5:17:08.83,5:17:11.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「虽说过去的新闻会从最旧的开始删除」
Dialogue: 0,5:17:11.44,5:17:13.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「可以设置不想删除的新闻」
Dialogue: 0,5:17:14.41,5:17:18.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「可以保留到49个，所以想再看一次的新闻就保护起来吧」
Dialogue: 0,5:17:18.79,5:17:20.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,原来如此原来如此
Dialogue: 0,5:17:20.72,5:17:23.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那New出现的话就看了吧
Dialogue: 0,5:17:24.07,5:17:24.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,5:17:26.07,5:17:27.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔桑的梦？
Dialogue: 0,5:17:38.02,5:17:38.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,5:17:40.06,5:17:42.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？在梦里摆弄的意思？
Dialogue: 0,5:17:50.89,5:17:54.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人在头旋吗，果然街…
Dialogue: 0,5:17:55.58,5:17:57.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是街舞的影响吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:18:02.56,5:18:04.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为什么一直在用脑袋转啊
Dialogue: 0,5:18:06.00,5:18:07.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,战斗陀螺…
Dialogue: 0,5:18:08.52,5:18:11.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，头同……变成头转同志了
Dialogue: 0,5:18:13.70,5:18:15.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦……
Dialogue: 0,5:18:17.08,5:18:18.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这是什么梦啊
Dialogue: 0,5:18:22.22,5:18:24.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嘿咻嘿咻的，那是当然呢
Dialogue: 0,5:18:25.05,5:18:27.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,用差不多的力量在转的
Dialogue: 0,5:18:28.86,5:18:31.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,战斗陀螺，发射！
Dialogue: 0,5:18:36.52,5:18:38.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,头旋的莉泽大人…
Dialogue: 0,5:18:41.44,5:18:43.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,做了这样的梦啊
Dialogue: 0,5:18:45.26,5:18:46.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这是什么，能拿到宝物吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:18:46.93,5:18:48.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，陀螺啊
Dialogue: 0,5:18:48.19,5:18:50.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜最近只在做这种梦啊……
Dialogue: 0,5:18:48.19,5:18:48.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,战陀
Dialogue: 0,5:18:49.75,5:18:51.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,居然只在做这种梦吗ww
Dialogue: 0,5:18:52.17,5:18:54.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题吧，委员长
Dialogue: 0,5:18:55.41,5:18:56.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真的没问题吗…
Dialogue: 0,5:18:56.94,5:18:57.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜呃……
Dialogue: 0,5:18:58.18,5:18:59.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜有什么事吗……
Dialogue: 0,5:18:59.21,5:19:01.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，好像还没精神呢
Dialogue: 0,5:19:01.74,5:19:03.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,果然还是想告白的呢
Dialogue: 0,5:19:05.34,5:19:06.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对不起，稍微…
Dialogue: 0,5:19:06.73,5:19:07.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,把你闹醒了
Dialogue: 0,5:19:10.46,5:19:11.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,累了吗
Dialogue: 0,5:19:12.41,5:19:17.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶那个，西西酱和葵酱完全没有做梦又醒了
Dialogue: 0,5:19:18.78,5:19:19.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等下你
Dialogue: 0,5:19:20.18,5:19:21.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,招呼，打过了吗
Dialogue: 0,5:19:25.15,5:19:27.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我们是初次见面吧
Dialogue: 0,5:19:26.45,5:19:28.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对对，初次见面初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:19:27.54,5:19:30.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我叫西西
Dialogue: 0,5:19:29.45,5:19:30.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,伦家
Dialogue: 0,5:19:30.81,5:19:32.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜你好西西桑
Dialogue: 0,5:19:32.90,5:19:34.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜本人叫琉璃
Dialogue: 0,5:19:37.01,5:19:41.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,脸熟，感觉大家都得先脸熟一下
Dialogue: 0,5:19:43.66,5:19:45.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？对拉面有兴趣的样子
Dialogue: 0,5:19:47.30,5:19:48.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,5:19:48.32,5:19:50.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,两个人能关系变好吗
Dialogue: 0,5:19:51.64,5:19:53.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，合得来
Dialogue: 0,5:19:53.57,5:19:54.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉不错感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,5:20:00.66,5:20:03.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「好像在聊『清爽的恋爱话题』」
Dialogue: 0,5:20:08.09,5:20:09.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,睡着了嘛
Dialogue: 0,5:20:10.10,5:20:12.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，克莱尔桑也那边……
Dialogue: 0,5:20:15.40,5:20:16.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,5:20:17.07,5:20:18.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜是初次见面呢
Dialogue: 0,5:20:18.17,5:20:19.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,初次见面哦
Dialogue: 0,5:20:19.43,5:20:21.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜我叫修女·克莱尔
Dialogue: 0,5:20:21.78,5:20:23.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「到这边才第一次见面啊」
Dialogue: 0,5:20:22.77,5:20:25.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜修女克莱尔桑，初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:20:24.12,5:20:26.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大家都睡着了嘛最初
Dialogue: 0,5:20:26.11,5:20:27.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我叫西西～
Dialogue: 0,5:20:29.17,5:20:31.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西酱也很像
Dialogue: 0,5:20:31.23,5:20:32.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微了解一点
Dialogue: 0,5:20:34.33,5:20:36.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,自我中心的自我介绍ww
Dialogue: 0,5:20:36.89,5:20:41.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,喜欢鲜奶油蛋糕，说着鲜奶油蛋糕感觉的话题吗
Dialogue: 0,5:20:43.50,5:20:45.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊但是合得来，太好了
Dialogue: 0,5:20:47.25,5:20:49.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没用什么毫不留情的说法呢
Dialogue: 0,5:20:50.39,5:20:53.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊不错呢不错呢，三个人友好地
Dialogue: 0,5:20:55.83,5:20:57.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，不错呢不错呢
Dialogue: 0,5:21:01.25,5:21:03.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊怎么回……琉璃酱没事吗
Dialogue: 0,5:21:05.73,5:21:06.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃…酱？
Dialogue: 0,5:21:08.93,5:21:10.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,他人…啊，等一下等一下
Dialogue: 0,5:21:12.59,5:21:14.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,聊勉强出局的话题ww，等一下
Dialogue: 0,5:21:14.60,5:21:15.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,刚才在聊什么啊
Dialogue: 0,5:21:14.60,5:21:16.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜打搅一下好吗
Dialogue: 0,5:21:16.43,5:21:18.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜本人叫琉璃
Dialogue: 0,5:21:18.53,5:21:21.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,因为在这里没打招呼
Dialogue: 0,5:21:18.80,5:21:20.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜琉璃桑，初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:21:21.19,5:21:22.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜我是修女克莱尔
Dialogue: 0,5:21:25.33,5:21:27.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，好好好
Dialogue: 0,5:21:29.74,5:21:33.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「昨天梦中出现的『超级大金刚』的话题」好在意啊
Dialogue: 0,5:21:33.68,5:21:35.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这是做了什么梦呢
Dialogue: 0,5:21:35.51,5:21:36.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想看那个
Dialogue: 0,5:21:39.06,5:21:41.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像很合得来。不错不错，太好了太好了
Dialogue: 0,5:21:42.10,5:21:45.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,初次见面就不太合得来的情况没有吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:21:46.12,5:21:48.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一面之缘三角形形成了
Dialogue: 0,5:21:48.65,5:21:49.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,5:21:51.42,5:21:54.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「讨论修女·克莱尔的将来」…
Dialogue: 0,5:21:54.77,5:21:56.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这么热烈……
Dialogue: 0,5:21:56.71,5:21:57.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说将来的话题？
Dialogue: 0,5:21:58.14,5:22:00.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,热烈地，勉强出局的……
Dialogue: 0,5:22:00.38,5:22:02.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,修女克莱尔的将来的意思？
Dialogue: 0,5:22:03.20,5:22:05.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,什么东西啊，勉强出局是
Dialogue: 0,5:22:05.44,5:22:08.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我也想插一脚……在聊什么呢
Dialogue: 0,5:22:09.98,5:22:11.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说得好快啊
Dialogue: 0,5:22:16.49,5:22:18.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想插进谁当中呢……
Dialogue: 0,5:22:18.42,5:22:19.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有醒着的孩子吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:22:20.30,5:22:22.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵酱醒着了嘛！葵酱！
Dialogue: 0,5:22:22.48,5:22:25.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就用葵酱！用葵酱去石头剪刀布ww
Dialogue: 0,5:22:26.46,5:22:27.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵酱
Dialogue: 0,5:22:27.53,5:22:29.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,你也稍微
Dialogue: 0,5:22:29.38,5:22:30.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,5:22:33.05,5:22:34.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜是初次见面呢
Dialogue: 0,5:22:34.62,5:22:35.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，嗯嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,5:22:35.31,5:22:37.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜葵我叫本葵
Dialogue: 0,5:22:36.04,5:22:37.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,5:22:37.94,5:22:40.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜本葵桑，初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:22:40.61,5:22:42.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜我是修女克莱尔
Dialogue: 0,5:22:46.59,5:22:48.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后成为一面之交
Dialogue: 0,5:22:50.07,5:22:53.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「本葵好像想让别人听她的『无法大声说出的羞耻话题』」
Dialogue: 0,5:22:53.90,5:22:55.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不、不是初次见面吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:22:57.21,5:23:00.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过这样好吗？好像在说就快要出局了的话题
Dialogue: 0,5:23:00.69,5:23:03.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,反过来说，这样反而能增进感情吗
Dialogue: 0,5:23:05.73,5:23:06.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等等哦
Dialogue: 0,5:23:07.31,5:23:10.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,你还没和琉璃酱打过招呼吧？
Dialogue: 0,5:23:11.78,5:23:13.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等等，去和琉璃酱……
Dialogue: 0,5:23:14.95,5:23:16.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜是初次见面吧
Dialogue: 0,5:23:17.26,5:23:19.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜葵我叫本葵
Dialogue: 0,5:23:19.52,5:23:20.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,5:23:19.77,5:23:21.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜你好，本葵桑
Dialogue: 0,5:23:21.76,5:23:23.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜本人叫琉璃
Dialogue: 0,5:23:26.63,5:23:28.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微了解了
Dialogue: 0,5:23:28.60,5:23:31.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯？刚才一瞬，跳过了
Dialogue: 0,5:23:31.70,5:23:33.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,聊什么呢在？危险的话题？
Dialogue: 0,5:23:38.23,5:23:41.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「好像在传递『热烈的笑容』」
Dialogue: 0,5:23:45.22,5:23:47.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯，好像很合得来
Dialogue: 0,5:23:47.83,5:23:48.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,5:23:49.77,5:23:50.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔桑？
Dialogue: 0,5:23:54.44,5:23:55.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,5:23:58.05,5:23:58.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,蚂蚁啊
Dialogue: 0,5:24:02.50,5:24:03.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,5:24:04.06,5:24:04.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,5:24:05.74,5:24:06.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,5:24:11.57,5:24:12.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,5:24:13.54,5:24:15.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,被蚂蚁追着跑了
Dialogue: 0,5:24:22.84,5:24:23.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,什么什么
Dialogue: 0,5:24:26.34,5:24:27.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,5:24:30.09,5:24:31.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔桑？
Dialogue: 0,5:24:35.05,5:24:37.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,发生什么变成这种颜色了
Dialogue: 0,5:24:37.49,5:24:38.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这棕褐色的
Dialogue: 0,5:24:38.65,5:24:39.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔桑
Dialogue: 0,5:24:49.38,5:24:51.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这是什么啊……怎么回事……
Dialogue: 0,5:24:53.50,5:24:55.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽说不太懂……
Dialogue: 0,5:24:57.64,5:24:59.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可以搭个话吗
Dialogue: 0,5:25:03.60,5:25:04.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,5:25:05.88,5:25:07.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊还好颜色恢复了
Dialogue: 0,5:25:06.69,5:25:08.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜晚上打搅了
Dialogue: 0,5:25:08.10,5:25:10.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,晚上打…啊抱歉晚上打扰了
Dialogue: 0,5:25:15.02,5:25:17.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃…酱……嗯？
Dialogue: 0,5:25:20.75,5:25:22.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再叫一个人吧
Dialogue: 0,5:25:23.87,5:25:25.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西酱
Dialogue: 0,5:25:28.23,5:25:29.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样一堆人的
Dialogue: 0,5:25:29.30,5:25:31.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,？｜你好，修女克莱尔桑
Dialogue: 0,5:25:42.75,5:25:44.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,5:25:45.81,5:25:46.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊……
Dialogue: 0,5:25:47.03,5:25:48.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好可怜……
Dialogue: 0,5:25:48.94,5:25:50.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西酱…！
Dialogue: 0,5:25:53.62,5:25:55.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事…吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:25:55.51,5:25:56.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜晚上好…
Dialogue: 0,5:25:57.08,5:25:59.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,晚上好。太好了，看来没在意的样子…
Dialogue: 0,5:25:58.85,5:26:00.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜虽然被吓了一跳逃跑了……
Dialogue: 0,5:26:01.01,5:26:04.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜发生了什么都忘记了
Dialogue: 0,5:26:01.79,5:26:04.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,太好了，能忘掉的程度就好
Dialogue: 0,5:26:04.37,5:26:06.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还是说冲击大到这种地步…
Dialogue: 0,5:26:11.17,5:26:13.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真挺有冲击力的…
Dialogue: 0,5:26:14.24,5:26:16.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯怎么？在郁闷？没那回事吧？
Dialogue: 0,5:26:17.29,5:26:18.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵酱
Dialogue: 0,5:26:18.49,5:26:19.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,5:26:21.74,5:26:24.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嗯别睁开眼睛ww
Dialogue: 0,5:26:25.11,5:26:26.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,身体僵住了
Dialogue: 0,5:26:26.80,5:26:28.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶那就
Dialogue: 0,5:26:30.66,5:26:32.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,让克莱尔桑来救
Dialogue: 0,5:26:31.19,5:26:32.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,5:26:32.83,5:26:34.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜说来丢人
Dialogue: 0,5:26:34.63,5:26:36.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,后面……在锻炼肌肉？
Dialogue: 0,5:26:34.63,5:26:36.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜身体……动不了了
Dialogue: 0,5:26:37.12,5:26:40.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,叫什么来着…不是锻炼肌肉，叫什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,5:26:38.79,5:26:40.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜压住这里
Dialogue: 0,5:26:40.76,5:26:42.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜拉开这里
Dialogue: 0,5:26:42.86,5:26:43.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜这样……
Dialogue: 0,5:26:44.54,5:26:45.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜好厉害……
Dialogue: 0,5:26:45.84,5:26:47.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜就是这个
Dialogue: 0,5:26:48.19,5:26:49.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样一来…
Dialogue: 0,5:26:50.35,5:26:51.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢，合得来会变吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:26:51.59,5:26:53.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜您真是位热心人呢
Dialogue: 0,5:26:53.53,5:26:55.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜请别在意
Dialogue: 0,5:26:56.25,5:26:57.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，不错不错
Dialogue: 0,5:26:58.43,5:27:00.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜和本葵桑关系变好了
Dialogue: 0,5:26:59.56,5:27:01.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,关系变好了，嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,5:27:01.02,5:27:02.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜谢谢您
Dialogue: 0,5:27:02.86,5:27:05.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不客气，是好事呢
Dialogue: 0,5:27:07.62,5:27:09.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错，钱也攒起来了呢
Dialogue: 0,5:27:12.33,5:27:14.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,超健康——
Dialogue: 0,5:27:17.47,5:27:19.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,呀……这个有点
Dialogue: 0,5:27:19.46,5:27:21.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这之间……
Dialogue: 0,5:27:21.84,5:27:24.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想把石神望酱加进去
Dialogue: 0,5:27:26.50,5:27:28.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样看真的好吓人啊，眼睛
Dialogue: 0,5:27:29.70,5:27:31.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,受惊时的眼睛啊…
Dialogue: 0,5:27:32.08,5:27:33.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,初次见面吧，首先
Dialogue: 0,5:27:33.97,5:27:35.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微打个招呼吧？
Dialogue: 0,5:27:33.97,5:27:35.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:27:36.70,5:27:38.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我，是石神望
Dialogue: 0,5:27:39.09,5:27:41.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜石神望桑，初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:27:42.30,5:27:43.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我是西西
Dialogue: 0,5:27:46.81,5:27:48.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微了解一点
Dialogue: 0,5:27:52.65,5:27:55.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「石神望好像在展示自己和西西多合得来」
Dialogue: 0,5:27:57.67,5:27:59.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，说是好像合得来呢
Dialogue: 0,5:27:59.63,5:28:00.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,5:28:06.77,5:28:09.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错呢～感觉能成为朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,5:28:14.13,5:28:15.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,5:28:17.58,5:28:18.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱…
Dialogue: 0,5:28:19.21,5:28:22.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱也，还没打招呼呢…
Dialogue: 0,5:28:23.97,5:28:24.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,5:28:27.60,5:28:31.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,又「好像在讨论鲜奶油蛋糕的美味吃法」
Dialogue: 0,5:28:32.82,5:28:35.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这里，大胆地插进去可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:28:34.06,5:28:35.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜打搅一下可以吗
Dialogue: 0,5:28:35.37,5:28:36.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,5:28:35.95,5:28:37.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜本人叫琉璃
Dialogue: 0,5:28:36.39,5:28:39.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在说话的时候会不会不好之类的？
Dialogue: 0,5:28:38.26,5:28:39.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜好啊，琉璃桑
Dialogue: 0,5:28:39.88,5:28:41.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我，是石神望
Dialogue: 0,5:28:44.17,5:28:47.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好好，首先呢，从一面之交开始
Dialogue: 0,5:28:47.40,5:28:49.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微变成让人在意的存在
Dialogue: 0,5:28:49.89,5:28:53.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「想让人听听自家的长崎蛋糕有多好吃」w
Dialogue: 0,5:28:55.45,5:28:57.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,自家的长崎蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,5:28:58.27,5:29:02.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之比天气卡组……沟通力更高更好吗
Dialogue: 0,5:29:03.21,5:29:05.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我能做的事大体……
Dialogue: 0,5:29:05.66,5:29:06.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,只有天气卡zu
Dialogue: 0,5:29:07.01,5:29:08.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像又在热烈讨论
Dialogue: 0,5:29:08.90,5:29:12.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「好像在聊『至少这个想要传达出去的话题』」
Dialogue: 0,5:29:13.02,5:29:14.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉不错呢，气氛
Dialogue: 0,5:29:15.12,5:29:16.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,很温暖的感觉
Dialogue: 0,5:29:16.53,5:29:18.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,气氛真好
Dialogue: 0,5:29:20.06,5:29:20.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽露露……
Dialogue: 0,5:29:20.88,5:29:23.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人，一直醒着呢，稍微……
Dialogue: 0,5:29:23.65,5:29:24.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,混进去吧
Dialogue: 0,5:29:25.40,5:29:27.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,又在跳舞
Dialogue: 0,5:29:27.36,5:29:29.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说来我真的好能睡啊
Dialogue: 0,5:29:31.60,5:29:32.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,5:29:43.12,5:29:44.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜晚上好，琉璃桑
Dialogue: 0,5:29:44.98,5:29:47.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜晚上好，莉泽·赫露艾斯塔桑
Dialogue: 0,5:29:46.18,5:29:49.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,和琉璃酱是认识的人，稍等
Dialogue: 0,5:29:56.37,5:29:57.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等下等下
Dialogue: 0,5:29:57.96,5:30:00.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想让你去打初次见面的招呼呢
Dialogue: 0,5:30:01.59,5:30:03.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「完全对不上号的聊天」……
Dialogue: 0,5:30:08.31,5:30:09.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，错失良机了
Dialogue: 0,5:30:09.96,5:30:12.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对不起！是我的时机抓的太差了
Dialogue: 0,5:30:18.29,5:30:21.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,姑且搞个打招呼的会吧
Dialogue: 0,5:30:18.80,5:30:19.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜打搅一下可以吗
Dialogue: 0,5:30:20.52,5:30:22.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜我叫莉泽·赫露艾斯塔
Dialogue: 0,5:30:23.12,5:30:24.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜莉泽·赫露艾斯塔桑
Dialogue: 0,5:30:24.85,5:30:26.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:30:26.49,5:30:27.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我叫西西
Dialogue: 0,5:30:31.90,5:30:33.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，脸熟了
Dialogue: 0,5:30:34.39,5:30:38.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「一边想着这不是第二回了吗一边自我介绍的莉泽·赫露艾斯塔」
Dialogue: 0,5:30:39.25,5:30:41.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是偶尔会有那种事呢
Dialogue: 0,5:30:41.96,5:30:45.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉好像说过这个话题，但到底是怎样来着，这样的
Dialogue: 0,5:30:46.72,5:30:47.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能确实有
Dialogue: 0,5:30:49.27,5:30:50.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，怎么样
Dialogue: 0,5:30:50.02,5:30:51.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜打搅一下可以吗
Dialogue: 0,5:30:51.80,5:30:53.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜我叫莉泽·赫露艾斯塔
Dialogue: 0,5:30:54.33,5:30:56.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜好哇，莉泽·赫尔埃斯塔桑
Dialogue: 0,5:30:56.20,5:30:58.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我叫石神望
Dialogue: 0,5:30:56.26,5:30:57.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好哇……ww
Dialogue: 0,5:31:01.40,5:31:03.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好好，脸输了，其他的呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:31:05.10,5:31:07.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微等一下，谁还没有向谁打招呼吗
Dialogue: 0,5:31:08.43,5:31:10.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能没法好好的想起来
Dialogue: 0,5:31:10.79,5:31:12.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像合得来
Dialogue: 0,5:31:14.65,5:31:15.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,5:31:16.46,5:31:19.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜感觉和石神望桑成为了不错的关系
Dialogue: 0,5:31:19.42,5:31:20.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,5:31:22.32,5:31:25.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能感觉变的不错了
Dialogue: 0,5:31:32.67,5:31:33.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后…
Dialogue: 0,5:31:34.52,5:31:37.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔桑也睡着了吗…
Dialogue: 0,5:31:37.43,5:31:40.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,完全没打招呼啊，这么想的话
Dialogue: 0,5:31:43.89,5:31:47.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想把随便谁带过来到底是怎么回事呢
Dialogue: 0,5:31:48.07,5:31:49.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜是初次见面呢
Dialogue: 0,5:31:48.42,5:31:50.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人怎么一边站着一边聊天啊ww
Dialogue: 0,5:31:50.34,5:31:53.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜我叫修女克莱尔
Dialogue: 0,5:31:53.64,5:31:55.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜你好，修女克莱尔桑
Dialogue: 0,5:31:55.79,5:31:57.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜我叫莉泽·赫露艾斯塔
Dialogue: 0,5:31:59.64,5:32:01.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，这样一来
Dialogue: 0,5:32:02.57,5:32:05.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「修女克莱尔虽然知道是没结尾的故事，但还是想听」
Dialogue: 0,5:32:05.72,5:32:08.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没关系啦，故事就算没结尾也
Dialogue: 0,5:32:11.22,5:32:12.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错不错，能相处的不错
Dialogue: 0,5:32:13.21,5:32:17.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错初次见面啊，那种感觉不和的家伙再怎么说也没有呢
Dialogue: 0,5:32:21.74,5:32:23.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,5:32:23.47,5:32:25.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵酱睡着了吗…
Dialogue: 0,5:32:27.98,5:32:31.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵酱…诶，在哪里看才知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:32:35.75,5:32:38.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,人际关系排行榜的排行……
Dialogue: 0,5:32:43.82,5:32:45.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像谁向谁…
Dialogue: 0,5:32:46.79,5:32:49.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有没有说话之类的
Dialogue: 0,5:32:55.13,5:32:56.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,到底有没有呢……？
Dialogue: 0,5:32:57.91,5:33:01.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「提的时候从列表里找，……
Dialogue: 0,5:33:01.33,5:33:02.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,……可能更容易找」
Dialogue: 0,5:33:02.94,5:33:03.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,5:33:04.91,5:33:08.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微我，把睡觉的暂时拉起来…
Dialogue: 0,5:33:16.71,5:33:20.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,相当，完全没打招呼啊，空露露
Dialogue: 0,5:33:21.53,5:33:23.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西酱前几天呢
Dialogue: 0,5:33:24.35,5:33:25.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,刚联动过
Dialogue: 0,5:33:27.30,5:33:29.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,来，怎么样能成为朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:33:31.14,5:33:32.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在偷听
Dialogue: 0,5:33:42.02,5:33:45.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「空露露一直在盯着莉泽·赫露艾斯塔看」
Dialogue: 0,5:33:50.92,5:33:52.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像在意
Dialogue: 0,5:33:52.71,5:33:55.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？什么…诶？石神望酱和
Dialogue: 0,5:33:57.50,5:33:58.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜空露露——！！！！
Dialogue: 0,5:33:58.15,5:33:59.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西酱…
Dialogue: 0,5:33:58.65,5:33:59.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜你好
Dialogue: 0,5:34:01.18,5:34:02.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,发生什么了？
Dialogue: 0,5:34:02.67,5:34:04.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「空露露趁着深夜的尽头聊起来了的样子」
Dialogue: 0,5:34:07.36,5:34:09.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽｜今天就到这里饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,5:34:10.26,5:34:11.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,到这里就饶了我吧？
Dialogue: 0,5:34:12.54,5:34:13.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊呀
Dialogue: 0,5:34:15.59,5:34:16.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哈……
Dialogue: 0,5:34:17.86,5:34:19.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 0,5:34:20.52,5:34:23.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜稍微有点沮丧了
Dialogue: 0,5:34:22.10,5:34:23.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,沮丧了吗？时机可能不太好。
Dialogue: 0,5:34:24.79,5:34:26.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜虽然和莉泽大人搭话了
Dialogue: 0,5:34:27.01,5:34:29.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,时机也许不太好
Dialogue: 0,5:34:27.21,5:34:29.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜却不太成功
Dialogue: 0,5:34:29.49,5:34:30.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜有点可惜
Dialogue: 0,5:34:29.75,5:34:33.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,正在和克莱尔桑说话的时候插进去的话
Dialogue: 0,5:34:35.35,5:34:37.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能有点完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,5:34:37.68,5:34:38.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等等等等等等
Dialogue: 0,5:34:38.86,5:34:42.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,除此之外还有更气势汹汹地沮丧的人啊…
Dialogue: 0,5:34:42.77,5:34:43.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,5:34:43.65,5:34:45.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜只是有点沮丧
Dialogue: 0,5:34:45.85,5:34:47.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,5:34:47.37,5:34:50.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我刚才和石神望在聊天…
Dialogue: 0,5:34:49.23,5:34:51.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没有灵感ww
Dialogue: 0,5:34:51.15,5:34:53.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜总觉得没有灵感
Dialogue: 0,5:34:53.59,5:34:55.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为什么？说什么话题？
Dialogue: 0,5:34:55.52,5:34:58.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,算了算了，没办法，要吃点饭什么的吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:34:59.22,5:35:00.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看，可乐饼什么的…
Dialogue: 0,5:35:01.40,5:35:02.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我开动了
Dialogue: 0,5:35:02.62,5:35:04.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微振作点吧
Dialogue: 0,5:35:04.74,5:35:06.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？跑谁家了？
Dialogue: 0,5:35:06.96,5:35:08.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露？你跑谁家了？
Dialogue: 0,5:35:10.49,5:35:12.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「还算挺好吃」
Dialogue: 0,5:35:13.84,5:35:15.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦～升级了
Dialogue: 0,5:35:20.30,5:35:24.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后，最近稍微把道具给大家…
Dialogue: 0,5:35:25.75,5:35:26.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,吉他…
Dialogue: 0,5:35:28.03,5:35:31.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,肥皂泡泡套装，来试一下
Dialogue: 0,5:35:33.81,5:35:35.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，肥皂泡泡
Dialogue: 0,5:35:39.55,5:35:41.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,肥皂泡泡SET！
Dialogue: 0,5:35:42.04,5:35:43.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,5:35:44.07,5:35:45.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好好好…
Dialogue: 0,5:35:45.47,5:35:47.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜总觉得心情变好了
Dialogue: 0,5:35:48.01,5:35:50.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,太好了太好了，那就最好了
Dialogue: 0,5:35:53.21,5:35:54.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「每天辛苦了」
Dialogue: 0,5:35:54.45,5:35:58.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「差不多，要是有大家聚在一起吃饭或聊天的地方就好了」
Dialogue: 0,5:35:59.21,5:36:02.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「因此空露露岛要不要建个餐厅？」
Dialogue: 0,5:36:03.39,5:36:04.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,吼——
Dialogue: 0,5:36:07.87,5:36:10.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,得稍微让岛更广阔点才行啊
Dialogue: 0,5:36:13.21,5:36:16.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜虽然很突然，在这里插播一条新闻
Dialogue: 0,5:36:17.32,5:36:19.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜收到一条令人振奋的消息
Dialogue: 0,5:36:21.37,5:36:25.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜终于，空露露岛的餐厅开业了
Dialogue: 0,5:36:25.68,5:36:30.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜在餐厅，居民可以进去吃饭、聊天
Dialogue: 0,5:36:25.68,5:36:27.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个是大家能一起去的吗
Dialogue: 0,5:36:31.04,5:36:32.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错呢
Dialogue: 0,5:36:31.47,5:36:35.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜空露露岛的居民交流似乎会越来越活跃
Dialogue: 0,5:36:37.06,5:36:37.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜好的
Dialogue: 0,5:36:38.09,5:36:41.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜新闻速报，由琉璃为您播报
Dialogue: 0,5:36:42.70,5:36:46.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果有餐厅的话，大家不是能变得友好吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:36:47.32,5:36:49.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想关系变好的孩子们去餐厅吧
Dialogue: 0,5:36:54.23,5:36:55.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍等一下……
Dialogue: 0,5:36:55.98,5:36:57.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,咦，空露露去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,5:36:58.35,5:37:00.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，对了，跑别人家了
Dialogue: 0,5:37:00.57,5:37:02.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,咦，在和琉璃聊天
Dialogue: 0,5:37:04.88,5:37:09.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「『还是那时候好……』望着远方聊着这个的样子」
Dialogue: 0,5:37:10.75,5:37:11.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露……
Dialogue: 0,5:37:13.26,5:37:15.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜有点沮丧了……
Dialogue: 0,5:37:15.38,5:37:16.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也是呢……
Dialogue: 0,5:37:20.23,5:37:22.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,要吃点饭什么的吗
Dialogue: 0,5:37:22.66,5:37:23.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,类似……
Dialogue: 0,5:37:24.11,5:37:25.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,土豆炖肉什么的如何
Dialogue: 0,5:37:26.17,5:37:27.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜我开动了
Dialogue: 0,5:37:29.68,5:37:32.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,沮丧的时候呢，还挺，做什么都
Dialogue: 0,5:37:34.04,5:37:36.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,沮丧的话就先试着变精神吧……
Dialogue: 0,5:37:36.53,5:37:37.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,吃点食物
Dialogue: 0,5:37:44.29,5:37:46.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜总觉得自己的心情变好了
Dialogue: 0,5:37:46.78,5:37:48.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,太好了太好了
Dialogue: 0,5:37:51.57,5:37:54.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等等等等，对了，打招呼
Dialogue: 0,5:37:54.16,5:37:56.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想要看看还没见过面的
Dialogue: 0,5:37:56.86,5:38:01.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜莉泽大人邀请我一起住，我同意了
Dialogue: 0,5:38:03.43,5:38:04.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,5:38:06.17,5:38:07.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,5:38:09.08,5:38:11.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,家……写了什么？刚才
Dialogue: 0,5:38:14.66,5:38:15.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,家…
Dialogue: 0,5:38:18.21,5:38:19.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍等一下…
Dialogue: 0,5:38:21.81,5:38:23.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,OK了
Dialogue: 0,5:38:28.25,5:38:32.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是说「和莉泽大人在同一个家玩恐怖游戏会很开心吧」
Dialogue: 0,5:38:32.71,5:38:34.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看成家游戏了，原来是恐怖游戏
Dialogue: 0,5:38:37.04,5:38:38.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,捏起来…
Dialogue: 0,5:38:41.21,5:38:43.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想捏起来的来着
Dialogue: 0,5:38:43.99,5:38:47.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说话的时候，捏起来是怎么做的
Dialogue: 0,5:38:48.94,5:38:53.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「『真正的自己不只是这样的』像这样落寞的聊着」
Dialogue: 0,5:38:54.11,5:38:55.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉一直很孤独呢
Dialogue: 0,5:38:58.81,5:39:02.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,咦，西西也郁闷着呢，是刚才的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:39:03.54,5:39:05.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,和石神望酱
Dialogue: 0,5:39:03.86,5:39:05.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜早安椎名
Dialogue: 0,5:39:05.77,5:39:06.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,早安椎名
Dialogue: 0,5:39:07.06,5:39:09.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜虽然可能是错觉……
Dialogue: 0,5:39:09.55,5:39:13.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜葵酱是不是喜欢我啊？
Dialogue: 0,5:39:13.21,5:39:14.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，也许吧……
Dialogue: 0,5:39:15.11,5:39:16.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,5:39:17.52,5:39:20.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,很般配呢/去交往吧
Dialogue: 0,5:39:20.09,5:39:21.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,很般配呢
Dialogue: 0,5:39:20.54,5:39:21.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜这样啊
Dialogue: 0,5:39:22.37,5:39:25.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是有点令人在意吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:39:26.87,5:39:28.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是挺好的嘛
Dialogue: 0,5:39:30.11,5:39:32.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,变成相当快乐了
Dialogue: 0,5:39:32.76,5:39:37.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜和葵聊了，好像对超级大金刚感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,5:39:37.68,5:39:40.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是啊，超级大金刚的印象果然还是有的
Dialogue: 0,5:39:38.10,5:39:42.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜聊得非常有意思，成为朋友了
Dialogue: 0,5:39:44.21,5:39:45.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好啊好啊
Dialogue: 0,5:39:46.44,5:39:48.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,先这样
Dialogue: 0,5:39:50.77,5:39:51.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,到这边
Dialogue: 0,5:39:53.61,5:39:54.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,反而……
Dialogue: 0,5:39:54.84,5:39:58.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「『希望能永远保持这种关系』如此期望的聊着」
Dialogue: 0,5:39:59.56,5:40:02.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊……空露露～
Dialogue: 0,5:40:05.97,5:40:08.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个，如何呢，现在这个时机应该去吗…
Dialogue: 0,5:40:08.67,5:40:10.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜是初次见面吧
Dialogue: 0,5:40:11.06,5:40:13.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我叫做西西
Dialogue: 0,5:40:14.16,5:40:16.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜西西桑，初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:40:14.16,5:40:15.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西酱
Dialogue: 0,5:40:16.85,5:40:18.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜我是空露露～
Dialogue: 0,5:40:18.57,5:40:19.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露～
Dialogue: 0,5:40:24.98,5:40:27.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「西西正在报告『往千层酥上浇咖喱很好吃』」
Dialogue: 0,5:40:27.85,5:40:28.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,5:40:30.39,5:40:32.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,千层酥配咖喱……
Dialogue: 0,5:40:32.10,5:40:34.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好吃……好吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:40:34.72,5:40:37.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉聊得来，啊，还好还好，是感觉聊得来就好
Dialogue: 0,5:40:44.01,5:40:45.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错呢，三个人
Dialogue: 0,5:40:46.16,5:40:47.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为什么一下就……
Dialogue: 0,5:40:51.15,5:40:54.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不行了空露露，一直在苦恼着
Dialogue: 0,5:40:55.60,5:40:56.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,5:40:56.30,5:40:59.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,望酱也在消沉了
Dialogue: 0,5:40:59.91,5:41:01.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜稍微有点低落
Dialogue: 0,5:41:02.87,5:41:07.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜刚才和西西聊天，心里有点难受起来了
Dialogue: 0,5:41:07.96,5:41:09.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没聊得来呢
Dialogue: 0,5:41:10.05,5:41:10.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,5:41:12.30,5:41:15.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之，说的是呢，寿司之类的怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,5:41:15.63,5:41:17.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜吃不下这么多
Dialogue: 0,5:41:17.52,5:41:22.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,与其说没有要吃寿司的人，难道说其实早就过保质期了
Dialogue: 0,5:41:24.54,5:41:26.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能喜欢什么呢，法式吐司！
Dialogue: 0,5:41:27.52,5:41:29.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜吃不下这么多
Dialogue: 0,5:41:31.96,5:41:33.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:41:35.26,5:41:38.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,什么能一口，韩国海苔的话……能吃下吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:41:39.73,5:41:40.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我开动了
Dialogue: 0,5:41:40.61,5:41:42.37,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，能吃能吃
Dialogue: 0,5:41:42.92,5:41:45.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,吃饭也得咽得下去才行啊……
Dialogue: 0,5:41:48.32,5:41:51.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「看来还算好吃的样子」还好还好
Dialogue: 0,5:41:53.92,5:41:55.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那样的话就太好了
Dialogue: 0,5:41:58.05,5:42:00.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜感觉心情变好了
Dialogue: 0,5:41:58.41,5:42:01.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还想要给她们各种各样不同的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,5:42:03.75,5:42:05.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,心情变好了的话
Dialogue: 0,5:42:10.16,5:42:12.85,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说的是呢，不过可能还……
Dialogue: 0,5:42:13.27,5:42:14.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没打招呼的
Dialogue: 0,5:42:15.69,5:42:17.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,望酱……
Dialogue: 0,5:42:17.93,5:42:19.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,捏起来……
Dialogue: 0,5:42:20.89,5:42:22.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,5:42:23.75,5:42:26.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,完全，一直还没打招呼呢
Dialogue: 0,5:42:27.89,5:42:30.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这张脸有点吓人……啊
Dialogue: 0,5:42:31.05,5:42:33.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,正好想要改善w
Dialogue: 0,5:42:33.42,5:42:36.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜感觉和本葵能成为朋友
Dialogue: 0,5:42:38.33,5:42:41.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过，葵酱不好说呢
Dialogue: 0,5:42:38.99,5:42:40.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:42:40.59,5:42:42.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我是，石神望
Dialogue: 0,5:42:43.11,5:42:45.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜石神望桑，初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:42:46.17,5:42:47.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜我是空露露
Dialogue: 0,5:42:47.46,5:42:48.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露～
Dialogue: 0,5:42:50.23,5:42:52.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，这样就算脸熟了
Dialogue: 0,5:42:53.45,5:42:56.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「石神望在聊『外表看不出来的烦恼』的样子」
Dialogue: 0,5:43:01.74,5:43:03.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦～好像合得来
Dialogue: 0,5:43:04.24,5:43:06.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之最初都是没问题的呢
Dialogue: 0,5:43:14.08,5:43:15.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后是
Dialogue: 0,5:43:17.72,5:43:19.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像有事件哦
Dialogue: 0,5:43:20.75,5:43:22.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西酱的话
Dialogue: 0,5:43:23.12,5:43:25.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，和委员长……
Dialogue: 0,5:43:26.98,5:43:29.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱，怎么了呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:43:32.10,5:43:34.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜琉璃桑，早安椎名
Dialogue: 0,5:43:34.58,5:43:35.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜晚上好
Dialogue: 0,5:43:35.66,5:43:36.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜西西桑
Dialogue: 0,5:43:40.76,5:43:42.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,变得摆动着呢
Dialogue: 0,5:43:45.11,5:43:46.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽然是想过
Dialogue: 0,5:43:47.98,5:43:50.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是该先主动搭话比较好呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:43:51.29,5:43:54.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「似乎正围着让人暖心的话题开心聊天呢」
Dialogue: 0,5:43:54.59,5:43:55.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: 0,5:43:59.22,5:44:01.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,委员长……和
Dialogue: 0,5:44:04.99,5:44:07.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没怎么说话呢……
Dialogue: 0,5:44:09.78,5:44:11.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,到西西酱那边
Dialogue: 0,5:44:11.99,5:44:13.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,就穿着睡衣失礼了
Dialogue: 0,5:44:13.26,5:44:14.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:44:14.89,5:44:16.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜本人，是月之美兔。话说回来，
Dialogue: 0,5:44:15.96,5:44:18.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这样啊和琉璃酱也没说话呢
Dialogue: 0,5:44:17.23,5:44:18.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜你好，月之美兔桑
Dialogue: 0,5:44:19.25,5:44:21.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜本人叫做琉璃
Dialogue: 0,5:44:24.02,5:44:25.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍有了解了
Dialogue: 0,5:44:27.71,5:44:29.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在聊鲜奶油蛋糕ww
Dialogue: 0,5:44:29.56,5:44:32.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「好像在放低姿态进行自我介绍」
Dialogue: 0,5:44:32.68,5:44:36.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我觉得普通的自我介绍就完全可以啊
Dialogue: 0,5:44:39.28,5:44:40.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,5:44:40.96,5:44:42.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,能好好相处吗
Dialogue: 0,5:44:44.05,5:44:47.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,隔开一定时间后再打招呼会比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,5:44:47.03,5:44:48.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,但是……诶？
Dialogue: 0,5:44:57.62,5:44:58.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,5:45:01.51,5:45:02.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么了……诶？
Dialogue: 0,5:45:01.80,5:45:02.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:45:03.36,5:45:05.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜我是月之美兔
Dialogue: 0,5:45:03.94,5:45:05.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,什么，什么，bug？
Dialogue: 0,5:45:05.82,5:45:09.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜月之美兔桑，初次见面，我是西西
Dialogue: 0,5:45:09.28,5:45:10.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉…
Dialogue: 0,5:45:11.03,5:45:13.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,电灯……Light ON，Light OFF……
Dialogue: 0,5:45:14.14,5:45:15.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像做了什么可怕的事刚才w
Dialogue: 0,5:45:16.95,5:45:19.59,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「好像想暴露范马勇次郎的秘密」
Dialogue: 0,5:45:20.44,5:45:21.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好在意！
Dialogue: 0,5:45:21.58,5:45:24.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,什么是，谁都不知道的范马勇次郎的秘密是什么？
Dialogue: 0,5:45:25.68,5:45:27.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我好在意
Dialogue: 0,5:45:28.75,5:45:30.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说了好多
Dialogue: 0,5:45:28.75,5:45:31.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜似乎和月之美兔桑会合得来！
Dialogue: 0,5:45:30.90,5:45:31.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,5:45:31.73,5:45:33.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说是合得来
Dialogue: 0,5:45:36.10,5:45:39.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，有点…认识之后…
Dialogue: 0,5:45:41.00,5:45:42.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,会有一点点不一样吗
Dialogue: 0,5:45:44.33,5:45:47.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个好像，出现像软绵绵的东西…
Dialogue: 0,5:45:48.13,5:45:50.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉像是很合得来的证明呢
Dialogue: 0,5:45:50.86,5:45:52.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不要吵架啊，与其说吵架……
Dialogue: 0,5:45:53.47,5:45:58.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像这样聊完之后，有时候会超消沉的哦
Dialogue: 0,5:46:03.30,5:46:05.84,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人，已经睡了呢～
Dialogue: 0,5:46:06.19,5:46:09.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微叫醒她，有点不好意思…
Dialogue: 0,5:46:12.95,5:46:15.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，莉泽大人都聊过了？
Dialogue: 0,5:46:15.14,5:46:16.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,5:46:17.73,5:46:19.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对不起，打扰你——
Dialogue: 0,5:46:19.73,5:46:20.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在睡梦中……
Dialogue: 0,5:46:21.19,5:46:22.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,5:46:25.62,5:46:27.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,吵醒了
Dialogue: 0,5:46:29.52,5:46:31.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，吵醒了
Dialogue: 0,5:46:31.67,5:46:35.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对不起——搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,5:46:38.65,5:46:40.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,已经解散了解散了
Dialogue: 0,5:46:40.82,5:46:43.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过至少看起来没消沉
Dialogue: 0,5:46:44.60,5:46:46.06,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,和委员长
Dialogue: 0,5:46:48.34,5:46:49.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:46:49.77,5:46:51.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我是石神望
Dialogue: 0,5:46:50.82,5:46:52.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,委员长，和望酱
Dialogue: 0,5:46:52.32,5:46:53.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜好哇，石神望桑
Dialogue: 0,5:46:54.19,5:46:56.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜我是月之美兔
Dialogue: 0,5:46:58.51,5:47:01.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之，脸熟了
Dialogue: 0,5:47:01.85,5:47:03.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像对全职猎人感兴趣ww
Dialogue: 0,5:47:03.81,5:47:05.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,全职猎人绝对没错呢
Dialogue: 0,5:47:06.82,5:47:09.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉想扩充一下对话卡组了呢
Dialogue: 0,5:47:11.64,5:47:14.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大体都是全职猎人，范马勇次郎……
Dialogue: 0,5:47:12.90,5:47:14.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜非常感谢！
Dialogue: 0,5:47:14.45,5:47:15.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽说好不容易做到……
Dialogue: 0,5:47:15.00,5:47:15.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜感觉和月之美兔桑
Dialogue: 0,5:47:16.02,5:47:18.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜变成了不错的关系
Dialogue: 0,5:47:18.71,5:47:20.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,关系变好了
Dialogue: 0,5:47:20.75,5:47:23.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好好，不错不错
Dialogue: 0,5:47:24.77,5:47:29.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过呢，岛上的居民还不太多的感觉
Dialogue: 0,5:47:29.66,5:47:31.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？一直盯着看
Dialogue: 0,5:47:33.77,5:47:35.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？又不看了
Dialogue: 0,5:47:41.52,5:47:45.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵酱……嗯…睡觉的时候，会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,5:47:46.00,5:47:47.64,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,先去克莱尔桑那边吧
Dialogue: 0,5:47:50.06,5:47:50.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,5:47:51.33,5:47:53.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说是无聊呢
Dialogue: 0,5:47:51.86,5:47:53.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜我们是初次见面吧
Dialogue: 0,5:47:53.62,5:47:54.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是正好吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:47:54.12,5:47:57.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜我叫修女克莱尔
Dialogue: 0,5:47:57.44,5:47:59.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜好哇，修女克莱尔桑
Dialogue: 0,5:47:59.55,5:48:01.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我是石神望
Dialogue: 0,5:48:02.87,5:48:05.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好了最初的话题是什么呢，你们二位
Dialogue: 0,5:48:07.85,5:48:10.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「修女克莱尔正在控诉应该改变这个家的氛围」
Dialogue: 0,5:48:11.40,5:48:14.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个的话向我控诉会比较好，克莱尔桑
Dialogue: 0,5:48:19.00,5:48:23.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,意外地，确实内装什么都没动呢
Dialogue: 0,5:48:24.73,5:48:26.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这么一说的话
Dialogue: 0,5:48:26.37,5:48:28.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，在你追我跑～
Dialogue: 0,5:48:30.54,5:48:31.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看起来很开心
Dialogue: 0,5:48:34.36,5:48:34.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,5:48:36.38,5:48:38.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃酱……
Dialogue: 0,5:48:38.96,5:48:41.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,谁和谁，怎么样呢……
Dialogue: 0,5:48:41.80,5:48:44.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，空露露回来了呢
Dialogue: 0,5:48:44.85,5:48:46.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在睡在睡
Dialogue: 0,5:48:47.39,5:48:49.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看起来没消沉太好了
Dialogue: 0,5:48:57.28,5:48:59.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔桑……还没聊过
Dialogue: 0,5:49:03.78,5:49:05.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,失礼了哟嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,5:49:04.91,5:49:06.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜我们是初次见面吧
Dialogue: 0,5:49:07.33,5:49:10.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜俺叫空露露
Dialogue: 0,5:49:08.44,5:49:10.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,该说是不读空气……w
Dialogue: 0,5:49:10.13,5:49:11.26,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还是该说吓人……
Dialogue: 0,5:49:10.25,5:49:12.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜空露露桑，初次见面
Dialogue: 0,5:49:11.40,5:49:12.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,压力
Dialogue: 0,5:49:12.99,5:49:14.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜我是修女克莱尔
Dialogue: 0,5:49:12.99,5:49:14.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事吗
Dialogue: 0,5:49:19.56,5:49:23.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「空露露好像在报告本应谁都不知道的岛的秘密」
Dialogue: 0,5:49:26.79,5:49:28.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错呢——
Dialogue: 0,5:49:29.73,5:49:34.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之慢慢来，大家是不是都成为熟人了
Dialogue: 0,5:49:37.49,5:49:38.49,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，委员长
Dialogue: 0,5:49:39.22,5:49:40.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,咦，咦，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,5:49:44.05,5:49:46.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜稍微有点烦躁
Dialogue: 0,5:49:45.24,5:49:47.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点烦躁？发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,5:49:48.45,5:49:52.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜和月野美兔聊天时，有点恼火
Dialogue: 0,5:49:52.82,5:49:55.55,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,刚才不是好像超合得来的样子吗
Dialogue: 0,5:49:55.81,5:49:57.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,什么啊……
Dialogue: 0,5:49:57.73,5:49:59.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,恼火了
Dialogue: 0,5:50:01.20,5:50:03.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,呃……要吃土豆炖肉吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:50:04.11,5:50:05.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我开动了
Dialogue: 0,5:50:08.03,5:50:10.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,鼓励方法…只剩吃饭了…
Dialogue: 0,5:50:11.54,5:50:13.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我…没有去搞那些
Dialogue: 0,5:50:14.01,5:50:15.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是还有更多吗?
Dialogue: 0,5:50:21.22,5:50:23.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜感觉心情变好了点
Dialogue: 0,5:50:22.13,5:50:25.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不过不过，心情能变好的话就……
Dialogue: 0,5:50:25.61,5:50:26.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也……行？
Dialogue: 0,5:50:27.00,5:50:27.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,也行
Dialogue: 0,5:50:31.52,5:50:32.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像想进去呢
Dialogue: 0,5:50:35.87,5:50:36.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,心情荡漾呢
Dialogue: 0,5:50:48.49,5:50:50.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？一起吃饭！
Dialogue: 0,5:50:50.93,5:50:52.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？望酱一个人？
Dialogue: 0,5:50:52.90,5:50:55.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等一下，谁谁谁…
Dialogue: 0,5:50:58.16,5:51:00.82,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵酱还没见过呢
Dialogue: 0,5:51:01.08,5:51:02.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等一下，我去拿过来
Dialogue: 0,5:51:05.16,5:51:06.97,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在睡觉吗？嘶但是但是
Dialogue: 0,5:51:07.99,5:51:09.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,毕竟是晚上……
Dialogue: 0,5:51:09.57,5:51:10.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,老师…？
Dialogue: 0,5:51:13.02,5:51:13.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,5:51:14.35,5:51:17.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜呃，怎么了呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:51:17.86,5:51:20.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜总之，想让你来一趟呢
Dialogue: 0,5:51:25.90,5:51:29.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个，去望酱那里…
Dialogue: 0,5:51:29.84,5:51:32.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,等一下，葵酱本身和其他…
Dialogue: 0,5:51:33.89,5:51:34.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,5:51:35.99,5:51:37.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「石神在吃一人食w」
Dialogue: 0,5:51:37.80,5:51:39.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不不不，就在这里…咦？
Dialogue: 0,5:51:48.38,5:51:49.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜晚上好
Dialogue: 0,5:51:55.42,5:51:56.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,一起……
Dialogue: 0,5:51:57.66,5:51:58.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,吃饭…
Dialogue: 0,5:52:00.32,5:52:01.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想让你去
Dialogue: 0,5:52:04.51,5:52:05.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,碰头
Dialogue: 0,5:52:06.44,5:52:08.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，西西酱也来了
Dialogue: 0,5:52:06.44,5:52:08.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜我们是初次见面吧
Dialogue: 0,5:52:08.73,5:52:10.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜葵我叫本葵
Dialogue: 0,5:52:11.26,5:52:12.73,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜好哇，本葵桑
Dialogue: 0,5:52:13.10,5:52:15.10,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,石神望｜我叫石神望
Dialogue: 0,5:52:13.89,5:52:16.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊好像在吃什么呢，好好吃的样子
Dialogue: 0,5:52:18.70,5:52:22.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，怕生，不对是脸熟了
Dialogue: 0,5:52:23.98,5:52:26.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像正在说自己的英勇传说
Dialogue: 0,5:52:29.97,5:52:31.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？变得要好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:52:32.41,5:52:34.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉合得来，不错不错
Dialogue: 0,5:52:36.44,5:52:37.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜多亏了您
Dialogue: 0,5:52:37.60,5:52:40.05,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵｜和石神望桑的关系变好了
Dialogue: 0,5:52:37.60,5:52:41.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，太好了，关系好像变好了
Dialogue: 0,5:52:45.76,5:52:48.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,已经有11万3000了啊……
Dialogue: 0,5:52:48.48,5:52:49.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,还挺有钱了嘛
Dialogue: 0,5:52:50.66,5:52:53.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，不错，好像要一起吃饭
Dialogue: 0,5:52:54.37,5:52:56.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么办接下来……西西酱
Dialogue: 0,5:53:02.38,5:53:05.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在睡梦中叫醒有点那个呢……
Dialogue: 0,5:53:07.41,5:53:08.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大体都
Dialogue: 0,5:53:09.88,5:53:12.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,都聊过天的…
Dialogue: 0,5:53:14.03,5:53:14.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉吧……
Dialogue: 0,5:53:17.25,5:53:18.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜主厨推荐料理
Dialogue: 0,5:53:19.29,5:53:21.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜完全不同的两道菜来了呢
Dialogue: 0,5:53:23.16,5:53:26.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我已经决定好想吃的了
Dialogue: 0,5:53:27.80,5:53:28.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,发生事件了
Dialogue: 0,5:53:28.21,5:53:29.83,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜其实我也是
Dialogue: 0,5:53:30.03,5:53:32.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,其实w……穿着睡衣就这样抱歉呢
Dialogue: 0,5:53:31.45,5:53:35.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜那么指向想吃的那道菜吧
Dialogue: 0,5:53:38.06,5:53:38.75,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哪边
Dialogue: 0,5:53:41.18,5:53:42.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,谜之紧张感…
Dialogue: 0,5:53:43.44,5:53:44.94,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，重了～
Dialogue: 0,5:53:45.91,5:53:47.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊等一下，噼啪噼啪…
Dialogue: 0,5:53:48.91,5:53:52.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之那样变得要好……变坏之类的事没有吧
Dialogue: 0,5:53:52.72,5:53:54.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好像在盯着看…
Dialogue: 0,5:53:55.59,5:53:57.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜深夜打搅了
Dialogue: 0,5:53:57.46,5:53:58.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,打搅了
Dialogue: 0,5:54:00.07,5:54:02.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是应该观察一下…
Dialogue: 0,5:54:02.72,5:54:04.31,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊，好像要出去…
Dialogue: 0,5:54:05.54,5:54:06.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在吃圣代w…
Dialogue: 0,5:54:06.95,5:54:08.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,指明的圣代…
Dialogue: 0,5:54:09.76,5:54:11.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊跑出来了…
Dialogue: 0,5:54:16.33,5:54:17.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没办法吗…
Dialogue: 0,5:54:22.72,5:54:26.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在聊被人听到该怎么办的话题
Dialogue: 0,5:54:26.23,5:54:26.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这两人呢
Dialogue: 0,5:54:29.49,5:54:31.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西酱在遥望天空
Dialogue: 0,5:54:37.02,5:54:39.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,拜拜～解散
Dialogue: 0,5:54:40.39,5:54:41.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,又回去了？
Dialogue: 0,5:54:47.06,5:54:48.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没吃饱吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:54:52.74,5:54:54.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜用杯子置换一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,5:54:54.89,5:54:56.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,杯子置换，那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,5:54:58.49,5:55:02.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「杯子置换。猜猜哪个杯子里有硬币」
Dialogue: 0,5:55:04.07,5:55:05.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜没托儿也没有机关～
Dialogue: 0,5:55:06.71,5:55:09.76,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜请好好看清楚硬币在哪里
Dialogue: 0,5:55:10.95,5:55:12.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,中间呢
Dialogue: 0,5:55:12.06,5:55:13.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜要开始了
Dialogue: 0,5:55:18.41,5:55:19.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,放进哪里了呢
Dialogue: 0,5:55:18.62,5:55:21.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊这个太简单了，左边
Dialogue: 0,5:55:24.59,5:55:26.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个可太简单了
Dialogue: 0,5:55:28.23,5:55:30.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？稍微变快了，但是
Dialogue: 0,5:55:30.82,5:55:33.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜老实说，我觉得右边没有……
Dialogue: 0,5:55:31.15,5:55:33.15,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,轻松呢，中间对吧
Dialogue: 0,5:55:34.14,5:55:36.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜主人，选择哪个呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:55:36.15,5:55:40.38,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,觉得右边没有，像这样施加精神打击
Dialogue: 0,5:55:41.27,5:55:42.51,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是中间对吧
Dialogue: 0,5:55:49.06,5:55:53.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,又变得快了一点，但再怎么说也看得出来呢
Dialogue: 0,5:55:54.15,5:55:54.50,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,5:55:54.52,5:55:56.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜主人，有好好看清楚吗
Dialogue: 0,5:55:55.28,5:55:56.91,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,稍微，出其不意了一下
Dialogue: 0,5:55:57.10,5:55:58.71,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看清楚了
Dialogue: 0,5:55:59.68,5:56:00.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好开心
Dialogue: 0,5:56:01.24,5:56:02.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜主人最棒了
Dialogue: 0,5:56:02.59,5:56:03.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嘛嘛嘛……
Dialogue: 0,5:56:03.47,5:56:05.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜放进哪个里面了呢
Dialogue: 0,5:56:05.06,5:56:06.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,中间
Dialogue: 0,5:56:09.07,5:56:11.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这个让人想起全职猎人的梧桐呢
Dialogue: 0,5:56:12.11,5:56:14.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,虽说不是用纸杯玩硬币
Dialogue: 0,5:56:19.14,5:56:20.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,5:56:20.63,5:56:22.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好……太好了太好了
Dialogue: 0,5:56:22.68,5:56:25.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜给你一个，请选择一个
Dialogue: 0,5:56:23.93,5:56:25.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,嘶……当然是大的
Dialogue: 0,5:56:28.57,5:56:29.65,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,5:56:30.59,5:56:33.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,收到了通贩节目
Dialogue: 0,5:56:36.97,5:56:40.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,家庭餐厅里放着超摇滚的歌呢
Dialogue: 0,5:56:47.71,5:56:49.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽露露之家
Dialogue: 0,5:56:49.75,5:56:51.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊真不错啊
Dialogue: 0,5:56:53.31,5:56:55.03,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉不错呢
Dialogue: 0,5:56:55.67,5:56:57.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,莉泽大人也没问题了
Dialogue: 0,5:56:58.21,5:56:59.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大体上
Dialogue: 0,5:57:01.86,5:57:03.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊抱歉，掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,5:57:03.46,5:57:04.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,5:57:06.33,5:57:06.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,5:57:08.72,5:57:09.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,5:57:10.40,5:57:11.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,摔倒了？
Dialogue: 0,5:57:13.36,5:57:15.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这种情况我去救……
Dialogue: 0,5:57:16.33,5:57:17.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,和被居民帮忙…
Dialogue: 0,5:57:18.50,5:57:19.79,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶等下，对不起ww
Dialogue: 0,5:57:20.50,5:57:23.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,刚才好像是在玩砂槌还是什么的东西
Dialogue: 0,5:57:25.04,5:57:26.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,5:57:25.31,5:57:26.56,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点紧急
Dialogue: 0,5:57:26.58,5:57:27.70,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜请救救我
Dialogue: 0,5:57:27.72,5:57:30.53,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,状态是其他人，那说不定正好
Dialogue: 0,5:57:30.77,5:57:33.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜原来如此，这会成为大工程哦！…
Dialogue: 0,5:57:33.96,5:57:35.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,正好
Dialogue: 0,5:57:34.44,5:57:36.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜还请您手下留情
Dialogue: 0,5:57:40.89,5:57:42.32,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔｜非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,5:57:41.77,5:57:43.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,初次见面就是帮助
Dialogue: 0,5:57:42.71,5:57:43.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜没事就好
Dialogue: 0,5:57:44.35,5:57:46.00,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,关系会变得更好吗
Dialogue: 0,5:57:55.39,5:57:56.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:57:58.69,5:58:00.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,能变好吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:58:02.04,5:58:03.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,大体上……
Dialogue: 0,5:58:03.18,5:58:06.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？三个人去餐厅了
Dialogue: 0,5:58:07.09,5:58:08.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？西西酱的话
Dialogue: 0,5:58:08.42,5:58:09.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊搞错了
Dialogue: 0,5:58:16.96,5:58:17.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,5:58:19.89,5:58:21.78,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,看起来很热闹呢
Dialogue: 0,5:58:24.24,5:58:25.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在聊什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,5:58:24.91,5:58:26.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜其实俺
Dialogue: 0,5:58:26.34,5:58:29.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜想着要换一个发型呢
Dialogue: 0,5:58:26.34,5:58:27.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是俺呢
Dialogue: 0,5:58:28.16,5:58:29.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,发型！
Dialogue: 0,5:58:30.36,5:58:32.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜你的那个发型…
Dialogue: 0,5:58:33.54,5:58:36.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜和我妈妈的一样，很喜欢呢
Dialogue: 0,5:58:34.17,5:58:35.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,5:58:37.33,5:58:41.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,说发型和妈妈的一样很喜欢什么的，不太会听到呢
Dialogue: 0,5:58:42.94,5:58:44.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜啊，好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,5:58:44.34,5:58:45.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,刚才的是什么……
Dialogue: 0,5:58:44.75,5:58:48.48,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜那件衣服很可爱呢，是最近流行的款式吧？
Dialogue: 0,5:58:45.92,5:58:48.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,啊！把话题转移了！
Dialogue: 0,5:58:49.00,5:58:51.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不是说那就算了吧之类的
Dialogue: 0,5:58:49.97,5:58:51.57,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜…是我收到的呢
Dialogue: 0,5:58:52.97,5:58:54.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜我不太懂这个…
Dialogue: 0,5:58:54.74,5:58:56.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没对上啊…！
Dialogue: 0,5:58:58.41,5:59:02.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,对话完全没对上，尴尬的空气流出来了没事吧
Dialogue: 0,5:59:01.72,5:59:05.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜请听我说，今天为了你
Dialogue: 0,5:59:03.05,5:59:04.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是不是能马上热烈起来什么的
Dialogue: 0,5:59:05.60,5:59:07.98,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜我穿了喜欢的衣服！
Dialogue: 0,5:59:05.80,5:59:06.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,明明是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,5:59:09.22,5:59:09.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜…不是…
Dialogue: 0,5:59:10.86,5:59:14.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜你不是一直穿着那件衣服吗
Dialogue: 0,5:59:14.32,5:59:15.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,你看，就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,5:59:17.42,5:59:19.18,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶为什么要说谎啊
Dialogue: 0,5:59:25.79,5:59:28.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点…有点微妙的气氛…
Dialogue: 0,5:59:29.05,5:59:30.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,这可……
Dialogue: 0,5:59:30.54,5:59:31.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,危险了吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:59:33.42,5:59:35.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,葵酱好像在吃披萨
Dialogue: 0,5:59:35.77,5:59:37.16,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,真好，肚子要饿了呢
Dialogue: 0,5:59:37.95,5:59:39.36,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,5:59:42.25,5:59:43.72,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,5:59:43.75,5:59:46.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,怎么感觉在勉强应付？
Dialogue: 0,5:59:47.44,5:59:48.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜早安椎名～
Dialogue: 0,5:59:50.84,5:59:52.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？新闻
Dialogue: 0,5:59:54.55,5:59:56.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为您播报空露露新闻～
Dialogue: 0,5:59:54.86,5:59:58.87,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜虽然很突然，为您插播一条新闻
Dialogue: 0,5:59:59.73,6:00:02.02,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜有一条令人振奋的消息
Dialogue: 0,6:00:02.04,6:00:03.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？是什么
Dialogue: 0,6:00:03.31,6:00:08.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜愿望喷泉现在追加了与现在的季节所匹配的愿望
Dialogue: 0,6:00:08.76,6:00:10.12,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,愿望喷泉……
Dialogue: 0,6:00:09.06,6:00:12.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜今后每次进入新的季节
Dialogue: 0,6:00:12.49,6:00:15.58,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜也许能实现新的愿望
Dialogue: 0,6:00:15.92,6:00:18.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜请去确认一下愿望喷泉
Dialogue: 0,6:00:20.34,6:00:21.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜好的
Dialogue: 0,6:00:20.34,6:00:21.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,6:00:22.05,6:00:25.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,空露露｜新闻速报，由空露露为您播报
Dialogue: 0,6:00:25.96,6:00:27.01,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,6:00:28.47,6:00:30.04,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好嘞然后
Dialogue: 0,6:00:31.50,6:00:33.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,新闻有新的了
Dialogue: 0,6:00:34.99,6:00:36.45,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,6:00:42.63,6:00:46.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜为您播报2026年5月7日的Mii新闻
Dialogue: 0,6:00:46.54,6:00:48.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,已经5月7日了吗……
Dialogue: 0,6:00:47.51,6:00:52.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜最近，那间冰淇淋店的服务在网络上成为话题
Dialogue: 0,6:00:53.48,6:00:56.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜前几天开业的「空露露岛ICE」
Dialogue: 0,6:00:56.09,6:01:00.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜会用顾客的脸装饰成冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,6:00:57.71,6:00:58.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,6:00:59.57,6:01:00.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,克莱尔桑……ww
Dialogue: 0,6:01:00.66,6:01:03.11,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜购买了冰激凌的修女克莱尔桑表示
Dialogue: 0,6:01:00.85,6:01:02.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好……糙
Dialogue: 0,6:01:03.41,6:01:04.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜真的和自己一模一样
Dialogue: 0,6:01:04.70,6:01:08.20,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,算了算了，太好了如果您能说和自己很像的话
Dialogue: 0,6:01:05.50,6:01:09.21,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜这样自拍的话绝对会火！一边兴奋的喘着粗气得说
Dialogue: 0,6:01:09.28,6:01:11.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「这不5点了吗？」已经5点了呢
Dialogue: 0,6:01:09.79,6:01:11.09,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜让我们问问街坊
Dialogue: 0,6:01:11.48,6:01:13.52,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,琉璃｜人各有不同嘛
Dialogue: 0,6:01:14.39,6:01:16.54,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,西西｜感谢您带来的感动！
Dialogue: 0,6:01:14.69,6:01:16.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,外景采访……ww
Dialogue: 0,6:01:18.33,6:01:18.92,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜好的
Dialogue: 0,6:01:19.94,6:01:22.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,美兔｜5点的新闻，由月之美兔为您播报
Dialogue: 0,6:01:19.95,6:01:21.95,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉会成为网络迷因
Dialogue: 0,6:01:25.31,6:01:28.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好了那就让我们暂时先结束吧
Dialogue: 0,6:01:28.27,6:01:29.74,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,毕竟都已经5点了
Dialogue: 0,6:01:32.98,6:01:34.62,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,愿望喷泉
Dialogue: 0,6:01:34.76,6:01:37.86,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,哦？募金9150日元，集了不少呢
Dialogue: 0,6:01:41.07,6:01:46.77,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,好，在空露露岛上呢，新的伙伴、收藏增加了很多呢w
Dialogue: 0,6:01:47.87,6:01:49.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,不，怎么说呢，不错呢
Dialogue: 0,6:01:50.13,6:01:53.13,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,像是能观察大家的动向之类的
Dialogue: 0,6:01:53.65,6:01:57.99,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,在观察的同时，我也能插手这种
Dialogue: 0,6:01:58.89,6:02:00.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点有趣呢
Dialogue: 0,6:02:00.76,6:02:03.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,想更多更多地增加，这样想
Dialogue: 0,6:02:04.37,6:02:06.47,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,总之可能呢，说不定在私底下
Dialogue: 0,6:02:06.75,6:02:08.93,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个，制作几位Liver之类的
Dialogue: 0,6:02:08.96,6:02:12.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能会展示给你们看，那个……
Dialogue: 0,6:02:12.94,6:02:14.40,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,只制作底子
Dialogue: 0,6:02:14.65,6:02:16.88,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,可能会弄成那样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,6:02:17.10,6:02:18.28,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后大家
Dialogue: 0,6:02:18.48,6:02:22.08,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,今天也感谢你们的观看
Dialogue: 0,6:02:22.11,6:02:23.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,黄金周也
Dialogue: 0,6:02:23.95,6:02:25.67,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,结束了呢
Dialogue: 0,6:02:26.06,6:02:28.23,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,今天是最后一天呢
Dialogue: 0,6:02:28.41,6:02:35.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,能和大家一起度过愉快的黄金周，我非常满足
Dialogue: 0,6:02:35.46,6:02:36.89,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后呢，呃……
Dialogue: 0,6:02:36.98,6:02:40.17,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,明天后天……后天的周末
Dialogue: 0,6:02:41.45,6:02:42.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,装甲核心的
Dialogue: 0,6:02:43.06,6:02:47.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,二周目，在X上也说过想玩一下
Dialogue: 0,6:02:51.43,6:02:53.80,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「扩展岛屿和增加角色吧」
Dialogue: 0,6:02:53.82,6:02:56.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,是呢，还想再增加更多
Dialogue: 0,6:02:58.40,6:03:01.30,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「充实的黄金周，非常开心」
Dialogue: 0,6:03:01.33,6:03:04.35,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家，我也很开心
Dialogue: 0,6:03:04.83,6:03:08.22,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,「只有最后一天好好看到了真是太好了」谢谢
Dialogue: 0,6:03:08.47,6:03:09.29,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,谢谢～
Dialogue: 0,6:03:09.74,6:03:14.68,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,各位也是，有休息的也有没休息的，虽说各种都有吧
Dialogue: 0,6:03:14.96,6:03:17.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个，取得适当的休息
Dialogue: 0,6:03:17.60,6:03:20.24,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,享受游戏和视频
Dialogue: 0,6:03:20.32,6:03:22.34,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那个内心的平静
Dialogue: 0,6:03:22.89,6:03:25.63,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,如果能取得平静的话就好了
Dialogue: 0,6:03:25.71,6:03:31.43,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,所以说，今天一天也谢谢大家。黄金周也谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,6:03:31.68,6:03:38.44,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,然后已经快早上了，希望大家今天都过得愉快
Dialogue: 0,6:03:38.79,6:03:39.61,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,6:03:40.26,6:03:40.90,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,下次
Dialogue: 0,6:03:41.33,6:03:43.39,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再会吧～
Dialogue: 0,6:03:43.44,6:03:45.42,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,辛苦露露～
Dialogue: 0,6:03:45.44,6:03:46.96,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再见了～
Dialogue: 0,6:03:46.99,6:03:49.60,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,下次再会，谢谢～
Dialogue: 0,6:03:50.28,6:03:51.41,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,再见了～
Dialogue: 0,6:03:52.94,6:03:53.66,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,6:03:54.25,6:03:56.25,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,（4分钟后还下不了播）
Dialogue: 0,6:08:04.02,6:08:05.19,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,关不掉……
Dialogue: 0,6:08:05.49,6:08:06.27,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,6:08:10.58,6:08:14.81,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,感觉，那个，可能有点奇怪了……
Dialogue: 0,6:08:15.33,6:08:17.07,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,请稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,6:08:38.58,6:08:40.14,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,我回来了～
Dialogue: 0,6:08:41.16,6:08:43.33,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,有点呢，好像关不掉
Dialogue: 0,6:08:43.67,6:08:45.46,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,呃……
Dialogue: 0,6:08:45.90,6:08:47.69,Default_p2,,0,0,0,,请稍等一下
